window.MP_ZH_DETAILS = {"100":{"summary":"光线从靠近前方（20°）摆动到直接在侧面（90°）；头上的阴影从新月形变成了一半，将脸从中间分开。","use":"适用于戏剧性、紧张或喜怒无常的肖像。","spec":["场景 1： y 150 处地平线前的头肩图形（头部中心 x 270，y 78，半径 29 像素，没有脸或头发）。背景变成更暗的场景（天空#E7E5E1）","光线：从画面左侧开始，角度20°→90°（平面图右下角，右上角读出“90°·↑0°”）","头：x = 270 + cos(angle)·√(29² − dy²) 的右侧是阴影#33405A，左侧是光#FFC75A； 90° 时，边缘是直线中心线","主体（半宽56 px）：x = 270 + cos(angle)·56 的右侧是阴影，左边缘的一条带被照亮","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The light swings from near the front (20°) to directly at the side (90°); the shadow on the head grows from a crescent to exactly half, splitting the face down the middle.","source_spec":["Scene 1: a head-and-shoulders figure in front of a horizon at y 150 (head centre x 270, y 78, radius 29 px, no face or hair). the background drops to a darker scene (sky #E7E5E1)","Light: from the left of the frame, angle 20° → 90° (plan at the bottom right, top-right readout \"90° · ↑0°\")","Head: right of x = 270 + cos(angle)·√(29² − dy²) is shadow #33405A, left is light #FFC75A; at 90° the edge is the straight centre line","Body (half-width 56 px): right of x = 270 + cos(angle)·56 is shadow, a strip on the left edge is lit","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For dramatic, tense or moody portraits."},"101":{"summary":"向侧面 45° 和向上 45° 的灯亮起；脸部的右侧陷入阴影，除了阴影侧脸颊上有一个小倒三角形的光线。","use":"适用于具有绘画、雕刻、经典外观的肖像。","spec":["场景 1： y 150 处地平线前的头肩图形（头部中心 x 270，y 78，半径 29 像素，没有脸或头发）。背景变成更暗的场景（天空#E7E5E1）","头部：x = 270 + 0.04·29 的右侧是阴影 #33405A，左侧是光 #FFC75A","受光三角形的三个顶点为 (x 270+0.24R, y 78−0.12R)、(x 270+0.7R, y 78−0.12R)、(x 270+0.24R, y 78+0.5R)，R = 29；约宽 13、高 18 像素，与亮面之间隔着约 6 像素宽的阴影。","主体：照亮中心左侧−0.45×56 px，阴影右侧+0.3×56 px；平面图显示光线为 45°，右上角读数“45°·↑45°”","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"A light 45° to the side and 45° up comes on; the right side of the face falls into shadow except for a small inverted triangle of light on the shadow-side cheek.","source_spec":["Scene 1: a head-and-shoulders figure in front of a horizon at y 150 (head centre x 270, y 78, radius 29 px, no face or hair). the background drops to a darker scene (sky #E7E5E1)","Head: right of x = 270 + 0.04·29 is shadow #33405A, left is light #FFC75A","Light triangle: (x 270+0.24R, y 78−0.12R), (x 270+0.7R, y 78−0.12R), (x 270+0.24R, y 78+0.5R) with R = 29 (about 13 px wide, 18 px tall), separated from the lit side by a shadow strip about 6 px wide","Body: lit left of centre −0.45×56 px, shadow right of +0.3×56 px; plan shows the light at 45°, top-right readout \"45° · ↑45°\"","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For portraits with a painterly, sculpted, classic look."},"102":{"summary":"脸前高处的一盏灯亮起；脸部两侧光线均匀，只有下巴下方有一个对称的小阴影。","use":"适用于修饰脸部的美容和时尚肖像。","spec":["场景 1： y 150 处地平线前的头肩图形（头部中心 x 270，y 78，半径 29 像素，没有脸或头发）。背景变成更暗的场景（天空#E7E5E1）","头部：完全照亮#FFC75A（无阴影面）","下巴下的阴影是一个椭圆，中心位于 y = 78 + 1.06R；横向半径 0.72R、纵向半径 0.38R（R = 29，分别约 21 和 11 像素），颜色 #33405A；头部覆盖椭圆的上部。","主体：在中心±0.8×56 px范围内点亮，细外条保持基色；平面图显示相机侧的光线（0°），右上角读数“0°·↑45°”","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"A light in front of the face and high above comes on; the face lights evenly on both sides and only a small symmetrical shadow falls under the chin.","source_spec":["Scene 1: a head-and-shoulders figure in front of a horizon at y 150 (head centre x 270, y 78, radius 29 px, no face or hair). the background drops to a darker scene (sky #E7E5E1)","Head: entirely lit #FFC75A (no shadow side)","Shadow under the chin: an ellipse centred at y 78+1.06R, 0.72R wide and 0.38R tall (R = 29, about 21×11 px), colour #33405A","Body: lit within ±0.8×56 px of the centre, thin outer strips keep the base colour; plan shows the light on the camera side (0°), top-right readout \"0° · ↑45°\"","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For beauty and fashion portraits that flatter the face."},"103":{"summary":"太阳落到地平线上方；天空和地面变成橙色，人的左侧被照亮，灯和树的影子向右侧延伸得很远。","use":"适合温暖、怀旧、温柔的图像。","spec":["场景 1： y 150 处地平线前的头肩图形（头部中心 x 270，y 78，半径 29 像素，没有脸或头发）。","太阳：半径 18 px，从 (x 110, y −30) 到 (x 96, y 136)，一半被山隐藏","颜色：天空#FAF9F7→顶部#FFE8BC，地平线附近#FFCF80，地面#F1F0EE→#F6DDB0；人物上的光#FFB547，阴影#3E3650","头部：光线从左侧约66°，阴影在边缘右侧；身体在左边亮，阴影在右边","阴影：从灯脚和树到右边，长度0 → 150 px (#DDAA6E)；右上角时间 12:00 → 17:40","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The sun drops to just above the horizon; sky and ground turn orange, the left side of the person lights up and the shadows of the lamp and tree stretch far to the right.","source_spec":["Scene 1: a head-and-shoulders figure in front of a horizon at y 150 (head centre x 270, y 78, radius 29 px, no face or hair). ","Sun: radius 18 px, from (x 110, y −30) to (x 96, y 136), half hidden by the hills","Colour: sky #FAF9F7 → #FFE8BC at the top and #FFCF80 near the horizon, ground #F1F0EE → #F6DDB0; light on the figure #FFB547, shadow #3E3650","Head: light from the left at about 66°, shadow right of the edge; body lit on the left, shadow on the right","Shadows: from the foot of the lamp and tree to the right, length 0 → 150 px (#DDAA6E); top-right time 12:00 → 17:40","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For warm, nostalgic, gentle-feeling images."},"104":{"summary":"太阳落山后，天空变成两条深蓝色，窗户和路灯亮起琥珀色，人也变成深蓝色的形状。","use":"适用于需要蓝天和发光灯光的城市和夜景。","spec":["场景 1： y 150 处地平线前的头肩图形（头部中心 x 270，y 78，半径 29 像素，没有脸或头发）。","太阳半径 18 像素，x = 120；效果进度达到 70% 前，太阳从 y = 40 下沉至 y = 190，并在效果进度 40%–80% 之间淡出。","天空顶部 #2C3B5E，地平线附近 #4A6191；地面 #283452，建筑 #34446B，人物 #1C2439。","每 3 扇窗有 1 扇亮起，路灯灯泡也变为 #FFC75A；灯泡周围叠加半径 13 和 8 像素的光环，颜色 #FFE3A3，不透明度分别为 35% 和 60%。","右上方时间 12:00 → 18:35","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"Once the sun has set, the sky turns two bands of deep blue, the windows and street lamp come on in amber and the person becomes a dark blue shape.","source_spec":["Scene 1: a head-and-shoulders figure in front of a horizon at y 150 (head centre x 270, y 78, radius 29 px, no face or hair). ","Sun: radius 18 px at x 120, sinking from y 40 to y 190 while the effect reaches 70%, fading out between 40% and 80%","Colour: sky #2C3B5E at the top and #4A6191 near the horizon, ground #283452, buildings #34446B, figure #1C2439","Lights: one window in three and the lamp bulb turn #FFC75A; flat rings of 13 px and 8 px (#FFE3A3 at 35% and 60%) around the bulb","Top-right time 12:00 → 18:35","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For city and night scenes that need both a blue sky and glowing lights."},"105":{"summary":"当光圈打开时，焦点内的人物保持清晰，后面的建筑物柔和，路灯和远处的灯光散布成大而苍白的圆盘。","use":"将人物或产品从背景中凸显出来，增添柔和的节日气氛。","spec":["场景二：街角； y 132–162 处道路后面的建筑物、树木和路灯 (x 114, 292, 494)；该人站在左前方（脚部坐标 x 176，y 200，124 像素高）。背景变成更暗的场景（天空#E7E5E1）","背景模糊（除了人物之外的所有内容）：0 → 6 px","灯光：三个灯（尺寸 1.25）和另外 12 个灯，间隔 45 px（y 44-114，尺寸 0.6-1.2，固定种子）；圆盘半径 = (2.4 + 15 × 效果) × 尺寸","散景光斑不透明度从 100% 降至 55%；路灯光斑为琥珀色 #FFC75A，远处光斑为 #FFE3A3，边缘有 1.2 像素宽的琥珀色轮廓。","人物保持清晰；右上角光圈由 f/16 变至 f/1.4（共 8 个光圈值、7 次整级变化）。","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"As the aperture opens, the in-focus person stays sharp, the buildings behind soften and the street lamps and distant lights spread into large, pale discs.","source_spec":["Scene 2: a street corner; buildings, trees and street lamps (x 114, 292, 494) behind a road at y 132–162; the person stands front left (feet at x 176, y 200, 124 px tall). the background drops to a darker scene (sky #E7E5E1)","Background blur (everything but the person): 0 → 6 px","Lights: the three lamps (size 1.25) and 12 more spaced 45 px apart (y 44–114, size 0.6–1.2, fixed seed); disc radius = (2.4 + 15 × effect) × size","Discs: opacity 100% → 55%, lamps amber #FFC75A, distant lights #FFE3A3, with a 1.2 px amber rim","The person stays sharp; top-right aperture f/16 → f/1.4 (8 stops)","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To lift a person or product off the background and add a soft, festive night mood."},"106":{"summary":"街道的顶部和底部波段模糊，而只有道路、汽车和小人物的中间波段保持焦点，因此街道看起来像一个模型。","use":"让城市或活动看起来像玩具模型世界。","spec":["没有大人物的街角（y 132-162 处道路后面的建筑物、树木和路灯）；四个 23-26 像素高的小人物站在人行道上（脚位于 y 172 处）；汽车每 5 秒从 x −60 行驶到 600","聚焦带：y 66–176 保持锐利","模糊量：y = 0–42 与 y = 190–208 从 0 增至 7 像素；y = 42–66 与 y = 176–190 从 0 增至 3 像素。","聚焦带边缘有 6 像素虚线、5 像素间隙，颜色 #8E8E93；不透明度为 0.75 × 效果强度。","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The top and bottom bands of the street blur while only the middle band with the road, the car and the small people stays in focus, so the street looks like a model.","source_spec":["The street corner (buildings, trees and lamps behind a road at y 132–162) without the large person; four small people 23–26 px tall stand on the pavement (feet at y 172); the car drives from x −60 to 600 every 5 s","Focus band: y 66–176 stays sharp","Blur: y 0–42 and y 190–208 go 0 → 7 px; y 42–66 and y 176–190 go 0 → 3 px","Dashed lines on the band edges (6 px dash, 5 px gap, #8E8E93 at 75%)","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To make a city or event look like a toy model world."},"107":{"summary":"街道转入夜色；行驶中的汽车几乎消失了，一条红色的尾灯线在车后延伸，白色和琥珀色的灯线沿着对面的车道延伸。","use":"在一张静态照片中展示车流或丝滑的水和云。","spec":["场景二：街角； y 132–162 处道路后面的建筑物、树木和路灯 (x 114, 292, 494)；该人站在左前方（脚部坐标 x 176，y 200，124 像素高）。颜色进入夜晚（天空#2C3B5E，三扇窗中的一扇#FFC75A）","汽车每 5 秒从 x = −60 移至 600；车身不透明度从 100% 降至 10%。","尾灯线：从 x −60 到汽车：#FF5B4D 2.6 px at y 145 和 #FF8A6E 1.4 px at y 149","对面车道：全宽线 #FFE9B8 2.6 px at y 135、#FFC75A 1.6 px at y 138.5 和 #FFE9B8 1.2 px at y 141.5（它们随效果淡入）","右上快门速度 1/250 → 8″","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The street turns to night; the moving car fades to almost nothing, a red tail-light line stretches out behind it and white and amber lines run along the opposite lane.","source_spec":["Scene 2: a street corner; buildings, trees and street lamps (x 114, 292, 494) behind a road at y 132–162; the person stands front left (feet at x 176, y 200, 124 px tall). colours go to night (sky #2C3B5E, one window in three #FFC75A)","Car: x −60 → 600 every 5 s; body opacity 100% → 10%","Tail-light line: from x −60 to the car: #FF5B4D 2.6 px at y 145 and #FF8A6E 1.4 px at y 149","Opposite lane: full-width lines #FFE9B8 2.6 px at y 135, #FFC75A 1.6 px at y 138.5 and #FFE9B8 1.2 px at y 141.5 (they fade in with the effect)","Top-right shutter speed 1/250 → 8″","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To show traffic flow, or silky water and clouds, in a single still."},"108":{"summary":"摄影机跟随移动的汽车：汽车在画面中央保持清晰，而只有其后面的建筑物、树木和灯光向侧面移动。","use":"在静态照片中显示汽车、自行车或跑步者的速度。","spec":["街角：y 132-162 处道路后面的建筑物、树木和路灯（前面没有大人物）","汽车：没有影响，它在 5 秒内从 x -80 行驶到 620；有了它，它保持在 x 270 ±10 px","条纹：背景在横向 46 像素范围内绘制 12 次并取平均值（范围 0 → 46 像素）","车轮：辐条线每 5 秒转动 12 次","右上快门速度 1/1000 → 1/15","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The camera follows the moving car: the car stays sharp in the middle of the frame while only the buildings, trees and lamps behind it streak sideways.","source_spec":["Street corner: buildings, trees and lamps behind a road at y 132–162 (no large person in front)","Car: without the effect it drives from x −80 to 620 in 5 s; with it, it stays at x 270 ±10 px","Streak: the background is drawn 12 times spread over 46 px sideways and averaged (spread 0 → 46 px)","Wheels: a spoke line turns 12 times per 5 s","Top-right shutter speed 1/1000 → 1/15","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To show the speed of a car, bike or runner in a still photo."},"109":{"summary":"当太阳从建筑物后面出来时，光线出现在建筑物周围，并且一排光点、六边形和一个环从太阳穿过画面中心到达另一侧。","use":"添加眩光、夏日阳光或电影般的灯光感觉。","spec":["场景二：街角； y 132–162 处道路后面的建筑物、树木和路灯 (x 114, 292, 494)；该人站在左前方（脚部坐标 x 176，y 200，124 像素高）。","太阳：半径 13 px，从建筑物后面 (x 428，y 74) 到开阔的天空 (x 474，y 30)","8 条琥珀色光线，从距太阳中心 17 像素处交替延伸至 26 或 44 像素处（长度分别为 9 和 27 像素）；线宽 1.6 像素，不透明度为 0.75 × 效果强度。","耀斑位于从太阳穿过画面中心的直线上，位置系数 t 依次为 0.45、0.8、1.15、1.45、1.75、2.0（t = 1 是画面中心）；依次为半径 7 的圆、13 的六边形、5 的圆、22 的六边形、9 的圆及 30 的圆环（线宽 3），单位均为像素。","光斑使用琥珀色 #FFC75A 和 #FFE3A3，不透明度为 40%–70% 乘以效果强度。","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"As the sun comes out from behind a building, rays appear around it and a line of light dots, hexagons and a ring runs from the sun through the centre of the frame to the opposite side.","source_spec":["Scene 2: a street corner; buildings, trees and street lamps (x 114, 292, 494) behind a road at y 132–162; the person stands front left (feet at x 176, y 200, 124 px tall). ","Sun: radius 13 px, from behind a building (x 428, y 74) to open sky (x 474, y 30)","Rays: 8, from 17 px out from the centre of the sun to 26 px or 44 px, alternating (9 px and 27 px long; amber, 1.6 px, 75%)","Flare: on the line from the sun through the centre at t = 0.45, 0.8, 1.15, 1.45, 1.75 and 2.0 (t = 1 is the centre): a 7 px circle, a 13 px hexagon, a 5 px circle, a 22 px hexagon, a 9 px circle and a 30 px ring (3 px line)","Colours amber #FFC75A and #FFE3A3 at 40–70% × the effect","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To add glare, summer sunshine or a cinematic light feel."},"110":{"summary":"街景中间凸出；建筑物的垂直线和道路的线向外弯曲，而角落则保持原样。","use":"用于大胆、有趣或类似窥视孔的视图（滑板、音乐视频）。","spec":["场景二：街角； y 132–162 处道路后面的建筑物、树木和路灯 (x 114, 292, 494)；该人站在左前方（脚部坐标 x 176，y 200，124 像素高）。","畸变：距中心 d 的点移动到原距离的 g 倍，其中 g = (1 + k) / (1 + k·d²/R²)，R 为中心至画角的距离（289 像素）。","k：0→1.25；中心放大2.25倍，四角不动","畸变前每隔 6 像素将轮廓分段，因此直线变成曲线。","右上焦距 24mm → 8mm","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The middle of the street scene bulges out; the vertical lines of the buildings and the lines of the road bow outward while the corners stay where they are.","source_spec":["Scene 2: a street corner; buildings, trees and street lamps (x 114, 292, 494) behind a road at y 132–162; the person stands front left (feet at x 176, y 200, 124 px tall). ","Warp: a point at distance d from the centre moves to g = (1 + k) / (1 + k·d²/R²) times that distance, R = distance from the centre to a corner (289 px)","k: 0 → 1.25; the centre is magnified 2.25×, the corners do not move","Every outline is cut every 6 px before warping, so straight lines become curves","Top-right focal length 24mm → 8mm","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For bold, playful or peephole-like views (skateboarding, music videos)."},"111":{"summary":"街道场景被分成红、绿、蓝三部分，三者以稍微不同的尺寸放在一起，因此红色和青色条​​纹出现在人、建筑物和灯的边缘，越向两侧越大。","use":"添加不完美的旧镜头、VHS 或故障感觉。","spec":["场景二：街角； y 132–162 处道路后面的建筑物、树木和路灯 (x 114, 292, 494)；该人站在左前方（脚部坐标 x 176，y 200，124 像素高）。","分色：图像分别与红色 #FF0000、绿色 #00FF00 和蓝色 #0000FF 相乘，形成 3 个副本，再在黑底上相加合成。","围绕中心缩放：红色 1 + 2s，绿色 1 + s，蓝色 1，其中 s = 0 → 0.02","偏移：红色和蓝色在左右边缘处相距约 11 px，在中心处相距 0","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The street scene is split into red, green and blue and the three are laid back together at slightly different sizes, so red and cyan fringes appear on the edges of the person, buildings and lamps, larger towards the sides.","source_spec":["Scene 2: a street corner; buildings, trees and street lamps (x 114, 292, 494) behind a road at y 132–162; the person stands front left (feet at x 176, y 200, 124 px tall). ","Split: the image is multiplied by red #FF0000, green #00FF00 and blue #0000FF into three copies and added back together over black","Scale about the centre: red 1 + 2s, green 1 + s, blue 1, with s = 0 → 0.02","Offset: red and blue end up about 11 px apart at the left and right edges, 0 at the centre","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To add an imperfect old-lens, VHS or glitch feel."},"112":{"summary":"画面从角落开始逐渐变暗，而中间的人和路则保持明亮。","use":"将注意力集中在拍摄对象上，或建议使用旧镜头。","spec":["场景二：街角； y 132–162 处道路后面的建筑物、树木和路灯 (x 114, 292, 494)；该人站在左前方（脚部坐标 x 176，y 200，124 像素高）。","形状：以框架为中心的椭圆形（垂直半径=水平×208/539×1.35）","距中心水平半径 334 像素的前 45% 区域透明；从该处向外，rgb(32,35,43) 的不透明度由 0 增至 0.7 × 效果强度，效果全开时最深为 70%。","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The frame darkens smoothly from the corners while the person and the road in the middle stay bright.","source_spec":["Scene 2: a street corner; buildings, trees and street lamps (x 114, 292, 494) behind a road at y 132–162; the person stands front left (feet at x 176, y 200, 124 px tall). ","Shape: an ellipse centred on the frame (vertical radius = horizontal × 208/539 × 1.35)","Clear out to 45% of the 334 px horizontal radius, then rgb(32,35,43) rising from 0% to 70% towards the edge","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To focus attention on the subject, or to suggest an old lens."},"113":{"summary":"风景和人物变成浅色，接近白色，阴影非常微弱，右下角直方图的驼峰移动到右端。","use":"适用于干净、明亮、柔和的产品照片和肖像。","spec":["场景 3：左侧半身像（头部中心 x 140，y 82，半径 28 像素），右侧是山丘、房屋、树木和太阳（x 432，y 54，半径 15 像素）。","颜色：天空#FAF9F7→#FFFFFF，山丘#EAEDF1→#F5F6F8，人物#4D5A75→#B9C0CE，阴影#33405A→#A6AEBF，太阳#F5A524→#FFD889","直方图（96×46 px，20条）：峰值中心0.56 → 0.85，宽度0.2 → 0.09","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The landscape and the person turn to light, near-white colours with very faint shadows, and the hump of the histogram at the bottom right moves to the right end.","source_spec":["Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. ","Colour: sky #FAF9F7 → #FFFFFF, hills #EAEDF1 → #F5F6F8, figure #4D5A75 → #B9C0CE, shadow #33405A → #A6AEBF, sun #F5A524 → #FFD889","Histogram (96×46 px, 20 bars): peak centre 0.56 → 0.85, width 0.2 → 0.09","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For clean, light, gentle product shots and portraits."},"114":{"summary":"大部分画面陷入黑暗，太阳熄灭；只有半身像的右边缘在侧面照明下保持明亮。直方图驼峰移至左端。","use":"适合奢华、紧张或神秘的图像。","spec":["场景 3：左侧半身像（头部中心 x 140，y 82，半径 28 像素），右侧是山丘、房屋、树木和太阳（x 432，y 54，半径 15 像素）。","颜色：天空#FAF9F7→#2B2D33，山丘→#313339和#36383E，地面→#24252A，人物→#25272E；太阳和它的光环染上了天空的颜色并消失了","半身像的发光右边缘保持不变，#FFC75A → #FFB547","直方图：峰中心0.56→0.14，宽度0.2→0.08","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"Most of the frame sinks into darkness and the sun goes out; only the right edge of the bust, lit from the side, stays bright. The histogram hump moves to the left end.","source_spec":["Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. ","Colour: sky #FAF9F7 → #2B2D33, hills → #313339 and #36383E, ground → #24252A, figure → #25272E; the sun and its rings take the sky colour and disappear","The lit right edge of the bust stays, #FFC75A → #FFB547","Histogram: peak centre 0.56 → 0.14, width 0.2 → 0.08","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For luxurious, tense or mysterious images."},"115":{"summary":"色彩从同一个风景中流失；太阳和人物身上的光线变成灰色，只能通过亮度来读取形状。","use":"追求永恒的感觉，或者当形状、光线和表达比颜色更重要时。","spec":["场景 3：左侧半身像（头部中心 x 140，y 82，半径 28 像素），右侧是山丘、房屋、树木和太阳（x 432，y 54，半径 15 像素）。","转换：每种颜色按亮度 0.2126R + 0.7152G + 0.0722B 转为灰度，并以 140 为中心将对比度乘以 1.25。","例如人物颜色 #4D5A75 转为 #4C4C4C，太阳 #F5A524 转为 #B5B5B5；通道值计算后四舍五入。","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The colour drains from the same landscape; the sun and the light on the figure turn grey and the shapes read only by their brightness.","source_spec":["Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. ","Conversion: each colour becomes the grey of its luminance (0.2126R + 0.7152G + 0.0722B), contrast ×1.25 around 140","For example the figure #4D5A75 → about #4D4D4D, the sun #F5A524 → about #B5B5B5","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For a timeless feel, or when shape, light and expression matter more than colour."},"116":{"summary":"同一风景的颜色被两种颜色所取代：黑暗中的靛蓝和明亮的粉色。","use":"用品牌颜色统一海报、音乐作品或社交图像。","spec":["场景 3：左侧半身像（头部中心 x 140，y 82，半径 28 像素），右侧是山丘、房屋、树木和太阳（x 432，y 54，半径 15 像素）。","两种颜色：#1F2A5C 为暗端，#FF9FB2 为亮端","转换：根据每种颜色的亮度 L，先将 (L − 70) / 180 限制在 0–1，再取 2.4 次方，即 t = clamp((L − 70) / 180, 0, 1)^2.4；按 t 混合两种颜色。","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The colours of the same landscape are replaced by a range between just two colours: indigo in the darks and pink in the lights.","source_spec":["Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. ","Two colours: #1F2A5C for the dark end, #FF9FB2 for the light end","Conversion: from each colour’s luminance L, t = ((L − 70) / 180)^2.4, and the two colours are mixed by t (this spreads the light tones apart)","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To unify posters, music artwork or social images in brand colours."},"117":{"summary":"在同一风景中，天空、山丘、地面和阴影人物变成青色，而人物的阳光照射边缘和太阳则变成橙色，形成互补的对比。","use":"打造具有强烈色彩对比的大片拖车式外观。","spec":["场景 3：左侧半身像（头部中心 x 140，y 82，半径 28 像素），右侧是山丘、房屋、树木和太阳（x 432，y 54，半径 15 像素）。","青色：天空#CFE6E3，山丘#8CC1BE 和#62A2A1，地面#3F8083，树木#2F6A6E，人物#1D4E53","橙色：人物上的光#FF9248，太阳#FF8236，太阳环#FFC48C","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"In the same landscape the sky, hills, ground and the shadowed figure shift to teal while the sunlit edge of the figure and the sun shift to orange, a complementary contrast.","source_spec":["Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. ","Teal: sky #CFE6E3, hills #8CC1BE and #62A2A1, ground #3F8083, trees #2F6A6E, figure #1D4E53","Orange: the light on the figure #FF9248, sun #FF8236, sun rings #FFC48C","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For a blockbuster, trailer-like look with strong colour contrast."},"118":{"summary":"整个同一幅风景中出现了细小的颗粒，颜色稍微偏向温暖的奶油色。","use":"去除干净的数字外观并添加模拟胶片纹理。","spec":["场景 3：左侧半身像（头部中心 x 140，y 82，半径 28 像素），右侧是山丘、房屋、树木和太阳（x 432，y 54，半径 15 像素）。","颗粒：2,600 方格（固定种子），0.8–1.7 像素； 约 55% 深色#3A3530，约 45% 白色","颗粒不透明度：16–38% × 效果；颗粒不移动（无闪烁）","颜色：每种颜色朝 #F2DDBE 方向移动 16%","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"Fine grain appears over the whole of the same landscape and the colours lean slightly towards a warm cream.","source_spec":["Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. ","Grain: 2,600 squares (fixed seed), 0.8–1.7 px; 55% dark #3A3530, 45% white","Grain opacity: 16–38% × the effect; the grain does not move (no flicker)","Colour: every colour moves 16% towards #F2DDBE","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To remove the clean digital look and add an analogue film texture."},"119":{"summary":"从同一风景的右边缘，有一条漏光带进来，里面是淡黄色，边缘是红色，慢慢地摇曳着。","use":"怀旧、夏日、偶然的回忆。","spec":["场景 3：左侧半身像（头部中心 x 140，y 82，半径 28 像素），右侧是山丘、房屋、树木和太阳（x 432，y 54，半径 15 像素）。","4 个高椭圆的中心位于画面右边缘外 30 像素处（循环中左右摆动 ±6 像素），垂直半径为画面高度的 1.1 倍。","水平半径和颜色：250 px #FFD089 at 35%、170 px #FF9A3D at 40%、95 px #FF5A3A at 45%、45 px #FF3B30 at 50%（水平半径和所列不透明度均乘以效果强度）","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"From the right edge of the same landscape a band of leaked light comes in, pale yellow on the inside and red at the edge, swaying slowly.","source_spec":["Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. ","Shape: four tall ellipses centred 30 px outside the right edge (swaying ±6 px over the loop), vertical radius 1.1× the frame height","Horizontal radius and colour: 250 px #FFD089 at 35%, 170 px #FF9A3D at 40%, 95 px #FF5A3A at 45%, 45 px #FF3B30 at 50% (each grows from 0 to this radius)","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For nostalgic, summery, accidental-looking memories."},"120":{"summary":"背景变成白色，山丘、房屋、树木和太阳的风景出现，按比例缩小，只出现在半身像的形状内。","use":"适用于将人与某个地方、一段记忆或内心世界联系起来的海报和封面。","spec":["场景 3：左侧半身像（头部中心 x 140，y 82，半径 28 像素），右侧是山丘、房屋、树木和太阳（x 432，y 54，半径 15 像素）。","背景：半身像外白色#FFFFFF","半身像内部放置同一风景的 0.7 倍缩小版本，使太阳位于头部右上方、山脊横过颈部。","内部颜色：天空#D3DBE6，山丘#9AA8BD和#76869F，地面#55647E，树木#3F4C66","过渡：双重曝光以效果量叠加在原始图片上","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The background turns white and the landscape of hills, house, trees and sun appears, scaled down, only inside the shape of the bust.","source_spec":["Scene 3: a bust on the left (head centre x 140, y 82, radius 28 px) and hills, a house, trees and the sun (x 432, y 54, radius 15 px) on the right. ","Background: white #FFFFFF outside the bust","Inside the bust: the same landscape at 0.7×, placed so the sun sits at the top right of the head and the ridge of the hills runs across the neck","Inside colours: sky #D3DBE6, hills #9AA8BD and #76869F, ground #55647E, trees #3F4C66","Transition: the double exposure is laid over the original picture at the effect amount","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For posters and covers that tie a person to a place, a memory or an inner world."},"121":{"summary":"一个方形角色会逆其行进方向向后拉，挤压并卷起，然后向前射出。","use":"在跳跃、冲刺或发射之前使用它来增强动作的力量和重量。","spec":["每 2.35 秒移动一次（每 4.7 秒移动两次：从左到右，然后从右到左）。带有白色箭头的珊瑚圆角正方形（86 像素，半径 24）。它从距离边缘 108 px 开始；下限位于 y = 178。","预备动作：0.2–0.95 秒，采用二次缓入缓出。图形逆移动方向后退 44 像素，压缩至宽 1.22 倍、高 0.76 倍，并向后倾斜 0.18 rad。","启动：0.95–1.38 秒（0.43 秒）。从后退位置移至远端，使用 backOut（s = 1.1）并略微过冲；在移动的前 60% 内，图形拉伸至宽 1.55 倍、高 0.72 倍（半正弦），并向前倾斜 0.08 rad。","着陆：从 1.38 s 开始，宽度和高度向相反方向摆动 0.13·e^(−7t)·sin(17t)。","启动时，起点出现 3 团尘土（在移动的前 70% 内消失），图形身后出现 3 条黄色速度线（宽 8）。"],"source_summary":"A square character pulls back against its direction of travel, squashes to wind up, then shoots forward.","source_spec":["One move per 2.35 s (twice per 4.7 s: left to right, then right to left). A coral rounded square (86 px, radius 24) with a white arrow. It starts 108 px from the edge; the floor is at y = 178.","Wind-up: 0.2–0.95 s, quadratic ease-in-out. It backs off 44 px against the direction of travel, squashes to 1.22 wide × 0.76 tall and leans back 0.18 rad.","Launch: 0.95–1.38 s (0.43 s). From the backed-off position to the far end with backOut (s = 1.1), a slight overshoot. In the first 60% of the move it stretches up to 1.55 wide × 0.72 tall (half sine) and leans forward 0.08 rad.","Landing: from 1.38 s, width and height wobble in opposite directions by 0.13·e^(−7t)·sin(17t).","At launch, three dust puffs at the start point (gone within the first 70% of the move) and three yellow speed lines (width 8) behind it."],"source_use":"Use it just before a jump, dash or launch to give the move build-up and weight."},"122":{"summary":"一个圆形的人物滑了进来，突然停了下来；只有它头上和尾巴上的旗子不停地摆动，然后又安定下来。","use":"将其用在头发、衣服、配饰或标志的装饰上，使附着在主体上的部件感觉有重量。","spec":["每 2.35 秒移动一次（每 4.7 秒移动两次，方向交替）。主体为薄荷色圆形（半径 38）；0.15–0.85 秒内移动 303 像素，前 30% 加速，随后匀速，并在 0.85 秒骤停。","旗帜由 58 像素白色旗杆和黄色旗面组成；旗杆角度遵循由主体加速度驱动的弹簧方程 a″ = −121a − 5.5a′ − 0.0175 × 加速度（固有频率 11 rad/s）。旗面在旗杆角度之外再弯曲旗杆角度的 0.6 倍。","尾巴由 7 段各 14 像素的珊瑚色片段组成，线宽从 13 递减至 7 像素；采用较慢的弹簧 b″ = −56b − 2.8b′ − 0.012 × 加速度。第 j 段使用 j × 22/600 秒（每段约 0.037 秒）之前的值，再乘以 (0.55 + 0.16j)。","两个弹簧均以 1/600 秒为步长预计算，绘制时只查取计算结果。","在每个动作的最后 0.3 秒，摆动会通过 smoothstep 淡化至 0，因此循环没有接缝。"],"source_summary":"A round character slides in and stops suddenly; only the flag on its head and its tail keep swinging, then settle.","source_spec":["One move per 2.35 s (twice per 4.7 s, alternating direction). The body is a mint circle (radius 38). It travels 303 px at 0.15–0.85 s: it speeds up over the first 30%, then keeps a constant speed and stops abruptly at 0.85 s.","Flag (58 px white pole with a yellow flag): its angle is a spring pushed by the body's acceleration, a″ = −121a − 5.5a′ − 0.0175 × acceleration (natural frequency 11 rad/s). The cloth bends a further 0.6 × the pole angle.","Tail: seven 14 px segments (coral, width 14→6) on a slower spring, b″ = −56b − 2.8b′ − 0.012 × acceleration. Segment j uses the value from j × 22/600 s (about 0.037 s) earlier, scaled by (0.55 + 0.16j).","Both springs are precomputed in 1/600 s steps; drawing only looks values up.","In the last 0.3 s of each move the swing is faded to 0 with smoothstep, so the loop has no seam."],"source_use":"Use it on hair, clothes, accessories or the trim of a logo, so that the parts attached to the main body feel weighted."},"123":{"summary":"球每次都会下落并弹起，直到静止。","use":"每当有东西掉落和落地时就使用它：一个图标、一个单词或一个应该感觉沉重和有弹性的产品。","spec":["每 2.35 秒落下一次（4.7 秒内两次：先黄色、后珊瑚色）；球半径 26。","从 0.1 秒开始，它从距地面 190 像素的高度掉落。重力 1900 像素/秒²；每次弹跳保持 56% 的速度（恢复 0.56）；当回弹速度低于 35 px/s 时停止。","它在 0.1–1.8 秒内横向移动 x = 150→390，并带有三次缓出。","每次撞击前后各 0.045 秒产生挤压：宽度 1 + sq，高度 1 − sq，sq 最大为 0.4 × min(1, 撞击速度 ÷ 850)。撞击速度超过 200 px/s 时，左右各闪出短白线，持续 0.3 秒。","影子随着高度的增加而变小。退出：1.95–2.25 秒，比例乘以 (1 − backIn, s = 2)。"],"source_summary":"A ball drops and bounces lower each time until it comes to rest.","source_spec":["One drop per 2.35 s (twice per 4.7 s: yellow first, then coral). The ball has radius 26.","From 0.1 s it falls from 190 px above the floor. Gravity 1900 px/s²; each bounce keeps 56% of the speed (restitution 0.56); it stops when the rebound speed is below 35 px/s.","Sideways it moves x = 150→390 over 0.1–1.8 s with cubic ease-out.","Squash for 0.045 s either side of each impact: width 1 + sq, height 1 − sq, with sq up to 0.4 × min(1, impact speed ÷ 850). Impacts faster than 200 px/s flick short white lines left and right for 0.3 s.","The shadow gets smaller with height. Exit: 1.95–2.25 s, scale multiplied by (1 − backIn, s = 2)."],"source_use":"Use it whenever something drops and lands: an icon, a word or a product that should feel heavy and springy."},"124":{"summary":"钟声不停地不规则地抖动：不是一次敲击，而是一种永远不会停止的轻微震动。","use":"将其用于通知、来电或任何需要引人注目的内容，或者添加一种不安的手持感觉。","spec":["黄色钟形在其顶部（中心，y = 34）旋转。它永远不会停止移动。","角度 = 四个正弦波的总和：每 4.7 秒 23、31、43 和 59 个周期（约 4.9、6.6、9.1 和 12.6 Hz），振幅 0.085、0.065、0.05 和 0.035 rad（当它们排列时，最高约 0.235 rad，13.5°）。","位置也会抖动：x 具有 29、47 和 61 个周期（4、3、2 像素），y 具有 37 和 53 个周期（2.4、1.8 像素）。","每个频率都是每 4.7 秒的整数个周期，因此循环连接起来；这些计数没有公因数，因此看起来不规则。","钟舌（珊瑚色，半径 13）向反方向摆动，位移为角度 × 70 像素；白色振动弧（半径 86 和 110，线宽 6）始终在两侧闪烁。"],"source_summary":"A bell keeps jittering irregularly: not one hit, but a small shake that never stops.","source_spec":["A yellow bell pivoting at its top (centre, y = 34). It never stops moving.","Angle = the sum of four sine waves: 23, 31, 43 and 59 cycles per 4.7 s (about 4.9, 6.6, 9.1 and 12.6 Hz), amplitudes 0.085, 0.065, 0.05 and 0.035 rad (up to about 0.235 rad, 13.5°, when they line up).","Position also jitters: x with 29, 47 and 61 cycles (4, 3, 2 px), y with 37 and 53 cycles (2.4, 1.8 px).","Every frequency is a whole number of cycles per 4.7 s, so the loop joins up; the counts share no common factor, so it does not look regular.","The clapper (coral, radius 13) swings the other way (angle × 70 px). White vibration arcs (radius 86 and 110, width 6) flicker on both sides the whole time."],"source_use":"Use it on a notification, an incoming call or anything that should catch the eye, or to add a restless, handheld feel."},"125":{"summary":"一颗心像心跳一样跳动，每次跳动两下，环环展开。","use":"将其用于点赞、录音或实时指示器或您想要按下的按钮，以使其感觉生动。","spec":["一颗珊瑚心。每 1.175 秒一次（每 4.7 秒四次）；每个节拍都是双重“lub-dub”。","令局部时间 t 为每 1.175 秒内的时间，G(c, s) = e^(−((t − c)/s)²)；缩放 = 1 + 0.26·G(0.2, 0.065) + 0.15·G(0.44, 0.07) + 0.26·G(1.375, 0.065)。最后一项在本周期内很小。","两个心形轮廓分别从 0.16 秒和 0.40 秒开始扩散，按 0.8 秒的进度以三次缓出从 1.2 倍放大至 2.4 倍；第二个轮廓在 1.175 秒周期结束时提前约 0.025 秒重置。","当它们展开时，它们的不透明度变为 0.75→0（第二个为 60%），线宽为 8.5→1.5 px。"],"source_summary":"A heart throbs like a heartbeat, a double beat each time, with rings spreading out.","source_spec":["A coral heart. One beat per 1.175 s (four per 4.7 s); each beat is a double \"lub-dub\".","Scale = 1 + 0.26·G(0.2 s, width 0.065) + 0.15·G(0.44 s, width 0.07), where G = e^(−((t − centre) ÷ width)²): a quick swell that drops straight back.","Two heart-shaped outlines spread from 0.16 s and 0.40 s: scale 1.2→2.4 over 0.8 s, cubic ease-out.","As they spread, their opacity goes 0.75→0 (the second at 60%) and the line width 8.5→1.5 px."],"source_use":"Use it for a like, a recording or live indicator, or a button you want pressed, to make it feel alive."},"126":{"summary":"一架纸飞机沿着一条虚线路径飞行，在飞行过程中转动并在途中绕圈飞行。","use":"每当有东西应该遵循设定路线时就使用它：飞行物体、汽车、地图上的旅程。","spec":["每 4.7 秒经过一次，从屏幕外左侧到屏幕外右侧。路径为 x = 270 + 112θ − 150·sinθ，y = 106 − 74·cosθ，其中 θ = −π→π，在顶部中心形成一个环。","θ 与时间成比例地前进（因此沿路径的速度不是恒定的；循环看起来更慢）。","飞机转向路径方向：角度 = atan2(74·sinθ, 112 − 150·cosθ)。","该路径预先显示为虚线（宽度 6，虚线 2/15）。接下来是 24 段（每段 0.03 θ）的薄荷痕迹，越往后越细、越淡。"],"source_summary":"A paper plane follows a dotted path, turning as it goes and looping the loop on the way.","source_spec":["One pass per 4.7 s, from off-screen left to off-screen right. The path is x = 270 + 112θ − 150·sinθ, y = 106 − 74·cosθ for θ = −π→π, which makes a loop at the top centre.","θ advances in proportion to time (so the speed along the path is not constant; the loop looks slower).","The plane turns to the path direction: angle = atan2(74·sinθ, 112 − 150·cosθ).","The path is shown in advance as a dotted line (width 6, dash 2/15). A mint trail of 24 segments (0.03 in θ each) follows, thinner and fainter towards the back."],"source_use":"Use it whenever something should follow a set route: a flying object, a car, a journey on a map."},"127":{"summary":"一个正方形移动到一端，然后沿着相同的路径返回，就像反向播放一样，一次又一次。","use":"将其用于装载机、闲置动画以及任何应来回重复而不会中断的移动。","spec":["每 4.7 秒往返一趟：向前播放 2.35 秒，然后向后播放相同的动作 2.35 秒（进度 g 从 0→1→0，线性）。","一个薄荷色的圆角正方形（48 px，半径 13）沿着三个高度为 62·|sin(3πg)| 的拱门从 x = 92 跳到 447，用 g 转动一整圈。","四个重影副本，间隔 0.045 秒，不透明度 0.1–0.4。","下面的播放栏：前进时带有播放标签的蓝色，后退时带有反向标签的珊瑚色。进度条及其旋钮跟随 g。","垂直的柱子标志着两个转折点。"],"source_summary":"A square travels to one end, then comes back along the same path as if played in reverse, again and again.","source_spec":["One round trip per 4.7 s: 2.35 s forward, then the same motion played backwards for 2.35 s (progress g goes 0→1→0, linear).","A mint rounded square (48 px, radius 13) hops from x = 92 to 447 along three arches of height 62·|sin(3πg)|, turning one full turn with g.","Four ghost copies, 0.045 s apart, opacity 0.1–0.4.","A playback bar below: blue with a play label while going forward, coral with a reverse label while going back. The progress bar and its knob follow g.","Vertical posts mark the two turning points."],"source_use":"Use it for loaders, idle animations and any move that should repeat back and forth without a cut."},"128":{"summary":"一颗星星以大约每秒 8 帧的速度以断断续续的步伐跳跃，每一帧都略有偏差。","use":"当平滑的动作感觉过于光滑时，可将其用于手工制作、粘土动画或拼贴画效果。","spec":["每 4.7 秒绘制 38 帧（每秒约 8 帧，每帧保持约 0.124 秒）；只显示这些帧，帧与帧之间不另行绘制。","黄色星星（半径 38）按 x = lerp(−44, 583, t) 和三个高度为 54·|sin(3πt)| 的拱形运动并转两圈；t = 帧号/38，实际最后一帧为 37/38，之后循环重置。","每个帧都有固定的随机抖动：位置横向±5 px，上下±4.5 px，旋转±0.15 rad，尺寸±5%。","前两帧仍然隐约可见（不透明度 0.28 和 0.12），就像洋葱皮一样。","黑色胶片带顶部和底部（各 26 像素，带链轮孔）和每秒帧数标签。"],"source_summary":"A star hops across in choppy steps at about 8 frames per second, each frame slightly off.","source_spec":["38 frames per 4.7 s (about 8 per second, each held for about 0.124 s). Only those frames are drawn; nothing is drawn in between.","A yellow star (radius 38) hops from x = −44 to 583 along three arches of height 54·|sin(3πt)|, turning twice.","Each frame gets a fixed random jitter: position ±5 px across and ±4.5 px up and down, rotation ±0.15 rad, size ±5%.","The previous two frames stay faintly visible (opacity 0.28 and 0.12), like onion skin.","Black film-strip bands top and bottom (26 px each, with sprocket holes) and a frames-per-second label."],"source_use":"Use it for a handmade, claymation or collage look, when smooth motion feels too slick."},"129":{"summary":"随机字符不断变化，然后从左到右锁定到正确的单词。","use":"用它来引入带有解码、黑客或科技感觉的标题、数字或代号。","spec":["前 2.35 秒为“你好新世界”，后 2.35 秒为“一起向前行”。共五个等宽字符位（字号 92 像素）。","尚未锁定的字符位显示 A–Z（不含 I 和 O）、0–9 和 #$%&@? 中的随机字符，每 4.7 秒改变 76 次（约每 0.062 秒一次），薄荷色、不透明度 75%。","字符位从左到右锁定：第 i 位在 0.45 + 0.18i 秒锁定（最后一位在 1.17 秒）；新锁定字母保持黄色 0.22 秒后变白，缩放按 1 + 0.2·e^(−14t) 收敛。","从 1.85 秒起，字符位从右向左恢复随机：第 i 位时间为 1.85 + 0.08 × (4 − i) 秒。","每个插槽下方都有一个横条：锁定时为蓝色，下一个锁定时为黄色，否则为海军蓝。"],"source_summary":"Random characters keep changing, then lock into the right word from left to right.","source_spec":["\"HELLO\" in the first 2.35 s, \"WORLD\" in the second. Five monospaced letters (92 px).","Unsettled slots show random characters from A–Z (without I and O), 0–9 and #$%&@?, changing 76 times per 4.7 s (about every 0.062 s), mint at 75% opacity.","Slots lock from left to right: slot i at 0.45 + 0.18i s (the last at 1.17 s). A newly locked letter is yellow for 0.22 s, then white, settling with scale 1 + 0.2·e^(−14t).","From 1.85 s the slots return to random from right to left (slot i at 1.85 + 0.08 × (4 − i) s).","A bar under each slot: blue when locked, yellow for the next one to lock, navy otherwise."],"source_use":"Use it to bring in a headline, a number or a code name with a decoding, hacker or tech feel."},"130":{"summary":"“波浪文字”的字符一个接一个地起伏，就像波浪一样。","use":"将其用于徽标、短标题或与音乐同步的标题，以增加乐趣和节奏。","spec":["“波浪文字”（70 像素，粗体，4 像素字间距）。每 4.7 秒三个波（每个波约 1.567 秒）。","字母 i = −28·sin(φ − 0.62i) 的垂直偏移，其中 φ = 2π × 3 × time ÷ 4.7（每个字母滞后前一个字母 0.62 rad）。","上升的字母垂直拉伸 (1 + 0.06·s) 并从白色转向黄色（s 是正弦值，颜色限制为 0–1）。","每个字母下方的阴影椭圆随着字母的上升而缩小。"],"source_summary":"The letters of \"WAVE TEXT\" rise and fall one after another, like a wave.","source_spec":["\"WAVE TEXT\" (70 px, bold, 4 px letter spacing). Three waves per 4.7 s (1.567 s per wave).","Vertical offset of letter i = −28·sin(φ − 0.62i), with φ = 2π × 3 × time ÷ 4.7 (each letter lags the previous by 0.62 rad).","Rising letters stretch vertically (1 + 0.06·s) and shift from white towards yellow (s is the sine value, clamped to 0–1 for the colour).","A shadow ellipse under each letter shrinks as the letter rises."],"source_use":"Use it on a logo, a short heading or a caption timed to music, to add fun and rhythm."},"131":{"summary":"一行文本沿着波浪线流动，每个字母都跟随它转动。","use":"使用它可以沿着形状运行文本：围绕徽标、沿着道路、河流或波浪，或者作为循环文本带。","spec":["路径：y = 118 + 42·sin(2πx / 330 + 0.6)，从 x = −70 起每 4 像素采样，最后采样到 x = 606（循环上限为 609）；下方 6 像素处绘制深蓝色虚线（14/10，线宽 5）。","重复“沿线文字 • ”（42 像素，粗体，2 像素字间距）。每个字符都放置在路径上其弧长位置，并旋转到路径方向。","文本每 4.7 秒沿着路径移动一份字符串的长度，因此循环连接起来。","文字为白色；圆点符号为黄色。"],"source_summary":"A line of text flows along a wavy line, each letter turning to follow it.","source_spec":["Path: y = 118 + 42·sin(2πx ÷ 330 + 0.6) for x = −70 to 609, shown 6 px below as a navy dashed line (14/10, width 5).","\"ALONG THE LINE • \" (42 px, bold, 2 px letter spacing) is repeated. Each character is placed at its arc-length position on the path and rotated to the path direction.","The text moves along the path by the length of one copy of the string every 4.7 s, so the loop joins up.","Letters are white; the bullet is yellow."],"source_use":"Use it to run text along a shape: around a logo, along a road, river or wave, or as a looping band of text."},"132":{"summary":"同一个单词可以顺利地从细到非常粗再返回，下面的滑块显示粗细。","use":"将其用在标题、徽标或单个单词上，通过字母本身来表达响度或情感。","spec":["“运动”（112 像素，system-ui 字体，字间距 2 像素）。字重每 4.7 秒往返两次：v = 0.5 − 0.5·cos(2π × 2 × time ÷ 4.7)，两端缓动。","字重 = round(100 + 800v)，范围 100–900，直接设置为字体粗细；实际显示是否连续变化取决于浏览器选用的字体是否支持对应字重。","下方滑块从 x = 112 至 427，y = 180，左侧标细、右侧标粗。黄色滑块圆钮（半径 14）跟随 v 移动，当前字重显示在其上方。"],"source_summary":"The same word goes smoothly from thin to very bold and back, with a slider below showing the weight.","source_spec":["\"MOTION\" (112 px, system-ui, 2 px letter spacing). The weight goes back and forth twice per 4.7 s: v = 0.5 − 0.5·cos(2π × 2 × time ÷ 4.7), which eases at both ends.","Weight = round(100 + 800v), from 100 to 900, set directly as the font weight.","A slider below (x = 112→427, y = 180) labelled thin on the left and bold on the right. The knob (yellow, radius 14) follows v, with the current weight shown above it."],"source_use":"Use it on a title, a logo or a single word to show loudness or emotion through the letters themselves."},"133":{"summary":"厚重的字母被剪掉，这样移动的海景只出现在字母内部；接近周期结束时，整个画面就会出现。","use":"用它来显示标题或品牌名称中的照片或片段，将单词和图片放在一起。","spec":["“海洋”（字重 900，system-ui，字间距 2 像素）。字号从 172 像素开始，在文字宽度大于 500 像素且字号高于 90 像素时每次减 2 像素；最低缩至 90 像素。","里面的场景不断移动：珊瑚天空，黄色的太阳摆动±6像素，y = 116下方的蓝色大海，四根白色波浪线每4.7秒交替漂流240像素，一艘帆船每4.7秒穿越一次，云漂流60像素。","方法：在屏幕外的画布上绘制单词，然后使用source-in将场景合成到上面，这样场景就只保留在字母内部。字母周围有 4 像素的白色轮廓。","字母之外的场景显示为 12% 的不透明度；它在 3.45–3.85 s 时上升到 100%，并在 4.25–4.65 s 时返回到 12%（平滑步）。"],"source_summary":"Heavy letters are cut out so that a moving seascape shows only inside them; near the end of the cycle the whole picture appears.","source_spec":["\"OCEAN\" (weight 900, system-ui, 2 px letter spacing). The font size starts at 172 px and drops 2 px at a time until the word is at most 500 px wide.","The scene inside keeps moving: coral sky, a yellow sun bobbing ±6 px, blue sea below y = 116 with four white wavy lines drifting 240 px per 4.7 s in alternating directions, a sailboat crossing once per 4.7 s, clouds drifting 60 px.","Method: draw the word on an offscreen canvas, then composite the scene onto it with source-in, so the scene remains only inside the letters. A white 4 px outline around the letters.","Outside the letters the scene shows at 12% opacity; it rises to 100% at 3.45–3.85 s and returns to 12% at 4.25–4.65 s (smoothstep)."],"source_use":"Use it to show a photo or footage inside a title or brand name, putting the word and the picture together."},"134":{"summary":"围绕一个圆复制一个形状，并且副本会稍微不同步地旋转和脉动。","use":"将其用于装载机、背景图案、花朵或射线：任何由一种形状重复构建的东西。","spec":["将圆条（24 × 60，半径 12）围绕中心半径为 58 的圆复制最多 12 次，每次都朝外（角度 + 90°）。","数量：0.35–1.7 秒从 1 增至 12，3.6–4.45 秒从 12 减至 1（二次缓入缓出）。每个新副本从前一个位置滑至自己的位置，沿圆周再前进 30°（三次缓出）。","整个环每 4.7 秒转一圈；完整显示的副本按 1 + 0.22·sin(2π×2t/4.7 − 0.55i) 脉动。副本出现或消失时，缩放还要乘以 0.55 + 0.45×可见进度。","颜色有蓝色、珊瑚色、黄色、薄荷色。原件有白色轮廓。右上角有一个“×N”计数器。"],"source_summary":"One shape is duplicated around a circle, and the copies turn and pulse slightly out of step.","source_spec":["A rounded bar (24 × 60, radius 12) is copied up to 12 times around a circle of radius 58 at the centre, each turned to face outward (angle + 90°).","Count: 1→12 at 0.35–1.7 s and 12→1 at 3.6–4.45 s (quadratic ease-in-out). Each new copy slides from the previous slot to its own, 30° further on (cubic ease-out).","The whole ring turns once per 4.7 s. Each copy pulses in size by 1 ± 0.22 twice per 4.7 s, each one 0.55 rad later than the last, so a ripple runs round the ring.","Colours go blue, coral, yellow, mint. The original copy has a white outline. A \"×N\" counter at the top right."],"source_use":"Use it for loaders, background patterns, flowers or rays: anything built from one shape repeated."},"135":{"summary":"八向对称图案从中心旋转并展开，就像万花筒一样。","use":"将其用于音乐视频、现场背景或梦幻般的场景变化，只要模式必须保持重复。","spec":["中心周围的区域被分成八个 45° 的楔形；每隔一个楔形都被绘制成镜像，形成八个镜像对称截面。","一个楔子可容纳 13 种形状（圆形、菱形、三角形；四种颜色；固定随机种子）。它们从中心向外行进至半径 300（每 4.7 秒一个完整半径），然后绕回中心。","形状随着向外延伸而增大 ((5 + 0.1r) × 0.7–1.4)，每像素旋转 0.02 rad。它们在前 30 像素内淡入，在最后 70 像素内淡出；每 4.7 秒摆动一次 ±0.08 rad。","整个图案每 4.7 秒旋转 90°（两个楔形，因此循环连接起来）。","中心有一颗白色八角星（半径 20 ± 4，每 4.7 秒脉冲两次）。"],"source_summary":"An 8-way symmetrical pattern turns and spreads out from the centre, like a kaleidoscope.","source_spec":["The area around the centre is split into eight 45° wedges; every other wedge is drawn mirrored, giving eight mirror-symmetric sections.","One wedge holds 13 shapes (circles, diamonds, triangles; four colours; fixed random seed). They travel outward from the centre to radius 300, one full radius per 4.7 s, wrapping back to the centre.","Shapes grow as they go out ((5 + 0.1r) × 0.7–1.4) and spin 0.02 rad per px. They fade in over the first 30 px and out over the last 70 px; each sways ±0.08 rad once per 4.7 s.","The whole pattern turns 90° per 4.7 s (two wedges, so the loop joins up).","A white eight-point star at the centre (radius 20 ± 4, pulsing twice per 4.7 s)."],"source_use":"Use it for music videos, live backdrops or dreamy scene changes, wherever a pattern has to hold up on repeat."},"136":{"summary":"手绘线条图片每隔几帧就会晃动一次，而图片本身却保持静止。","use":"在手绘插图、图标或字母上使用它，甚至可以让静态图片感觉像是手绘的。","spec":["静止的线条画（一颗黄色的星星，一朵白云，薄荷色的闪光笔触，一条微弱的底线）。线宽 6-8，圆帽。","绘图不动。每 4.7 秒（大约每 0.1 秒）重绘每个点 47 次，x 和 y 方向的固定随机偏移最多为 ±3.5 px。","每条线先转换为一串点（间距 6–13 像素；云轮廓有 96 个点），再通过相邻点之间的中点绘制二次曲线，形成手绘逐帧抖动感。","偏移量是帧号和点号的哈希值，因此同一帧看起来总是相同的。"],"source_summary":"A hand-drawn line picture wobbles every few frames while the picture itself stays still.","source_spec":["A still line drawing (a yellow star, a white cloud, mint sparkle strokes, a faint ground line). Line widths 6–8, round caps.","The drawing does not move. 47 times per 4.7 s (about every 0.1 s) every point is redrawn with a fixed random offset of up to ±3.5 px in x and in y.","Each line is first turned into a row of points (every 6–13 px; 96 points round the cloud) and drawn as quadratic curves through the midpoints between them, so it wobbles like hand-drawn frames.","The offsets are a hash of the frame number and the point number, so the same frame always looks the same."],"source_use":"Use it on hand-drawn illustrations, icons or lettering to make even a still picture feel drawn by hand."},"137":{"summary":"下一个场景从侧面滑入，并将当前场景一起推出。","use":"当变化应该感觉连续且向前推进时，可以使用它来逐步浏览幻灯片、照片或步骤。","spec":["海景 → 山景 → 海景，每次切换占 2.35 秒；每半周期的 0.45–1.6 秒完成切换（1.15 秒），采用三次缓入缓出。","两个场景保持连接并一起移动整个帧宽度（539 像素）；没有重叠，没有褪色。","方向：海→山向左移动（下一场景从右侧进入）；山→海右移。","一条海军线（宽度为 6）标志着两个场景之间的接缝。"],"source_summary":"The next scene slides in from the side and pushes the current one out with it.","source_spec":["Sea scene → mountain scene → sea scene, 2.35 s each. The change runs at 0.45–1.6 s of each half (1.15 s), cubic ease-in-out.","The two scenes stay joined and move together by the full frame width (539 px); no overlap and no fade.","Direction: sea→mountain moves left (the next scene enters from the right); mountain→sea moves right.","A navy line (width 6) marks the seam between the two scenes."],"source_use":"Use it to step through slides, photos or steps, when the change should feel continuous and moving forward."},"138":{"summary":"一排细条中的间隙逐渐变宽，直到下一个场景完全打开。","use":"使用它可以在两个场景之间清晰切换，例如白天和黑夜或之前和之后，或者营造复古的感觉。","spec":["白天场景→夜景→白天，每个2.35秒。七个水平条带（每个 208 ÷ 7 ≈ 29.7 像素）。","0.4–1.65 秒（历时 1.25 秒），采用二次缓入缓出：所有条带同时从顶部向下显现下一场景，显现高度从 0 增至完整条带高度。","之前的场景保留在下面。两张照片都没有动。"],"source_summary":"Gaps in a row of thin strips widen until the next scene is fully open.","source_spec":["Day scene → night scene → day, 2.35 s each. Seven horizontal strips (208 ÷ 7 ≈ 29.7 px each).","0.4–1.65 s (1.25 s), quadratic ease-in-out: in every strip at once, the next scene is revealed from the strip's top edge downward, opening from 0 to the full strip height.","The previous scene stays underneath. Neither picture moves."],"source_use":"Use it for a clear switch between two scenes, such as day and night or before and after, or for a retro feel."},"139":{"summary":"就像一个旋转的立方体一样，前面的面会摆动，而下一个面会变圆。","use":"用它来展示一个又一个具有深度感的产品、计划或屏幕。","spec":["A 面（珊瑚上的“A”）和 B 面（薄荷上的“B”），每个 250 × 146。每个 2.35 s，A→B→A。","以 0.45–1.6 s (1.15 s) 的速度旋转 0→90°，三次缓入缓出，围绕穿过立方体中心的垂直轴（深度等于面宽，250）。","视角：相机距离 820 像素。每个面都绘制为 2 px 垂直切片，每个切片的大小和放置均按其透视系数进行。","转出的面逐渐变暗，最多 55%（0.55·sinφ）；转入的面从 55% 的变暗程度逐渐变亮（0.55·cosφ）。地面阴影跟随可见宽度变化。"],"source_summary":"Like a turning cube, the front face swings away and the next face comes round.","source_spec":["Face A (an \"A\" on coral) and face B (a \"B\" on mint), each 250 × 146. 2.35 s each, A→B→A.","Rotation 0→90° at 0.45–1.6 s (1.15 s), cubic ease-in-out, around a vertical axis through the centre of the cube (depth equal to the face width, 250).","Perspective: camera distance 820 px. Each face is drawn as 2 px vertical slices, each sized and placed by its perspective factor.","The face turning away darkens up to 55% (0.55·sinφ); the incoming face starts 55% dark and brightens (0.55·cosφ). The floor shadow follows the visible width."],"source_use":"Use it to show products, plans or screens one after another with a sense of depth."},"140":{"summary":"一页从其一角剥离并折叠起来，露出下面的下一页。","use":"将其用于书籍、目录、相册或章节中断，纸张的感觉或阅读内容适合内容。","spec":["第 1 页（白色）→ 第 2 页（奶油色）→ 第 1 页，每页 2.35 秒。卷曲从右下角开始，0.35–1.75 秒（1.4 秒），二次缓入缓出。","折叠线从角点沿方向 (−1, −0.42) 移动，标准化，0→600 px。","折叠线以外的部分镜像穿过它，形成翻盖、页面背面（浅灰色或米色），带有阴影（模糊 14，偏移 4、4）和白色 2 px 边缘。","下一页显示了纸张抬起的位置，沿折叠处有 50 像素的阴影渐变。"],"source_summary":"A page peels back from its corner and folds over, revealing the next page beneath.","source_spec":["Page 1 (white) → page 2 (cream) → page 1, 2.35 s each. The curl starts at the bottom-right corner, 0.35–1.75 s (1.4 s), quadratic ease-in-out.","The fold line moves from the corner in the direction (−1, −0.42), normalised, by 0→600 px.","The part beyond the fold line is mirrored across it to form the flap, the back of the page (light grey or beige), with a drop shadow (blur 14, offset 4, 4) and a white 2 px edge.","The next page shows where the paper has lifted, with a 50 px shadow gradient along the fold."],"source_use":"Use it for books, catalogues, albums or chapter breaks, where a paper feel or reading on suits the content."},"141":{"summary":"图像变成越来越粗糙的块，在最粗糙的点切换，然后再次锐化。","use":"使用它进行类似游戏、复古或数字场景的更改，或者在场景切换时模糊某些内容。","spec":["田野场景→城市场景→田野，每个2.35秒。在 0.2–1.9 秒 (1.7 秒) 处，块大小通过 1、2、3、4、6、8、11、15、20、27 和 36 像素上下步进（最粗在中点，1.05 秒）。","前半段显示旧场景，后半段显示新场景；像素块最粗时切换场景。","方法：在启用平滑的情况下将框架缩小到宽度 ÷ 块大小，然后在关闭平滑的情况下将其放大。"],"source_summary":"The picture turns into coarser and coarser blocks, switches at the coarsest point, then sharpens again.","source_spec":["Field scene → city scene → field, 2.35 s each. At 0.2–1.9 s (1.7 s) the block size steps up and back down through 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 11, 15, 20, 27 and 36 px (coarsest at the midpoint, 1.05 s).","The first half shows the old scene and the second half the new one; the swap happens at the coarsest step.","Method: shrink the frame to width ÷ block size with smoothing on, then scale it back up with smoothing off."],"source_use":"Use it for game-like, retro or digital scene changes, or to blur something out as the scene switches."},"142":{"summary":"画面像玻璃一样破裂，碎片飞散，下一个场景显露出来。","use":"在标题或结果应该受到强烈冲击之前，使用它来产生冲击、突破或扭转。","spec":["山景→白天场景→山景，每个2.35秒。撞击点为 (304, 92)。","裂纹：0.3–0.65 秒。13 条放射线和半径约为 40、98、175（各有 ±15% 变化）的圆环，按离中心由近到远的顺序出现（三次缓出，最远至 420 像素）。中心白色星形闪光在 0.6 秒时淡出。","玻璃在 0.82 秒时破裂：从旧场景切下的 52 个碎片（13 × 4 环）以 220–480 px/s（垂直速度 × 0.7，加上向上最多 120）的速度向外飞出，重力为 1300 px/s²，旋转 ±4 rad/s，并在 1 秒内收缩最多 35%。","外环离开较晚（每环 0.035 秒加上随机最多 0.03 秒）。每个碎片在开始移动后 0.55-1.0 秒逐渐消失。","碎片有一个白色的 2.5 px 边缘；下一个场景在下面。"],"source_summary":"The picture cracks like glass, the shards fly off and the next scene is revealed.","source_spec":["Mountain scene → day scene → mountain, 2.35 s each. The impact point is (304, 92).","Cracks: 0.3–0.65 s. Thirteen radial lines and rings at radii of about 40, 98 and 175 (each ±15%) appear in order of distance from the centre (cubic ease-out, out to 420 px). A white flash star at the centre fades by 0.6 s.","The glass breaks at 0.82 s: 52 shards (13 × 4 rings) cut from the old scene fly outward at 220–480 px/s (vertical speed × 0.7, plus up to 120 upward), with gravity 1300 px/s², spinning ±4 rad/s and shrinking up to 35% over 1 s.","Outer rings leave later (0.035 s per ring plus up to 0.03 s at random). Each shard fades out 0.55–1.0 s after it starts moving.","Shards have a white 2.5 px edge; the next scene is underneath."],"source_use":"Use it for an impact, a break or a twist, just before a title or a result that should hit hard."},"143":{"summary":"手机被分成几层以展示它是如何构建的，然后再次组装。","use":"用它来一目了然地解释产品的内部结构、工作原理或成分。","spec":["等距手机由四层组成（后盖、电池、电路板、屏幕）。每层都是一个扁平的圆角板，绘制在按 0.85 缩放的轴上，双向倾斜 30°，边厚为 6 px。","拆分从 0.45 秒开始，每层耗时 0.75 秒、比其下方一层晚 0.08 秒，使用 backOut（s = 1.3）。第 i 层（自下而上为 0–3）的高度为 7i + 30i·eᵢ + 3·sin(4πt/4.7 + i)·clamp(eᵢ)，其中 eᵢ 包含拆分和重组进度；后盖的分离偏移为 0，但仍有轻微摆动。","分开时每层的摆动振幅最多 3 像素，每 4.7 秒摆动两次，并由 clamp(eᵢ) 控制强度；虚线引导线连接角落，名称标签显示在右侧。","重新组装：从 3.25 秒开始，每层 0.7 秒，从顶层开始，间隔 0.07 秒，三次缓入缓出。"],"source_summary":"A phone separates into its layers to show how it is built, then assembles again.","source_spec":["An isometric phone built from four layers (back cover, battery, circuit board, screen). Each layer is a flat rounded plate drawn on axes scaled by 0.85 and tilted 30° either way, with 6 px thick sides.","Separate: from 0.45 s, 0.75 s per layer, each layer 0.08 s after the one below, backOut (s = 1.3). Height of layer i (0–3 from the bottom) = 7i + 30i × progress, so the back cover stays put.","While apart, each layer bobs ±3 px twice per 4.7 s, dotted guide lines join the corners, and name labels with leader lines appear on the right (in Japanese in the demo).","Reassemble: from 3.25 s, 0.7 s per layer, starting with the top layer, 0.07 s apart, cubic ease-in-out."],"source_use":"Use it to explain what is inside a product, how it works or what it is made of, at a glance."},"144":{"summary":"一个全帧场景分为两个面板，然后是三个，每个面板都有自己的场景移动。","use":"用它来比较，显示同时发生的事情，或者排列几个人或地方，例如之前和之后或一组选项。","spec":["全帧海洋场景在 0.45–0.95 秒时分成两个面板（分隔符 539→269.5），然后在 1.4–1.9 秒时分成三个面板（分隔符在 1/3 和 2/3），并在 3.75–4.4 秒时合并回一个面板，所有三次缓入缓出。","海洋、城市、田野三个场景分别居中并裁剪在各自面板内，内部仍持续运动：波浪和帆船移动，城市窗户每 4.7 秒切换 8 次，风车每 4.7 秒转动两圈。","面板之间的白色分隔线（宽度 6）。"],"source_summary":"One full-frame scene splits into two panels, then three, each with its own scene moving.","source_spec":["A full-frame sea scene splits into two panels at 0.45–0.95 s (divider 539→269.5), then into three at 1.4–1.9 s (dividers at 1/3 and 2/3), and merges back into one at 3.75–4.4 s, all cubic ease-in-out.","The three scenes (sea, city, field) are each centred in and clipped to their own panel and keep moving inside it (waves and a sailboat, city windows switching 8 times per 4.7 s, a windmill turning twice per 4.7 s).","White dividers (width 6) between the panels."],"source_use":"Use it to compare, to show things happening at once, or to line up several people or places, such as before and after or a set of options."},"145":{"summary":"当页面向下滚动时，一条橙色线会沿着时间轴向下延伸；它到达的每个点都会被填充，其年份和事件从右侧滑入。向后滚动会反转它。","use":"将其用于公司历史、里程碑或按时间顺序阅读的分步流程。","spec":["511 × 168 浏览器视口。滚动：0→190 px 持续 0.3–2.3 秒，190→0 持续 3.0–4.3 秒（三次缓入缓出）。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","时间线位于 x = 168：橙色线覆盖在宽 3 像素的灰色轨道上。线尾的页面坐标为 min(scroll + 126, 300)，视口坐标为 min(scroll + 126, 300) − scroll；到达轨道终点后不再继续延伸。","5 个条目（2018–2026 年），圆点为白色、半径 7.5、环宽 2.5，分别位于页面 y = 72、126、180、234、288。","进度线尖端经过某个点后，在接下来 22 像素的线条增长过程中（三次缓出）：圆环变橙色，内部圆点半径从 0 增至 4；年份（橙色，18 像素）和事件文字（15 像素）淡入，同时从右侧滑入 16 像素。","向后滚动会缩小线条并通过相同的公式隐藏项目。右侧的滚动条拇指跟随滚动。"],"source_summary":"As the page scrolls down, an orange line grows down the timeline; each dot it reaches fills in and its year and event slide in from the right. Scrolling back up reverses it.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 browser viewport. Scroll: 0→190 px over 0.3–2.3 s, 190→0 over 3.0–4.3 s (cubic ease-in-out). One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","The timeline line is at x = 168: an orange line grows over a gray track (width 3). Its tip sits at scroll + 126 px, so always 126 px from the top of the viewport (42 px from the bottom).","Five items (2018–2026), with dots (white, radius 7.5, ring width 2.5) at page y = 72, 126, 180, 234 and 288.","Over the 22 px of line growth after the tip passes a dot (cubic ease-out): the ring turns orange, an inner dot grows from radius 0 to 4, and the year (18 px, orange) and event (15 px) fade in while sliding 16 px from the right.","Scrolling back shrinks the line and hides the items by the same formula. The scrollbar thumb on the right follows the scroll."],"source_use":"Use it for company history, milestones or a step-by-step process that reads in time order."},"146":{"summary":"当页面滚动时，浅灰色标题从左上角一次变暗一个字符，并在向上滚动时从末尾淡出。","use":"将其用于简短的声明，例如创始人的概念或消息，应慢慢阅读。","spec":["511 × 168 视口。滚动进度 p：0→1 持续 0.3–2.6 秒，1→0 持续 3.2–4.4 秒（三次缓入缓出）。页面向上移动 p × 40 px。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","三行标题，总共 24 个字符（27 像素，粗细 800，行高 38 像素），开头全部为浅灰色 (#D6DBE4)。","第 n 个字符（从 0 开始计数）的深色程度为 clamp(p × 26 − n)：每个字符用总进度的 1/26 达到文字颜色 #1C2333，并与滚动同步。","向后滚动可以通过相同的公式使它们从最后一个字符淡出。正文文本栏和滚动条滑块随页面移动。"],"source_summary":"A light gray headline darkens one character at a time from the top left as the page scrolls, and fades back from the end when scrolling up.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport. Scroll progress p: 0→1 over 0.3–2.6 s, 1→0 over 3.2–4.4 s (cubic ease-in-out). The page moves up by p × 40 px. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","A three-line headline, 24 characters in all (27 px, weight 800, 38 px line height), all light gray (#D6DBE4) at the start.","Character n (counting from 0) has darkness clamp(p × 26 − n): each character takes 1/26 of the progress to reach the text color (#1C2333), in step with the scroll.","Scrolling back fades them from the last character by the same formula. The body-text bars and the scrollbar thumb move with the page."],"source_use":"Use it on a short statement, such as a concept or a message from the founder, that should be read slowly."},"147":{"summary":"滚动时，下一张卡片从下方升起，并以较小的偏移量堆叠在前一张卡片上；下面的卡片会稍微收缩并变暗。","use":"将其用于应按顺序一次显示一张卡片的步骤、功能或计划。","spec":["511 × 168 视口。滚动步长 s：0→1 持续 0.3–1.1 秒，1→2 持续 1.6–2.4 秒，2→0 持续 3.2–4.4 秒（三次缓入缓出）。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","三张卡片（371 × 124，半径 12，居中），页面上相距 170 px； s 的每一步都会将它们向上移动 170 px。","它们停在距顶部 14、26 和 38 px 处（位置：粘性，每张卡的顶部偏移量大 12 px），因此每张新卡都会覆盖之前的卡。","对于堆叠在顶部的每张卡片，下面的卡片在其顶部边缘中部周围收缩 4.5%（两张为 9%），并在海军蓝层下变暗（最多 16%）。","卡片阴影模糊 14 像素、向上偏移 2 像素；滚动条滑块随滚动移动。"],"source_summary":"On scroll, the next card rises from below and stacks over the previous one with a small offset; the cards underneath shrink a little and darken.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport. Scroll step s: 0→1 over 0.3–1.1 s, 1→2 over 1.6–2.4 s, 2→0 over 3.2–4.4 s (cubic ease-in-out). One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Three cards (371 × 124, radius 12, centered), 170 px apart on the page; each step of s moves them up 170 px.","They stop 14, 26 and 38 px from the top (position: sticky with the top offset 12 px larger for each card), so each new card covers the one before.","For each card stacked on top, the card underneath shrinks 4.5% (9% for two) around the middle of its top edge and darkens under a navy layer (up to 16%).","Card shadow: 14 px blur, 2 px upward. The scrollbar thumb follows the scroll."],"source_use":"Use it for steps, features or plans that should be shown one card at a time, in order."},"148":{"summary":"每次滚动进入新的部分时，整个页面背景都会从奶油色到海军蓝再到浅蓝色混合；在深色背景上，文本变成白色。","use":"在故事风格的页面上使用它，每个章节都有自己的情绪，或者对比白天和黑夜或季节等场景。","spec":["一个 511 × 168 视口，包含三个部分，每个部分 168 像素（一个屏幕）。滚动：0→168 px 持续 0.3–1.2 秒，168→336 持续 1.8–2.7 秒，336→0 持续 3.3–4.4 秒（三次缓入缓出）。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","背景颜色：早晨#FFEBD9→晚上#1E2A4A→假期#DDE6FF，在整个页面后面绘制为一种颜色，并在跨越部分边界时混合。","混合：滚动到下一部分的 5% 到 95% 之间的 0→1（二次缓入/缓出），由滚动位置驱动，而不是由时间驱动。","到了晚上，标题从海军蓝变为白色，正文从米色变为蓝灰色。部分标签（01 MORNING …）保持橙色。","每个部分的图片（太阳、月亮和星星、山脉照片）随着页面移动。滚动条拇指跟随滚动。"],"source_summary":"Each time the scroll moves into a new section, the whole page background blends from cream to navy to light blue; on the dark background the text turns white.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with three sections, each 168 px (one screen). Scroll: 0→168 px over 0.3–1.2 s, 168→336 over 1.8–2.7 s, 336→0 over 3.3–4.4 s (cubic ease-in-out). One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Background colors: morning #FFEBD9 → night #1E2A4A → holiday #DDE6FF, painted as one color behind the whole page and blended while crossing a section boundary.","Blend: 0→1 between 5% and 95% of the scroll to the next section (quadratic ease-in-out), driven by scroll position, not by time.","Toward night the headline blends from navy to white and the body bars from beige to blue-gray; the section labels (01 MORNING …) stay orange.","Each section's picture (sun, moon and stars, mountain photo) moves with the page. The scrollbar thumb follows the scroll."],"source_use":"Use it on story-style pages where each chapter has its own mood, or to contrast scenes such as day and night or the seasons."},"149":{"summary":"向下滚动会将标题向上滑出视图以释放屏幕；即使向上滚动一点点，它也会直接返回。","use":"当屏幕空间紧张时（例如在手机上）使用它，可以为内容提供更多空间，同时使菜单保持一小段滚动距离。","spec":["511 × 168 视口，顶部固定页头高 34 像素。滚动：0→170 px 在 0.3–1.1 秒向下，170→100 在 1.5–1.9 秒向上，100→230 在 2.4–2.9 秒向下，230→0 在 3.3–4.3 秒向上；均为三次缓入缓出。单次循环 4.7 秒，9.4 秒包周期内播放两次。","最后一次移动向下时隐藏页头，向上时显示页头；距页面顶部 34 像素范围内始终显示。","隐藏和显示对应 36 像素的向上位移，在 0.3 秒内完成（二次缓入缓出），类似带过渡的 transform: translateY。","滚动时页头下方显示 12 像素阴影，前 30 像素滚动内不透明度从 0 增至 0.14；滚动条滑块随滚动移动。"],"source_summary":"Scrolling down slides the header up out of view to free the screen; scrolling up even a little brings it straight back.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with a 34 px header fixed at the top. Scroll: 0→170 px over 0.3–1.1 s (down), 170→100 over 1.5–1.9 s (up), 100→230 over 2.4–2.9 s (down), 230→0 over 3.3–4.3 s (up), each with cubic ease-in-out. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","If the last movement was downward the header hides; if upward it shows. Within 34 px of the top of the page it always shows.","Hiding and showing both move it 36 px upward over 0.3 s (quadratic ease-in-out), like transform: translateY with a transition.","While scrolled, a 12 px shadow sits under the header (opacity 0→0.14 over the first 30 px of scroll). The scrollbar thumb follows the scroll."],"source_use":"Use it when screen space is tight, as on phones, to give the content more room while keeping the menu one small scroll away."},"150":{"summary":"当文章滚动时，正在阅读的部分的目录项会亮起，并且当下一个标题出现时，突出显示会继续移动。","use":"在长文章、文档或常见问题解答中使用它来显示读者在整个页面中的位置。","spec":["511 × 168 视口：左侧是目录（150 像素宽，4 项），右侧是文章，标题相距 100 像素。滚动：0→100 持续 0.3–0.9 秒，→200 持续 1.35–1.95 秒，→300 持续 2.4–3.0 秒，300→0 持续 3.5–4.4 秒（三次缓入缓出）。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","当前项由四个区块锚点 0、100、200、300 决定：取不大于 scroll + 40 的最后一个锚点；标题文字实际基线另向下偏移 36 像素。","当前项切换时，在 0.25 秒内出现浅橙色背景（126 × 26，圆角半径 6）和左侧橙色条（宽 4），文字由灰色变为橙色粗体（三次缓出）；上一项在同样的 0.25 秒内恢复。","目录保持不变；只有文章滚动。滚动条拇指跟随滚动。"],"source_summary":"As the article scrolls, the table-of-contents item for the section being read lights up, and the highlight moves on when the next heading comes in.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport: a table of contents on the left (150 px wide, 4 items) and the article on the right, with headings 100 px apart. Scroll: 0→100 over 0.3–0.9 s, →200 over 1.35–1.95 s, →300 over 2.4–3.0 s, 300→0 over 3.5–4.4 s (cubic ease-in-out). One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Current item = the last heading whose top is above scroll + 40 px (a trigger line 40 px below the top of the viewport).","When it changes, over 0.25 s (cubic ease-out) the item gets a pale orange background (126 × 26, radius 6) and an orange bar on its left (width 4), and its text turns from gray to bold orange; the previous item reverts over the same 0.25 s.","The table of contents stays put; only the article scrolls. The scrollbar thumb follows the scroll."],"source_use":"Use it on long articles, documentation or FAQs to show where the reader is within the whole page."},"151":{"summary":"向下滚动后，右下角出现一个圆形箭头按钮；单击它会将页面直接返回顶部。","use":"在博客文章、长登陆页面或产品列表等长页面上使用它，以便读者可以返回顶部的菜单。","spec":["视口尺寸为 511 × 168。0.2–1.7 秒内页面从 0 滚动到 300 像素（页面底部），采用三次缓入缓出。单次循环 4.7 秒，整个 9.4 秒周期播放两次。","按钮：右下角的橙色圆圈（中心 x = 472，y = 138；半径 19；白色向上箭头；10 px 阴影模糊）。在滚动 80 到 140 像素之间，它会淡入，同时上升 10 像素（三次缓出）。","2.6 秒后点击。当光标位于其上时，它会在 0.2 秒内变暗（#FF5A2C → #D9431C）。","点击后，滚动在 2.66–3.26 秒内从 300→0 变化（0.6 秒，三次缓入缓出）；滚动从 140 降至 80 像素时按钮反向淡出，低于 80 像素时不可见。"],"source_summary":"After scrolling down, a round arrow button appears at the bottom right; clicking it takes the page straight back to the top.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport. Scroll 0→300 px (to the bottom of the page) over 0.2–1.7 s, cubic ease-in-out. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Button: an orange circle at the bottom right (center x = 472, y = 138; radius 19; white up arrow; 10 px shadow blur). Between 80 and 140 px of scroll it fades in while rising 10 px (cubic ease-out).","It is clicked at 2.6 s. While the cursor is on it, it darkens over 0.2 s (#FF5A2C → #D9431C).","After the click the scroll goes 300→0 over 2.66–3.26 s (0.6 s, cubic ease-in-out); below 80 px the button fades out by the same formula."],"source_use":"Use it on long pages such as blog posts, long landing pages or product lists, so readers can get back to the menu at the top."},"152":{"summary":"当页面滚动时，中间的一张小照片会逐渐变大，填满整个窗口，周围的文字会逐渐消失，标题会出现在照片上方。","use":"在旅游、房地产或品牌网站上使用它，将访客吸引到照片中。","spec":["511 × 168 视口。滚动进度 p：0→1 持续 0.3–2.3 秒，1→0 持续 3.0–4.4 秒（三次缓入缓出）。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","相框：从中间155×90（x=178，y=58，半径8）到整个511×168窗口（半径0）；位置、宽度、高度和半径与 p 成比例变化。","当 p 变为 0→0.45（不透明度 1 − 2.2p）时，标题和周围的文本会淡出。","当 p 从 0.7 增至 1，白色标题（26 像素、字间距 2 像素）在照片中心淡入；滚动条滑块随滚动移动。"],"source_summary":"As the page scrolls, a small photo in the middle grows to fill the window, the text around it fades away and a headline appears over the photo.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport. Scroll progress p: 0→1 over 0.3–2.3 s, 1→0 over 3.0–4.4 s (cubic ease-in-out). One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Photo frame: from 155 × 90 in the middle (x = 178, y = 58, radius 8) to the full 511 × 168 window (radius 0); position, width, height and radius change in proportion to p.","The heading and text around it fade out while p goes 0→0.45 (opacity 1 − 2.2p).","While p goes 0.7→1, a white headline (26 px, 2 px letter spacing) fades in at the center of the photo. The scrollbar thumb follows the scroll."],"source_use":"Use it on travel, real-estate or brand sites to pull the visitor into the photo."},"153":{"summary":"当光标在卡片上移动时，卡片会深度倾斜以匹配光标位置，并且眩光会在其表面上移动；当光标离开时它会变平。","use":"将其用在会员卡、产品包装或定价卡上，让它们感觉像是您可以拿起的物品。","spec":["511 × 168 视口，中间有一个 220 × 132 卡（半径 14）。光标进入，每 0.6 秒访问卡片角附近的点，然后离开（三次缓入缓出）。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","倾斜：光标距卡片中心的偏移量除以宽度和高度的一半，得到-1…1；水平偏移×0.32 rad（约18°）是绕Y旋转，垂直偏移×0.32 rad是绕X旋转。光标下方的一侧倾斜。","深度：观看者距离520 px（如透视：520 px）；较近的部分画得较大。","悬停时倾斜和眩光在 0.4 秒内增强（三次缓出）；移开后卡片在同样的 0.4 秒内恢复平面。","眩光：光标处半径为 130 px 的白色径向光（中心不透明度为 0.42）。地板阴影相对于倾斜最多移动 10 像素。"],"source_summary":"As the cursor moves over the card, the card tilts in depth to match the cursor position and a glare moves across its surface; it settles flat when the cursor leaves.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with a 220 × 132 card (radius 14) in the middle. The cursor comes in, visits points near the card's corners every 0.6 s and leaves (cubic ease-in-out). One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Tilt: the cursor offset from the card center is divided by half the width and height to give −1…1; the horizontal offset × 0.32 rad (about 18°) is the rotation about Y, the vertical offset × 0.32 rad the rotation about X. The side under the cursor tips away.","Depth: viewer distance 520 px (like perspective: 520px); nearer parts are drawn larger.","On hover the tilt and glare ramp up over 0.4 s (cubic ease-out); on leave the card returns flat over the same 0.4 s.","Glare: a white radial light of radius 130 px at the cursor (opacity 0.42 at the center). The floor shadow shifts up to 10 px against the tilt."],"source_use":"Use it on member cards, product packaging or pricing cards to make them feel like objects you can pick up."},"154":{"summary":"当光标在深色卡片上移动时，只有其周围的圆圈被点亮，并且附近卡片的边缘会发光。","use":"在带有行功能或定价卡的深色主题网站上使用它，以使指针下方的位置脱颖而出。","spec":["511 × 168 视口：一个深色页面 (#121828) 和三张深色卡片 (147 × 116，半径 10)。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","光标继续沿八字形移动：x = 255 + 190·sin(2πt/4.7)，y = 92 + 40·sin(4πt/4.7)。","仅在每张卡片内部，半径为 115 px 的白色径向光以光标为中心（中心不透明度 0.34 → 0）；它不会溢出卡片之外。","卡片边框（宽度 2）根据距光标的距离发光：半径 120 像素的橙色径向光 (rgb(255,122,82))。远边仅保留微弱的基线（8% 白色）。","无延迟：灯光正好位于光标处（通常的构建将坐标放入用作径向渐变中心的 CSS 变量中）。"],"source_summary":"As the cursor moves over the dark cards, only a circle around it is lit, and the edges of nearby cards glow.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport: a dark page (#121828) with three dark cards (147 × 116, radius 10). One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","The cursor keeps moving in a figure eight: x = 255 + 190·sin(2πt/4.7), y = 92 + 40·sin(4πt/4.7).","Inside each card only, a white radial light of radius 115 px is centered on the cursor (opacity 0.34 at the center → 0); it does not spill outside the cards.","Card borders (width 2) glow by distance from the cursor: an orange radial light (rgb(255,122,82)) of radius 120 px. Far edges keep only the faint base line (8% white).","No lag: the light sits exactly at the cursor (the usual build puts the coordinates in CSS variables used as the radial-gradient center)."],"source_use":"Use it on dark-themed sites with rows of feature or pricing cards, to make the spot under the pointer stand out."},"155":{"summary":"将光标放在产品卡上时，T 恤的正面照片会交叉淡化为背面视图；当光标离开时，它返回到前面。","use":"在电子商务产品网格上使用它来显示另一个角度或模特拍摄的照片，而无需离开列表。","spec":["一个 511 × 168 视口，带有两张产品卡（相框 196 × 112，半径 8，下面是名称和价格）。光标停留在左卡上，然后停留在右卡上，每次停留约 1.3 秒。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","悬停时，正面照片（胸前小圆点）在 0.3 秒内交叉溶解为背面照片（背部大星形），采用二次缓入缓出；移开后以同样的 0.3 秒淡回。","照片框内下方的两个点（半径 3）表示当前照片，黑点为当前照片。","悬停区域是整个卡片，包括名称。框架、名称和价格不变。"],"source_summary":"With the cursor on a product card, the front photo of the T-shirt cross-fades to a back view; it returns to the front when the cursor leaves.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with two product cards (photo frame 196 × 112, radius 8, name and price below). The cursor rests on the left card, then the right one, for about 1.3 s each. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","On hover, over 0.3 s (quadratic ease-in-out), the front photo (small dot on the chest) cross-fades to the back photo (large star on the back); on leave it fades back over the same 0.3 s.","Two dots under the photo (radius 3) show which photo is showing (the dark dot is the current one).","The hover area is the whole card, including the name. The frame, name and price do not move."],"source_use":"Use it on e-commerce product grids to show another angle or an on-model shot without leaving the list."},"156":{"summary":"将光标放在菜单单词上，其字母将逐一滚动并向外滚动，而同一单词则以橙色从下方滚动；当光标离开时它会回滚。","use":"在标题菜单或按钮上使用它可以为短文本链接提供触觉响应。","spec":["一个 511 × 168 视口，包含三个菜单词（作品、关于、联系；30 像素，粗细 800，字母间距 1 像素）。光标从左到右停留在每个上约 0.85 秒。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","每个单词的橙色副本位于其下方 40 像素处，并且两者都被剪裁到 39 像素高的框（溢出：隐藏）。","将鼠标悬停在每个字母上，错开 0.035 秒，在 0.36 秒内向上和向外移动 40 像素（三次缓入缓出），同时其橙色副本上升到位。","光标移开后，字母以相同的错开间隔和时长向下滚回。"],"source_summary":"With the cursor on a menu word, its letters roll up and out one by one while the same word rolls in from below in orange; it rolls back when the cursor leaves.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with three menu words (WORKS, ABOUT, CONTACT; 30 px, weight 800, 1 px letter spacing). The cursor rests on each, left to right, for about 0.85 s. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","An orange copy of each word sits 40 px below it, and both are clipped to a 39 px tall box (overflow: hidden).","On hover each letter, staggered by 0.035 s, moves 40 px up and out over 0.36 s (cubic ease-in-out) while its orange copy rises into place.","On leave the letters roll back down with the same stagger and timing."],"source_use":"Use it on header menus or buttons to give short text links a tactile response."},"157":{"summary":"当光标位于纯文本列表的一行上时，该行的照片会在光标旁边淡入并跟随它。","use":"在工作、项目或属性列表上使用它，保持纯文本和轻量级，同时让人们检查照片中他们关心的行。","spec":["511 × 168 视口，包含四行纯文本列表（39 像素行，17 像素名称）。光标沿行向下移动，每行大约 1 秒。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","悬停时，名称在 0.25 秒内向右移动 8 像素，名称及右侧箭头变为橙色（三次缓出）；移开后在 0.25 秒内恢复。","照片：该行的照片（132 × 84，半径 6，阴影）出现在光标右侧 26 px 处，略高于光标，垂直保持在窗口内。","在同样的 0.25 秒内，照片的不透明度从 0 变为 1，从 0.85× 变为 1×。跟随光标无滞后；移动到下一行会随着新照片的出现而淡出旧照片。"],"source_summary":"With the cursor on a row of a text-only list, that row's photo fades in beside the cursor and follows it.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with a text-only list of four rows (39 px rows, 17 px names). The cursor moves down the rows, about 1 s on each. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Hovered row: over 0.25 s (cubic ease-out) the name shifts 8 px right and the name and the arrow at the right turn orange; on leave they return over 0.25 s.","Photo: that row's photo (132 × 84, radius 6, drop shadow) appears 26 px right of the cursor, a little above it, kept inside the window vertically.","Over the same 0.25 s the photo goes from opacity 0 to 1 and from 0.85× to 1×. It follows the cursor without lag; moving to the next row fades the old photo out as the new one comes in."],"source_use":"Use it on lists of work, projects or properties that stay text-only and light, while letting people check a photo for the rows they care about."},"158":{"summary":"单击该字段会缩小标签并将其移动到顶部边框，从而使该字段可以自由输入；空虚且没有焦点，标签移回内部。","use":"在具有多个字段的表单上使用它，可以保持每个标签可见，而不占用额外的空间。","spec":["511 × 168 视口，输入框尺寸 300 × 46、圆角半径 8，含“电子邮件地址”标签（15 像素）。0.65 秒点击输入框，3.95 秒点击外部以移除焦点。单次循环 4.7 秒，9.4 秒动画包周期内播放两次。","输入框获得焦点或内容非空时，标签在 0.24 秒内从 15 缩小至 11.5 像素，并从输入框中部移动到上边框（左内边距 14 → 10 像素），采用三次缓出；标签背后的边框以白色遮住。","获得焦点时，边框在 0.15 秒内由灰色变橙色，线宽从 1.5 增至 2.2 像素，标签也变为橙色；采用三次缓出。","“hello@example.com”以每 0.075 秒一个字符输入：从 1.0 秒开始计时，首字约在 1.075 秒出现；从 3.2 秒开始以每 0.03 秒一个字符删除，首个删除约在 3.23 秒。输入为空且失去焦点后，标签在 0.24 秒内移回输入框内。","文本插入符号每 0.9 秒闪烁一次（打字时保持亮起状态）。"],"source_summary":"Clicking the field shrinks the label and moves it onto the top border, leaving the field free for typing; empty and unfocused, the label moves back inside.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with a 300 × 46 field (radius 8) holding the label \"メールアドレス\" (email address, 15 px). The field is clicked at 0.65 s, and a click outside at 3.95 s removes focus. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","While focused or not empty, over 0.24 s (cubic ease-out) the label shrinks 15 → 11.5 px and moves from the middle of the field onto the top border (left padding 14 → 10 px); the border is masked in white behind it.","While focused, over 0.15 s (cubic ease-out) the border turns from gray to orange and 1.5 → 2.2 px wide, and the label turns orange.","\"hello@example.com\" is typed one character per 0.075 s from 1.0 s and deleted one per 0.03 s from 3.2 s. Once empty and unfocused, the label moves back inside over the same 0.24 s.","The text caret blinks every 0.9 s (it stays on while typing)."],"source_use":"Use it on forms with many fields, to keep each label visible without taking extra space."},"159":{"summary":"当电子邮件地址输入一半时，该字段会变成红色，并显示“格式无效”消息；完成后，它会切换为绿色勾号和“确定”。","use":"在注册表或联系表单上使用它，以便人们在提交之前注意到错误。","spec":["511 × 168 视口，电子邮件输入框为 300 × 44、圆角半径 8；0.45 秒聚焦，4.2 秒失焦。“hana@example.com”共 16 个字符：从 0.75 秒起计时，每 0.115 秒输入一个，首字约在 0.865 秒出现；3.6 秒起每 0.03 秒删除一个。单次循环 4.7 秒，9.4 秒动画包周期内播放两次。","从输入第 2 个字符到输入最后一个字符前均为无效状态：0.15 秒内边框变红（#E5383B）、填充变浅红（#FFF1F1），下方出现红色感叹号圆圈及“格式无效”文字（13 像素）；采用三次缓出。","最后一个字符输入后内容变为有效：0.25 秒内边框变绿（#1E9E5A），右端弹出带白色勾号的绿色圆圈（半径 11，使用 GSAP elastic.out(1, 0.3)），下方出现“格式正确”。","聚焦时，边框在 0.15 秒内从灰色变为海军蓝，宽度为 1.5 → 2.2 像素。一旦开始删除，消息就会消失。"],"source_summary":"While the email address is half typed the field turns red with an \"invalid format\" message; the moment it is complete it switches to a green check and \"OK\".","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with a 300 × 44 email field (radius 8). Clicked at 0.45 s, clicked away at 4.2 s. \"hana@example.com\" (16 characters) is typed one character per 0.115 s from 0.75 s and deleted one per 0.03 s from 3.6 s. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","From the second character until the last one is typed it is invalid: over 0.15 s (cubic ease-out) the border turns red (#E5383B), the fill pale red (#FFF1F1), and a red \"!\" circle with \"形式が正しくありません\" (invalid format, 13 px) appears below.","When the last character makes it valid, over 0.25 s the border turns green (#1E9E5A), a green circle (radius 11, bouncing in with GSAP elastic.out(1, 0.3)) with a white check appears at the right end, and \"OK\" appears below.","While focused, the border turns from gray to navy and 1.5 → 2.2 px wide over 0.15 s. Once deletion starts, the messages go away."],"source_use":"Use it on sign-up or contact forms so people notice mistakes before they submit."},"160":{"summary":"单击“提交”按钮会将其缩小为一个内部有旋转器的圆圈；当它完成时，它会变宽为带有勾号的绿色“完成”。","use":"将它用在那些让人们等待结果的按钮上，例如提交、购买或保存。","spec":["视口尺寸为 511 × 168，内有橙色胶囊按钮（220 × 36），文字为“发送”。按钮在 0.8 秒被点击。单次循环 4.7 秒，9.4 秒动画包周期内播放两次。","0.85–1.15 秒（历时 0.3 秒）内，按钮宽度从 220 缩至 36 像素并成为圆形，采用三次缓入缓出；标签在收缩过程的前三分之一淡出。","从 1.1 到 2.3 秒，白色加载转圈（半径 10，线宽 3，0.7π 弧）在圆内每 0.7 秒旋转一次。","2.25–2.45 秒颜色由橙色变为绿色（#1E9E5A），2.25–2.5 秒绘出白色勾号；2.45–2.8 秒内宽度由 36 增至 150 像素（三次缓入缓出），勾号向左移动 26 像素，显示“已完成”。","完成状态在 3.9–4.1 秒淡出；原来的“发送”按钮在 4.1–4.4 秒重新出现并向上移动 6 像素，采用三次缓出。"],"source_summary":"Clicking the submit button shrinks it to a circle with a spinner inside; when it finishes it widens into a green \"Done\" with a check.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with an orange pill button, 220 × 36, labeled \"送信する\" (Send). It is clicked at 0.8 s. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Over 0.85–1.15 s (0.3 s, cubic ease-in-out) it shrinks from 220 to 36 px wide, a circle; the label fades in the first third of the shrink.","From 1.1 to 2.3 s a white spinner (radius 10, line width 3, 0.7π arc) turns once every 0.7 s inside the circle.","Over 2.25–2.45 s the color goes orange → green (#1E9E5A) and a white check draws over 2.25–2.5 s; over 2.45–2.8 s (cubic ease-in-out) it widens 36 → 150 px, the check moves 26 px left and \"完了\" (Done) appears.","It fades out over 3.9–4.1 s and the original \"送信する\" button comes back, rising 6 px, over 4.1–4.4 s (cubic ease-out)."],"source_use":"Use it on buttons that make people wait a moment for a result, such as submit, purchase or save."},"161":{"summary":"单击列表中的照片会将同一张照片添加到详细信息页面顶部的图像中，而其余部分则更改为详细信息页面；返回会将其缩小到位。","use":"在列表和详细视图之间来回切换的画廊或产品页面上使用它，这样人们就永远不会忘记他们打开的内容。","spec":["视口为 511 × 168，列表中有 3 张照片（各 143 × 80，圆角半径 6）。0.75 秒点击中间照片，3.05 秒点击详情页的“返回列表”。单次循环 4.7 秒，每个 9.4 秒动画包周期播放两次。","前进：0.85–1.45 秒（历时 0.6 秒）内，被点击的照片从列表位置连续移动并缩放到详情页顶部的 479 × 94 图像区域（圆角半径 8），采用三次缓入缓出；整个过程中始终是同一张照片。","其他照片和标题在移动的前 62% 中逐渐淡出；详细标题、文本和后退按钮在最后 40% 内淡入。在 50% 时，URL 从 /works 更改为 /works/02。","返回：3.15–3.75 秒内（历时 0.6 秒）反向执行相同动作，照片回到列表位置。","这是当列表照片和详细照片共享相同的视图转换名称时视图转换 API 的外观。"],"source_summary":"Clicking a photo in the list grows that same photo into the image at the top of the detail page while the rest changes to the detail page; going back shrinks it into place.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with three photos in a list (143 × 80, radius 6). The middle photo is clicked at 0.75 s, and \"← 一覧へ\" (back to list) on the detail page at 3.05 s. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Forward: over 0.85–1.45 s (0.6 s, cubic ease-in-out) the clicked photo moves and resizes continuously from its list slot to the 479 × 94 image at the top of the detail page (radius 8). It stays one photo throughout.","The other photos and the heading fade out over the first 62% of the move; the detail title, text and back button fade in over the last 40%. At 50% the URL changes from /works to /works/02.","Back: over 3.15–3.75 s (0.6 s) the same move runs in reverse to the list slot.","This is how the View Transitions API looks when the list photo and the detail photo share the same view-transition-name."],"source_use":"Use it on galleries or product pages that go back and forth between a list and a detail view, so people never lose track of what they opened."},"162":{"summary":"单击图库中的缩略图会使页面变暗，并在中心显示大照片； × 将其缩小回缩略图。","use":"将其用于案例研究、作品集或产品照片，这些内容应该在不离开页面的情况下以大尺寸显示。","spec":["带有四个缩略图的 511 × 168 视口（108 × 72，半径 6）。第三个在 0.75 秒处点击，右上角的 × 在 3.0 秒处点击。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","打开：0.85–1.3 秒（历时 0.45 秒）内，深色遮罩（rgb(14,18,28)，不透明度从 0 增至 0.82）覆盖页面，被点击的缩略图放大至中央的 261 × 128；采用三次缓出。","在打开的后半部分，“3 / 4”出现在照片下方，上一个/下一个箭头位于两侧，右上角有一个 ×。","关闭：3.05–3.4 秒（历时 0.35 秒）内反向执行相同动作，照片回到缩略图位置，采用三次缓入缓出。"],"source_summary":"Clicking a thumbnail in the gallery dims the page and shows that photo large in the center; the × shrinks it back into its thumbnail.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport with four thumbnails (108 × 72, radius 6). The third is clicked at 0.75 s, and the × at the top right at 3.0 s. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Open: over 0.85–1.3 s (0.45 s, cubic ease-out) a dark overlay (rgb(14,18,28), opacity 0 → 0.82) covers the page and the clicked thumbnail grows to 261 × 128 in the center.","Over the second half of the open, \"3 / 4\" appears below the photo, previous/next arrows at the sides and a × at the top right.","Close: over 3.05–3.4 s (0.35 s, cubic ease-in-out) the same move runs in reverse and the photo returns to its thumbnail."],"source_use":"Use it for case studies, portfolios or product photos that should be seen large without leaving the page."},"163":{"summary":"产品图片上出现白点脉冲；单击一个点会打开有关该部分的工具提示，单击另一个点会交换工具提示。","use":"在产品、平面图或地图上使用它，以解释一张图片中的不同地点。","spec":["511 × 168 视口：左侧是产品图片（背包），右侧是名称和价格，图片上有两个点（白色圆圈，半径 8，阴影；橙色中心，半径 4）。一次通过需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒的动画包周期两次）。","脉冲：每 1.57 秒（4.7 秒的三分之一），白环从每个点向外扩散，线宽 2，半径由 8 增至 20，不透明度由 0.75 降到 0；两个环相隔半个周期。","在 0.9 秒处，单击上面的点：工具提示（136 × 48，半径 8，指针指向该点）在 0.25 秒（三次缓出）内出现在其左侧，上升 6 像素。","2.4 秒点击下方圆点：第一个提示框在 0.25 秒内淡出，第二个在下方圆点右侧打开；3.8 秒再次点击将其关闭。"],"source_summary":"White dots pulse on the product picture; clicking one opens a tooltip about that part, and clicking another dot swaps the tooltip.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport: a product picture (a backpack) on the left, name and price on the right, with two dots on the picture (white circle, radius 8, drop shadow; orange center, radius 4). One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Pulse: from each dot a white ring (width 2) grows from radius 8 to 20 while fading from 0.75 to 0 opacity, every 1.57 s (a third of 4.7 s), two rings half a period apart.","At 0.9 s the upper dot is clicked: a tooltip (136 × 48, radius 8, with a pointer toward the dot) appears to its left over 0.25 s (cubic ease-out), rising 6 px.","At 2.4 s the lower dot is clicked: the first tooltip fades over 0.25 s and the next one opens to the right of the lower dot. A second click at 3.8 s closes it."],"source_use":"Use it on products, floor plans or maps, to explain different spots within one picture."},"164":{"summary":"“キャンペーン终了まで”下的时、分、秒（直到活动结束）每秒倒计时；当新的数字从下面进入时，只有变化的数字会向上和滑出。","use":"在限时优惠或申请截止日期之前使用它，以便让时间一目了然。","spec":["视口为 511 × 168：橙色渐变条显示“直至活动结束”，以及表示时、分、秒的 6 位数字卡片（各 34 × 50，圆角半径 6，数字字号 32 像素）。此卡每 9.4 秒播放一次。","从 02:15:04 开始，0.4 秒起每秒递减 1 秒，共递减 9 次，结束于 02:14:55；4.4 秒由 02:15:00 变为 02:14:59，分钟发生借位。","只有数字发生变化的方块才有动画：0.32 秒内旧数字向上滑出，新数字从下方滑入，内容裁切在方块内；采用三次缓入缓出。","在 9.4 秒处，它以平切的方式返回到 02:15:04。"],"source_summary":"The hours, minutes and seconds under \"キャンペーン終了まで\" (until the campaign ends) count down every second; only the digits that change slide up and out as new ones come in from below.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport: an orange gradient band with \"キャンペーン終了まで\" (until the campaign ends) and six digit tiles for hours, minutes and seconds (34 × 50 each, radius 6, 32 px digits). This card alone runs once per 9.4 s (the pack cycle).","It starts at 02:15:04 and counts down one second at a time, nine times, every 1 s from 0.4 s, ending at 02:14:55. At 4.4 s, 02:15:00 → 02:14:59 rolls the minutes over.","Only the tiles whose digit changes animate: over 0.32 s (cubic ease-in-out) the old digit slides up and out and the new one slides in from below, clipped to the tile.","At 9.4 s it goes back to 02:15:04 with a plain cut."],"source_use":"Use it before a limited-time offer or an application deadline, to make the time left plain to see."},"165":{"summary":"在蓝色部分与白色部分相遇的地方，两层波浪形状不断缓慢摇摆。","use":"在剖面边缘看起来柔和而不是规则的地方使用它，例如在有关大海、夏天或儿童的地方。","spec":["511 × 168 视口：顶部是蓝色渐变部分（#3B64E8 → #8FA9F7），下面是白色部分，边界处有两个分层的波浪形状。一个循环需要 4.7 秒（每 9.4 秒包循环两次）。","后波（白色，不透明度 0.45）：以 y = 100 为中心，波长 260 px、振幅 8 px 的正弦波与波长 130 px、振幅 4 px 的正弦波之和。","前波（白色）：以 y = 110 为中心，波长 300 px/振幅 9 px 加波长 110 px/振幅 3.5 px；它进入下面的白色部分。","当相位a=2π·t/4.7时，后波使用a+1和-2a，前波使用-a和2a+0.5。每个波中的两个正弦方向相反，因此形状不断变化，并每 4.7 秒返回到开始的位置。"],"source_summary":"Where a blue section meets a white one, two layered wave shapes keep swaying slowly.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport: a blue gradient section on top (#3B64E8 → #8FA9F7) and a white section below, with two wave shapes layered at the boundary. One loop takes 4.7 s (two per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Back wave (white, opacity 0.45): centered at y = 100, the sum of a sine with wavelength 260 px, amplitude 8 px and one with wavelength 130 px, amplitude 4 px.","Front wave (white): centered at y = 110, wavelength 300 px / amplitude 9 px plus wavelength 110 px / amplitude 3.5 px; it runs into the white section below.","With phase a = 2π·t/4.7, the back wave uses a + 1 and −2a, the front wave −a and 2a + 0.5. The two sines in each wave run in opposite directions, so the shape keeps changing and returns to where it started every 4.7 s."],"source_use":"Use it where section edges should look soft rather than ruled, on sites about the sea, summer or children, for example."},"166":{"summary":"点击心形，它就会充满弹性，充满红色，小颗粒在它周围爆裂，旁边的计数增加一；再次单击可撤消它。","use":"在“喜欢”、“收藏”或“保存”按钮上使用它，可以清晰、愉快地确认点击。","spec":["511 × 168 视口：一张帖子卡片上有心形轮廓（线宽 2.4），右侧计数为 128。0.9 秒点击心形，3.3 秒再次点击以撤销。单次循环 4.7 秒，9.4 秒动画包周期内播放两次。","在点击之前的 0.1 秒，它压缩到 0.78×；单击时，它会填充红色 (#F23D5C)，在 0.12 秒内增长 0.78 → 1.45×（三次缓出），然后稳定为 1×，即 1 + 0.45·e^(−7t)·cos(15t)。","点击后0.08-0.58秒：一个红色圆环（半径15→33，不透明度0.5→0）和六个方向（红、黄、橙）的六个小颗粒从半径24到37飞出并逐渐消失。","计数：点击后 0.05–0.35 秒（三次缓出）128 向上滑出，红色 129 从下方进入；撤消会将其滑回至 128。","撤销：心形恢复为轮廓，在点击前后共 0.4 秒内缩至 0.84 倍再恢复；不产生粒子。"],"source_summary":"Clicking the heart fills it red with a springy pop, small particles burst around it and the count beside it goes up by one; clicking again undoes it.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport: a post card with an outlined heart (line width 2.4) and the count \"128\" on the right. The heart is clicked at 0.9 s and clicked again at 3.3 s to undo. One pass takes 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","In the 0.1 s before the click it squeezes to 0.78×; at the click it fills red (#F23D5C), grows 0.78 → 1.45× in 0.12 s (cubic ease-out), then settles to 1× as 1 + 0.45·e^(−7t)·cos(15t).","0.08–0.58 s after the click: a red ring (radius 15 → 33, opacity 0.5 → 0) and six small particles in six directions (red, yellow, orange) flying out from radius 24 to 37 as they fade.","Count: 0.05–0.35 s after the click (cubic ease-out) 128 slides up and out and a red 129 comes in from below; undoing slides it back down to 128.","Undo: the heart goes back to an outline and dips to 0.84× and back over 0.4 s around the click (no particles)."],"source_use":"Use it on like, favorite or save buttons, to confirm the tap clearly and pleasantly."},"167":{"summary":"在英雄下方，有“滚动”一词，鼠标轮廓内有一个点，两侧的箭头不断重复向下运动。","use":"当英雄填满屏幕并且人们需要提示页面在下面时使用它。","spec":["视口尺寸为 511 × 168。首屏下方居中显示“向下滚动”（字号 11 像素，字间距 3 像素）和鼠标轮廓（24 × 38，圆角半径 12，线宽 2.2）。一个节拍为 1.57 秒（4.7 秒内 3 次，9.4 秒动画包周期内 6 次）。","内部橙色点（5 × 9）在一个节拍的前 70% 内下降 14 像素，采用二次缓入缓出；在节拍的 45%–75% 之间淡出，并在下一拍重新出现在顶部。","每边 40 px，每边两个向下 V 形（线宽 2.5），间隔半拍，向下漂移 24 px；它们的不透明度遵循正弦曲线，0 → 0.8 → 0。"],"source_summary":"Below the hero, the word \"SCROLL\", a dot inside a mouse outline and arrows on either side keep repeating a downward motion.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport. Centered below the hero: \"SCROLL\" (11 px, 3 px letter spacing) and a mouse outline (24 × 38, radius 12, line width 2.2). One beat takes 1.57 s (three per 4.7 s, six per 9.4 s pack cycle).","The orange dot inside (5 × 9) drops 14 px over the first 70% of the beat (quadratic ease-in-out), fades out between 45% and 75%, and reappears at the top on the next beat.","40 px to each side, two down-chevrons (line width 2.5) per side, half a beat apart, drift 24 px downward; their opacity follows a sine, 0 → 0.8 → 0."],"source_use":"Use it when the hero fills the screen and people need a hint that the page goes on below."},"168":{"summary":"在英雄背景中，云朵和波浪不断移动，而标题和按钮则静止在顶部。","use":"将其用于旅行、酒店、餐厅或招聘的英雄部分，这些地方的气氛和动作代表的不仅仅是一张照片。","spec":["视口尺寸为 511 × 168。用 Canvas 绘制的天空、云、山和海组成背景动画，铺满首屏，上方叠加静止标题（白色，28 像素）及按钮。背景每 4.7 秒循环一次（9.4 秒动画包周期内两次）。","云：远层每 170 像素重复一次，每 4.7 秒向右移动 170 像素（约 36 像素/秒）；近层每 340 像素重复一次，每 4.7 秒移动 340 像素（约 72 像素/秒）。山依然静止。","海：三波（y = 118、130、146；振幅 2.5–3 px；波长 90、60、120 px）；只有中间的一个以相反的方式运行，每 4.7 秒移动两个波长（另外两个向右移动一个波长）。","为了便于阅读，12% 的海军蓝图层覆盖了背景，渐变使左侧 300 像素变暗（不透明度 0.45 → 0），标题有阴影（10 像素模糊）。","播放徽章（暂停、静音）位于右下角。在真实网站上，视频使用自动播放、静音、循环播放和内联播放。"],"source_summary":"In the hero background, clouds and waves keep moving, while the headline and button sit still on top.","source_spec":["A 511 × 168 viewport. Background footage (sky, clouds, mountains, sea) fills the hero, with a still headline (28 px, white) and button on top. The footage loops every 4.7 s (twice per 9.4 s pack cycle).","Clouds: the far layer repeats every 170 px and moves 170 px right per 4.7 s (about 36 px/s); the near layer repeats every 340 px and moves 340 px per 4.7 s (about 72 px/s). The mountains stay still.","Sea: three waves (y = 118, 130, 146; amplitude 2.5–3 px; wavelength 90, 60, 120 px); only the middle one runs the other way and moves two wavelengths per 4.7 s (the other two move one wavelength to the right).","For legibility, a 12% navy layer covers the footage, a gradient darkens the left 300 px (opacity 0.45 → 0), and the headline has a shadow (10 px blur).","A playing badge (pause, muted) sits at the bottom right. On a real site the video uses autoplay, muted, loop and playsinline."],"source_use":"Use it on hero sections for travel, hotels, restaurants or recruiting, where atmosphere and motion say more than one photo."},"169":{"summary":"相机直线向上移动，方向不变；当人和建筑物滑落时，地平线保持在中间。","use":"从下到上平滑地显示架子或建筑物，或在不倾斜的情况下改变视线水平。","spec":["摄像头：从1.0m直线上升到3.2m；方向（偏航、俯仰）和焦距（330 px）保持固定","计时：0.5 s 至 3.4 s (2.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","人物静止站在前方 7 米处，在画面中向下移动，脚部先从画面底部移出；右侧 3.5 米、距离 26 米处有一座塔。","由于俯仰角不变，地平线保持在画面中心（#031 起重机上升时向下倾斜）","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开头（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）","右上角的读数显示高度 (↕ 1.0m → ↕ 3.2m)"],"source_summary":"The camera moves straight up without changing its direction; the horizon stays centred while the person and buildings slide down.","source_spec":["Camera: moves straight up from 1.0 m to 3.2 m; direction (yaw, pitch) and focal length (330 px) stay fixed","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: a person stands still 7 m ahead and slides down the frame, leaving at the bottom feet first; a tower stands 3.5 m right, 26 m away","Because the pitch does not change, the horizon stays at the centre of the frame (#031 Crane up tilts down while rising)","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)","Top-right readout shows the height (↕ 1.0m → ↕ 3.2m)"],"source_use":"To show a shelf or a building from bottom to top smoothly, or to change the eye level without tilting."},"170":{"summary":"相机绕其镜头轴滚动一整圈；地平线绕了一圈又回到水平。","use":"用于需要能量的航拍或无人机镜头，或表现出头晕和困惑。","spec":["镜头位置固定（高度 1.5 米），只做横滚，从 0 转至 2π rad（360°）；整个画面绕中心旋转。","计时：0.5 s 至 3.6 s (3.1 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","对象：前方7m处有一人静止不动；地平线、建筑物和人都以相同的角度转动，转动时角落处呈现白色","保持：3.6–4.2 秒。一整圈后，图片等于开始，因此最后 0.5 秒的交叉淡入淡出是不可见的（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）","右上角读数显示角度 (↻ 0° → ↻ 360°)"],"source_summary":"The camera rolls a full turn around its lens axis; the horizon goes all the way round and comes back level.","source_spec":["Camera: position fixed (height 1.5 m); roll only, 0 → 2π rad (360°); the whole picture turns around the frame centre","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.6 s (3.1 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: a person stands still 7 m ahead; horizon, buildings and person all turn by the same angle, and white shows in the corners while turning","Hold: 3.6–4.2 s. After a full turn the picture equals the start, so the final 0.5 s cross-fade is invisible (one pass = 4.7 s)","Top-right readout shows the angle (↻ 0° → ↻ 360°)"],"source_use":"For aerial or drone footage that needs energy, or to show dizziness and confusion."},"171":{"summary":"镜头沿着街道向前移动，而太阳、云朵和路人则快进：一段移动的延时摄影。","use":"一次扫过一座城市或一座建筑物，扫过很长的距离和很长一段时间。","spec":["相机：向前移动 0 m → 22 m（高度 1.6 m，俯仰 +0.05 rad），而太阳、云彩和人物快进 12 小时（#039 延时摄影使相机保持静止）","计时：0.4 s 至 4.1 s (3.7 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","街道：x = ±7.5 m（5–55 m 深，8–16 m 高）处的 12 座建筑物接近相机并离开画面","太阳：沿着弧线从左到右行进，角度-1.25 rad→+1.25 rad，始终位于相机前方170 m；三朵云总共向右漂移140m，每80m环绕一次；六个小人物穿过 11 m 宽的街道","建筑物的阴影远离太阳并随着太阳移动而摆动（半透明灰色）；山脉随着相机移动，因此它们保持其大小","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始处；右上角的读数显示时钟和行驶距离 (06:00 · 0m → 18:00 · 22m)"],"source_summary":"The camera travels forward along a street while the sun, clouds and passers-by run in fast forward: a time-lapse that moves.","source_spec":["Camera: moves forward 0 m → 22 m (height 1.6 m, pitch +0.05 rad) while the sun, clouds and figures fast-forward through 12 hours (#039 Time-lapse keeps the camera still)","Timing: 0.4 s to 4.1 s (3.7 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Street: 12 buildings at x = ±7.5 m (5–55 m deep, 8–16 m tall) approach the camera and leave the frame","Sun: travels left to right along an arc, angle -1.25 rad → +1.25 rad, always 170 m ahead of the camera; three clouds drift 140 m right in total, wrapping every 80 m; six small figures cross an 11 m wide street","Building shadows fall away from the sun and swing as it moves (translucent grey); the mountains move with the camera so they keep their size","Return: cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows the clock and the distance travelled (06:00 · 0m → 18:00 · 22m)"],"source_use":"To cover a long distance and a long stretch of time in one sweep through a city or a building."},"172":{"summary":"连续拍摄一个行走的人，没有剪辑；底部的条形保持一条完整的条带。","use":"保持紧张感和存在感不被破坏，或者将一系列动作展现为一个流动。","spec":["无剪切：一个镜头持续跟随人物 4.2 秒（#041 跳切则分成 5 个镜头）。","受试者：一个人从左前方（x = -3.4 m，5.2 m 深）匀速行走到右后方（x = 2.8 m，9.6 m 深）；腿和手臂摆动 sin(t×7)×0.42 rad","镜头跟随人物向右横移 0 → 1.4 米并同时转向，偏航 = atan2(人物 x − 镜头 x, 深度) × 0.8；高度 1.4 米。","底部是一条带播放头的蓝色条，标注“单镜头、无剪切”，表示镜头没有中断。","返回：在 4.2 秒处停止，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始处（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）","右上角的读数显示经过的时间（无切镜 0.0s → 4.2s）"],"source_summary":"One continuous shot follows a walking person with no cut; the bar at the bottom stays a single unbroken strip.","source_spec":["Join: none; for 4.2 s one shot keeps following the person (#041 Jump cut splits it into five)","Subject: a person walks at constant speed from front left (x = -3.4 m, 5.2 m deep) to back right (x = 2.8 m, 9.6 m deep); legs and arms swing by sin(t×7)×0.42 rad","Camera: trucks right 0 m → 1.4 m after the person while turning, yaw = atan2(person x - camera x, depth)×0.8; height 1.4 m","Bottom strip: one blue bar labelled \"1ショット・カットなし\" (one shot, no cut) with a playhead, showing there is no break","Return: stops at 4.2 s, then cross-fades back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)","Top-right readout shows the elapsed time (NO CUT 0.0s → 4.2s)"],"source_use":"To keep tension and presence unbroken, or to show a sequence of movement as one flow."},"173":{"summary":"与手持式摄像机不同，摄像机在行走的人身后向前滑动，只有缓慢、轻柔的晃动，没有抖动。","use":"让行走动作看起来流畅且具有电影感。","spec":["镜头以 1.7 米/秒匀速前进（每 4.7 秒 8 米），高度 1.45 米、俯仰角 −0.02 rad；无缓动。","摇摆：高度 ±3.5 厘米（每 4.7 秒 2 个周期）、横向 ±5 厘米（1 个周期）、偏航 ±0.012 rad、横滚 ±0.006 rad；均为整数周期的正弦波，幅度较大且缓慢（#034 手持镜头则较快且不规则）。","拍摄对象：一个人以相同的速度在镜头前方5m处行走；腿部和手臂每 4.7 秒迈出 5 步","树木：x = -5 m 处高 3.6 m，x = +5 m 处高 3.2 m，每隔 8 m（两行偏移 4 m）；山脉和太阳随着相机移动","8 m 是网格（2 m）和树（8 m）间距的倍数，因此每 4.7 s 无缝循环一次；右上角的读数显示“斯坦尼康”"],"source_summary":"The camera glides forward after a walking person with only a slow, gentle sway and no jitter, unlike handheld.","source_spec":["Camera: moves forward at a constant 1.7 m/s (8 m per 4.7 s); height 1.45 m, pitch -0.02 rad; no easing","Sway: height ±3.5 cm (2 cycles per 4.7 s), sideways ±5 cm (1 cycle), yaw ±0.012 rad, roll ±0.006 rad, all sine waves with integer periods, slow and wide (#034 Handheld is fast and irregular)","Subject: a person walks 5 m ahead of the camera at the same speed; legs and arms take 5 strides per 4.7 s","Trees: 3.6 m tall at x = -5 m and 3.2 m tall at x = +5 m, every 8 m (the two rows offset by 4 m); the mountains and sun move with the camera","8 m is a multiple of the grid (2 m) and tree (8 m) spacing, so it loops seamlessly every 4.7 s; top-right readout shows \"STEADICAM\""],"source_use":"To make a walking move look smooth and cinematic."},"174":{"summary":"摄像机在身后几米处沿着同一条路径跟踪一个蜿蜒的步行者；从后面看，这个人停留在中心附近。","use":"与角色一起进入一个地方，或者获得类似游戏的第三人称视角。","spec":["路径：人走曲线x = 1.8·sin(2.2s)，深度z = 4 + 9s（s从0到1），从4 m到13 m远","摄像机：在 s-0.4 处沿同一条曲线行驶（后面约 3.6–3.9 m）并始终面向人，偏航 = atan2(人 x - 摄像机 x，人 z - 摄像机 z)；高度 1.5 m","计时：0.3 s 至 4.2 s（3.9 s），三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）；腿和手臂摆动 sin(s×30)×0.42 rad","从后面看，人物停留在画面中心附近；前景中路边的柱子和岩石扫过（#029 跟踪镜头并排运行）","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始位置（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）；右上角的读数显示到人的距离（跟随 3.6–3.9m）"],"source_summary":"The camera trails a weaving walker along the same path a few metres behind; the person stays near the centre, seen from the back.","source_spec":["Path: the person walks the curve x = 1.8·sin(2.2s), depth z = 4 + 9s (s from 0 to 1), from 4 m to 13 m away","Camera: follows on the same curve at s-0.4 (about 3.6–3.9 m behind) and always faces the person, yaw = atan2(person x - camera x, person z - camera z); height 1.5 m","Timing: 0.3 s to 4.2 s (3.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)); legs and arms swing by sin(s×30)×0.42 rad","The person stays near the centre of frame, seen from behind; posts and a rock beside the path sweep past in the foreground (#029 Tracking shot runs alongside)","Return: cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s); top-right readout shows the distance to the person (FOLLOW 3.6–3.9m)"],"source_use":"To enter a place together with a character, or for a third-person, game-like view."},"175":{"summary":"一个人从三脚架固定的摄像机前面穿过，一辆汽车从后面经过；相机不会移动一个像素。","use":"使主体在对比中脱颖而出，用于定点观察，或作为延时摄影和合成的基础。","spec":["摄像头：完全固定（高度1.4 m，朝前，焦距330 px）；只有主体移动","对象：一个人在前方 6.5 m 处匀速从左向右穿过（x = -6.2 m → +6.2 m，用时 4.7 s）；腿和手臂摆动 sin(u×7)×0.42 rad","灰色汽车在距离镜头 15 米处从右向左穿行：4.7 秒内 x 从 +16 米变至 −16 米。","开始和结束均在帧外，因此每 4.7 秒无缝循环一次","左下角有一个灰色的三脚架标记；右上角的读数显示“固定”（#040 冻结帧停止素材时间；这里时间在运行，只有摄像机静止）"],"source_summary":"A person crosses in front of a tripod-fixed camera and a car passes behind; the camera does not move by a pixel.","source_spec":["Camera: completely fixed (height 1.4 m, facing forward, focal length 330 px); only the subjects move","Subject: a person crosses left to right at constant speed 6.5 m ahead (x = -6.2 m → +6.2 m in 4.7 s); legs and arms swing by sin(u×7)×0.42 rad","A grey car crosses right to left 15 m away (x = +16 m → -16 m in 4.7 s)","Both start and end outside the frame, so it loops seamlessly every 4.7 s","A grey tripod mark at bottom left; top-right readout shows \"LOCKED\" (#040 Freeze frame stops the footage time; here time runs and only the camera is still)"],"source_use":"To make the subject stand out by contrast, for fixed-point observation, or as a base for time-lapse and compositing."},"176":{"summary":"摄像机飞向一堵有窗户的墙，穿过开口，进入远处。","use":"作为开场动作进入建筑物，或通过一次动作从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","spec":["相机：向前移动0m→12.5m（高度1.3m，方向固定）；前方 8 m 处有一堵有窗户的墙，摄像机穿过它","计时：0.5 s 至 3.6 s (3.1 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","墙壁：浅灰色平面，宽 80 m，高 14 m，窗户宽 2.4 m，高 2.2 m（窗台高 0.15 m）；透过它可以看到一个人（右 0.3 m，远 14.5 m）、树木、建筑物和山脉","穿过：墙壁在相机前方0.25 m处停止绘制；此时窗口边缘已在框架之外（半宽约 1580 px），因此它消失得看不见","通过后，远处的地方填满了画面，相机距离人物接近2 m（#035 FPV无人机镜头在树木之间不断穿梭）","返回：3.6–4.2 秒保持；最后 0.5 秒交叉溶解回起始状态。右上角显示到窗户的距离，从“距窗口 8.0m”变为“通过”。"],"source_summary":"The camera flies toward a wall with a window, passes through the opening and comes out into the place beyond.","source_spec":["Camera: moves forward 0 m → 12.5 m (height 1.3 m, direction fixed); a wall with a window stands 8 m ahead and the camera passes through it","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.6 s (3.1 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Wall: a pale grey plane 80 m wide and 14 m tall with a window 2.4 m wide and 2.2 m tall (sill at 0.15 m); through it a person (0.3 m right, 14.5 m away), trees, buildings and mountains are visible","Pass-through: the wall stops being drawn 0.25 m in front of the camera; by then the window edge is outside the frame (half-width about 1580 px), so it vanishes unseen","After the pass the place beyond fills the frame and the camera closes to 2 m from the person (#035 FPV drone shot keeps weaving between trees)","Return: hold 3.6–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows the distance to the window (\"窓まで 8.0m\" → \"通過\", passed)"],"source_use":"To enter a building as an opening move, or to travel from one place to another in a single move."},"177":{"summary":"相机下降到接近地面并向上看；人显得高大，楼高耸。","use":"使人看起来强大或高大，或强调建筑物的高度。","spec":["相机：从 1.5 m 降低到 0.35 m，同时俯仰角为 0 → +0.32 rad（大约向上 18°）；没有前进或后退的动作","计时：0.6 s 至 2.2 s (1.6 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","对象：前方4.5m处有一人静止不动；一座 11.8 m 的塔矗立在左侧 3 m，距离 22 m。当镜头向上看时，人和塔向上伸展，地平线下降","2.2–4.2 秒保持低角度，以便观察构图。","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到眼睛水平（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）；右上角的读数显示角度和高度 (↗ 0° · 1.5m → ↗ 18° · 0.4m)"],"source_summary":"The camera drops to near the ground and looks up; the person looks big and the buildings tower.","source_spec":["Camera: lowers from 1.5 m to 0.35 m while the pitch goes 0 → +0.32 rad (about 18° up); no movement forward or back","Timing: 0.6 s to 2.2 s (1.6 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: a person stands still 4.5 m ahead; an 11.8 m tower stands 3 m left, 22 m away. As the camera looks up, person and tower stretch upward and the horizon drops","Hold: stays at the low angle from 2.2 s to 4.2 s (time to read the composition itself)","Return: cross-fade back to eye level over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s); top-right readout shows angle and height (↗ 0° · 1.5m → ↗ 18° · 0.4m)"],"source_use":"To make a person look powerful or large, or to emphasise the height of a building."},"178":{"summary":"镜头上升，俯视；人物看起来很小，地面占据了画面的大部分。","use":"使一个人看起来脆弱或渺小，或从上面解释情况。","spec":["摄像机：从 1.5 m 上升到 4.5 m，同时俯仰角为 0 → -0.5 rad（大约向下 29°）；没有前进或后退的动作","计时：0.6 s 至 2.2 s (1.6 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","人物静止站在前方 5 米处；镜头俯视时人物变小并向画面下方移动，地面网格占据大部分画面，地平线从顶部移出。","保持：保持高角度2.2秒至4.2秒（#031起重机向上持续上升至9m； #181 鸟瞰90°直视下方）","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到眼睛水平（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）；右上角的读数显示角度和高度 (↘ 0° · 1.5m → ↘ 29° · 4.5m)"],"source_summary":"The camera rises and looks down; the person looks small and the ground fills most of the frame.","source_spec":["Camera: rises from 1.5 m to 4.5 m while the pitch goes 0 → -0.5 rad (about 29° down); no movement forward or back","Timing: 0.6 s to 2.2 s (1.6 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: a person stands still 5 m ahead; as the camera looks down they shrink and move lower, the ground grid fills most of the frame and the horizon leaves at the top","Hold: stays at the high angle from 2.2 s to 4.2 s (#031 Crane up keeps rising to 9 m; 13 Bird's-eye view looks straight down at 90°)","Return: cross-fade back to eye level over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s); top-right readout shows angle and height (↘ 0° · 1.5m → ↘ 29° · 4.5m)"],"source_use":"To make a person look vulnerable or small, or to explain a situation from above."},"179":{"summary":"通过角色的眼睛来看：走路时的摇摆和底部的手表示第一人称，前面的人向你挥手。","use":"将观看者置于角色的位置，或者获得类似游戏或 VR 的感觉。","spec":["相机：在人物眼高1.6m处向前行走0m→3.2m； 0.3 s 至 4.2 s (3.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（关于三次贝塞尔曲线(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","行走摇摆：高度 ±3 厘米（每 4.7 秒 6 个周期），横滚 ±0.008 rad（3 个周期）；仅在移动时叠加。","手：两个底角为蓝色圆形手（距中心±178 px），右侧为白色手机；它们随着身体移动，所以双手保持静止，世界随之摇摆","前方 7.5 米处的人仅在 1.6–3.4 秒举起双臂并保持姿态；前景有两根柱子。","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始位置（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）；右上角的读数显示“主观视角”"],"source_summary":"Seen through a character's eyes: the walking sway and the hands at the bottom say first person, and the person ahead waves at you.","source_spec":["Camera: walks forward 0 m → 3.2 m at the character's eye height of 1.6 m; 0.3 s to 4.2 s (3.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Walking sway: height ±3 cm (6 cycles per 4.7 s), roll ±0.008 rad (3 cycles), added only while moving","Hands: blue rounded hands at both bottom corners (±178 px from centre), a white phone in the right one; they move with the body, so the hands stay still and the world sways","The other person, 7.5 m ahead, raises both arms and waves only from 1.6 s to 3.4 s (looking at you); two posts in the foreground","Return: cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s); top-right readout shows \"POV\""],"source_use":"To put the viewer in the character's place, or for a game-like or VR-like feel."},"180":{"summary":"一个人的后脑勺和肩膀位于画面边缘，而另一个人的视线则越过他们；前景柔和，主体清晰。","use":"展示谈话中谁面对谁并关注对方的表情。","spec":["取景：前景人的头和肩的后部（灰色，左0.62m，距1.15m）填充左边缘；越过肩膀看到另一个人（蓝色，右侧 0.32 m，距离 3.1 m）","焦点：前景肩膀模糊2.6 px，对方清晰，从胸部向上取景","相机：高度1.55 m，偏航+0.05 rad；从 0.5 s 到 3.4 s 缓慢推入 0 m → 0.35 m（三次缓入缓出（大约三次贝塞尔曲线(0.65,0,0.35,1)））","对方手臂和腿的摆动由共享人物函数计算：sw = 0.42·sin(0.35·sin(5u)) rad，左右肢体方向相反，呈轻微交谈姿态。","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始处；右上角的读数显示“过肩”"],"source_summary":"The back of one person's head and shoulder sit at the edge of frame and the other person is seen past them; the foreground is soft, the subject sharp.","source_spec":["Framing: the back of the foreground person's head and shoulder (grey, 0.62 m left, 1.15 m away) fill the left edge; the other person (blue, 0.32 m right, 3.1 m away) is seen past the shoulder","Focus: the foreground shoulder is blurred 2.6 px, the other person is sharp and framed from the chest up","Camera: height 1.55 m, yaw +0.05 rad; pushes in slowly 0 m → 0.35 m from 0.5 s to 3.4 s (cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))","The other person sways arms and legs by 0.35·sin(u×5) rad, as if talking","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows \"OTS\""],"source_use":"To show who is facing whom in a conversation and to focus on the other person's expression."},"181":{"summary":"从头顶俯视：道路、人、汽车和树木呈现出自上而下的形状，随着镜头的上升，更多的东西进入视野。","use":"以图表的方式显示布局和路径，或获得上帝视角的概览。","spec":["相机：垂直向下（俯仰 -π/2 = -90°）并从 9 m 上升到 15 m，位于原点正上方","计时：0.5 s 至 3.4 s (2.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","地面绘制为一个平面：2 米网格、3.2 米宽的道路和白色虚线中线；六棵树画为圆形，三栋建筑画为矩形（3×2.4、3.4×2.8、2.6×2 米）。","主体：人物（圆形头部、椭圆形肩部）沿道路右侧向上走 5.2 米；汽车（1.8 × 4 米）沿左侧向下行驶 6.8 米。两者均按进度 p 成比例移动。","随着相机的升高，一切都会缩小，更多的地面进入视野（#178 高角度为斜向俯视）","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始处；右上角读数显示“↓ 90° · 9m → 15m”"],"source_summary":"Looking straight down from overhead: road, people, cars and trees appear as top-down shapes, and more comes into view as the camera rises.","source_spec":["Camera: points straight down (pitch -π/2 = -90°) and rises from 9 m to 15 m, directly above the origin","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Ground: a 2 m grid and a 3.2 m wide road (white dashed centre line) drawn as one plane; six trees as circles and three buildings as squares, seen from above","Subjects: a person (head circle and shoulder ellipse) walks 5.2 m up the right side of the road, a car (1.8×4 m) drives 6.8 m down the left side; both move in proportion to the progress p","As the camera rises everything shrinks and more of the ground comes into view (10 High angle looks down at a slant)","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows \"↓ 90° · 9m → 15m\""],"source_use":"To show layout and paths like a diagram, or for a god's-eye overview."},"182":{"summary":"从前面的花，到后面的人和建筑物，一切都同时成为焦点。","use":"当观看者可能会看到画面中的任何地方，或者同时显示在不同深度发生的几件事情时。","spec":["相机：位置、方向、焦距全部固定（高度1.1m）；仅模糊量发生变化","模糊：前景花朵（左 0.75 米、距离 2 米）由模糊 5 像素变为 0 像素；背景（人物偏右 0.9 米、距离 9 米，以及建筑和山）由 6 像素变为 0 像素；两者同时变清晰（#033 焦点转移则是一侧变模糊）。","计时：0.5 s 至 3.4 s (2.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","焦点标记：花（半宽 46 px）和人（半宽 30 px）上的蓝色角括号，焦点到达时不透明度 0 → 1","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始处；右上角的读数显示光圈 (f/1.8 → f/16)"],"source_summary":"From the flower in front to the person and buildings behind, everything comes into sharp focus at the same time.","source_spec":["Camera: position, direction and focal length all fixed (height 1.1 m); only the blur amounts change","Blur: the foreground flower (0.75 m left, 2 m away) goes 5 px → 0 px and the background (person 0.9 m right, 9 m away; buildings; mountains) goes 6 px → 0 px, both sharpening together (#033 Rack focus blurs one side)","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Focus markers: blue corner brackets on both the flower (half-width 46 px) and the person (half-width 30 px), opacity 0 → 1 as focus arrives","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows the aperture (f/1.8 → f/16)"],"source_use":"When the viewer may look anywhere in the frame, or to show several things happening at different depths at once."},"183":{"summary":"视野开阔，俯瞰整个城镇；相机缓慢推入，位置标题出现在左下角。","use":"在场景开始时说出我们在哪里，或者每当地点或时间发生变化时。","spec":["镜头：广角（焦距 220 像素，显示为 16mm），高度 4.5 米，俯仰 −0.06 rad；从 −5 米缓慢推至 −2.5 米。","计时：0.3 s 至 4.2 s (3.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","场景：30 米外有 8 栋城市建筑；右侧 16 米、距离 36 米处有一座塔，另外有 3 朵云和山脉。左侧 1 米、距离 12 米处的小人提供比例参照。","位置说明：从 0.9 秒到 1.3 秒，一张写有“外景·城市·日”（158×30 像素，左侧蓝色条）的白色卡片在左下角淡入，同时向上移动 8 像素，然后保持不变","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始位置（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）；右上角的读数显示“16mm 广角”"],"source_summary":"A wide, high view of the whole town; the camera pushes in slowly and a location caption appears at bottom left.","source_spec":["Camera: wide lens (focal length 220 px, shown as 16mm), height 4.5 m, pitch -0.06 rad; pushes in slowly from -5 m to -2.5 m","Timing: 0.3 s to 4.2 s (3.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Scene: eight city buildings 30 m away, a tower 16 m right and 36 m away, three clouds and mountains; a small person 1 m left, 12 m away gives the scale","Location caption: from 0.9 s to 1.3 s a white card reading \"EXT. CITY – DAY\" (158×30 px, blue bar on its left) fades in at bottom left while moving up 8 px, then stays","Return: cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s); top-right readout shows \"16mm WIDE\""],"source_use":"At the start of a scene to say where we are, or whenever the place or time changes."},"184":{"summary":"从面部特写到只有眼睛的画面。","use":"为了情感的巅峰，或者让观看者注意到一个小细节。","spec":["镜头固定：将前方 1.3 米处的人物右眼（偏中心左 0.06 米、高 1.66 米）置于画面中心。","焦距：610px→2040px（显示为44mm→148mm，约3.3×）； f = 610 × (2040/610)^p，其中 p 是从 0.5 s 到 3.4 s 的三次缓入缓出（大约三次贝塞尔曲线(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","面部：蓝色头部半径 0.16 米；白色眼睛为横向半径 0.045 米、纵向半径 0.028 米的椭圆，深色瞳孔半径 0.016 米，另有高光和白色眉毛。起始头部宽约 150 像素，最后眼睛占据画面。","背景：树木和建筑模糊 3 像素，在镜头推近时逐渐移出画面。","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始处；右上角的读数显示焦距和缩写（44mm 特写 → 148mm 大特写）"],"source_summary":"From a close-up of the face to a frame filled by nothing but the eyes.","source_spec":["Camera: the face's right eye (0.06 m left of centre, 1.66 m high) 1.3 m ahead is placed at the centre of frame; the camera does not move","Focal length: 610 px → 2040 px (shown as 44mm → 148mm, about 3.3×); f = 610 × (2040/610)^p, where p is a cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)) from 0.5 s to 3.4 s","Face: a blue head (radius 0.16 m) with white eyes (ellipses 0.045×0.028 m), dark pupils (radius 0.016 m), highlights and white brows; it starts as a close-up of the whole face (head about 150 px across) and ends with only the eyes filling the frame","Background: trees and buildings blurred 3 px, leaving the frame as the lens closes in","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows the focal length and the abbreviation (44mm CU → 148mm ECU)"],"source_use":"For the emotional peak, or to make the viewer notice one small detail."},"185":{"summary":"人物手腕上的手表的大特写镜头切入场景 1.3 秒，然后返回到同一个镜头。","use":"展示一个小物体或一个手部动作，或指出一个重要的道具。","spec":["连接：两个直切（0 帧）； 1.6 秒到达细节，2.9 秒返回场景（细节持续 1.3 秒）","主镜头（A）：固定摄像机（高1.4 m）；一个人站在左侧0.6m处，距离6m，手腕上戴着手表（黑点）；右侧 2.2 m 处有一个柱子，距离 4 m","细节（插入）：同一场景的手腕大特写；淡蓝色上的蓝色套筒（600×92 像素，旋转 -0.35 rad）、白色表盘（半径 58 像素）、深色指针和蓝色秒针，每 1.3 秒转一圈","底部条带依次为 A（灰色）、细节（蓝色）、A（灰色），带播放头；插入内容属于同一场景（#189 切出镜头展示不同主体）。","右上角读数显示“镜头 A”→“插入”→“镜头 A”； 4.7 秒时直接切回开头"],"source_summary":"A big close-up of the watch on the person's wrist is cut into the scene for 1.3 s, then it returns to the same shot.","source_spec":["Join: two straight cuts (0 frames); to the detail at 1.6 s and back to the scene at 2.9 s (the detail lasts 1.3 s)","Main shot (A): fixed camera (height 1.4 m); a person stands 0.6 m left, 6 m away, with a watch (dark dot) on the wrist; a post 2.2 m right, 4 m away","Detail (INSERT): a big close-up of the wrist from the same scene; a blue sleeve (600×92 px, rotated -0.35 rad) on pale blue, a white dial (radius 58 px), dark hands and a blue second hand that makes one turn in 1.3 s","Bottom strip: three sections A (grey), detail (blue), A (grey) with a playhead; what is cut in belongs to the same scene (21 Cutaway shows a different subject)","Top-right readout shows \"SHOT A\" → \"INSERT\" → \"SHOT A\"; at 4.7 s it cuts straight back to the start"],"source_use":"To show a small object or a hand action, or to point out an important prop."},"186":{"summary":"同一个人的两个镜头通过平滑插值的位置和姿势连接在一起，因此不会像跳切那样跳跃。","use":"收紧采访或叙述，或在不引起注意的情况下删除一个错误。","spec":["镜次 1（0–2.0 秒）镜头高 1.45 米，人物偏左 0.4 米、距离 3.3 米；镜次 2（2.45 秒起）人物偏右 0.35 米。两个姿势的输入分别为 −0.45 + 0.12·sin(3t) 和 0.55 + 0.12·sin(3t)，再由共享人物函数计算摆动角度 0.42·sin(输入)。","变形：2.0–2.45 秒（历时 0.45 秒）。位置采用二次缓入缓出插值（约为 cubic-bezier(0.45,0,0.55,1)），两个姿势绘制在同一插值位置并交叉溶解。","变形时按 sin(q×π)×2.2 像素计算全画面模糊；数值大于 0.05 像素时才启用滤镜（#041 跳切让位置直接跳变）。","底部条带依次显示镜次 1（灰色）、变形（蓝色、窄）、镜次 2（灰色），并带播放头。","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到片段 1 的开头；右上角的读数显示“镜次 1”→“变形”→“镜次 2”"],"source_summary":"Two takes of the same person are joined by smoothly interpolating position and pose, so nothing jumps as in a jump cut.","source_spec":["Take 1 (0–2.0 s): fixed camera (height 1.45 m); the person stands 0.4 m left, 3.3 m away, arms and legs at -0.45 rad. Take 2 (from 2.45 s): 0.35 m right, +0.55 rad. Both sway slightly by 0.12·sin(t×3) rad","Morph (2.0–2.45 s, 0.45 s): the position is interpolated with a quadratic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.45,0,0.55,1)), and the two poses are drawn at the same interpolated position and cross-faded","Only during the morph a blur of sin(q×π)×2.2 px is applied to the whole frame to soften the join (#041 Jump cut lets the position jump)","Bottom strip: take 1 (grey), morph (blue, narrow), take 2 (grey) with a playhead","Return: cross-fade back to the start of take 1 over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows \"TAKE 1\" → \"MORPH\" → \"TAKE 2\""],"source_use":"To tighten an interview or narration, or to remove a slip without drawing attention."},"187":{"summary":"整个画面沉入黑色，接下来的场景从黑色中变亮。","use":"用于章节中断、一段较长的时间或一个故事的结尾。","spec":["淡出：从 1.4 秒到 2.6 秒（1.2 秒）黑色（rgb(20,20,24)）覆盖在输出图像上，不透明度为 0 → 100%，二次缓入缓出（大约为三次贝塞尔曲线（0.45,0,0.55,1））","2.6–3.1 秒内画面被 rgb(20,20,24) 深近黑色完全覆盖；2.9 秒时在遮罩下直接切换到下一画面。","淡入：从 3.1 秒到 4.3 秒（1.2 秒），黑色以相同的缓动从 100% → 0","相机：固定在两张图片中（A高度1.4m；B高度1.6m，俯仰+0.1rad）；拍摄对象也不移动","每 4.7 秒交替 A→B 和 B→A（往返 9.4 秒）；右上角的读数显示“淡出”/“淡入”；取景器标记停留在黑色上方"],"source_summary":"The whole picture sinks to black, and the next scene brightens out of the black.","source_spec":["Fade out: from 1.4 s to 2.6 s (1.2 s) black (rgb(20,20,24)) is laid over the outgoing picture with opacity 0 → 100%, quadratic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.45,0,0.55,1))","Black: fully black from 2.6 s to 3.1 s; at 2.9 s the incoming picture is swapped in unseen, with a straight cut","Fade in: from 3.1 s to 4.3 s (1.2 s) the black goes from 100% → 0 with the same easing","Camera: fixed in both pictures (A at height 1.4 m; B at height 1.6 m, pitch +0.1 rad); the subjects do not move either","Alternates A→B and B→A every 4.7 s (9.4 s for the round trip); top-right readout shows \"FADE OUT\" / \"FADE IN\"; the viewfinder marks stay over the black"],"source_use":"For a chapter break, a long passage of time, or the end of a story."},"188":{"summary":"一个圆圈关闭在人物身上，直到画面变黑，然后在下一个场景中再次打开。","use":"适合无声电影或卡通风格的结局，或有趣的休息。","spec":["圈出：1.3–2.7 秒（历时 1.4 秒），圆形窗口半径从 340 像素缩小至 0，采用二次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.45,0,0.55,1)）；圆外为黑色（#141418）。","窗口中心：当前画面主体，A处人头（左0.6m，高1.63m，距离7m）或B处车（右1.2m，高0.9m，距离9m），投射到屏幕上","黑色：2.7–3.1 秒；在 2.9 秒时，传入的图像会以直切方式交换","圈入：3.1–4.4 秒（历时 1.3 秒），圆形窗口以下一个画面的主体为中心，从 0 增大到半径 340 像素。","当圆形窗口半径大于 1 且小于 339 像素时，以 2 像素蓝色圆圈标记边缘；两个场景的相机均固定。","每 4.7 秒交替 A→B 和 B→A（往返 9.4 秒）；右上角的读数显示“圈出”/“圈入”"],"source_summary":"A circle closes down on the person until the frame is black, then opens again on the next scene.","source_spec":["Iris out: from 1.3 s to 2.7 s (1.4 s) the circular window shrinks from radius 340 px to 0 (quadratic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.45,0,0.55,1))); outside the circle is black (#141418)","Centre of the window: the current picture's subject, the person's head in A (0.6 m left, 1.63 m high, 7 m away) or the car in B (1.2 m right, 0.9 m high, 9 m away), projected to the screen","Black: 2.7–3.1 s; at 2.9 s the incoming picture is swapped in with a straight cut","Iris in: from 3.1 s to 4.4 s (1.3 s) the circle grows from 0 to 340 px around the incoming picture's subject","Edge: while the radius is at least 1 px, a 2 px blue circle marks the rim; the camera is fixed in both pictures","Alternates A→B and B→A every 4.7 s (9.4 s for the round trip); top-right readout shows \"IRIS OUT\" / \"IRIS IN\""],"source_use":"For a silent-film or cartoon-style ending, or a playful break."},"189":{"summary":"从演讲者到听众，然后再返回；切入的是另一个主题。","use":"显示反应，或隐藏时间跳跃或删除的滑动。","spec":["两次直切（0 帧）：1.7 秒切到另一主体，3.0 秒切回原场景，切出镜头持续 1.3 秒。","主镜头 A：相机固定、高 1.4 米；5.5 米外的人物以 0.42·sin(0.45·sin(6u)) rad 摆动手臂和腿，右侧 0.9 米处有灰色讲台。","另一主体（切出镜头）：5 名聆听的观众，距离 3.1–4.6 米，身穿蓝色和浅蓝色服装，双臂举起，以 |sin(t×9+i)|×5 厘米上下弹跳；场景保留天空和地面，但没有建筑、树木、山和太阳。","底部条带依次为 A（灰色）、另一主体（蓝色）、A（灰色），带播放头；#185 插入镜头则显示同一场景的细节。","右上角读数显示“镜头 A”→“切出”→“镜头 A”； 4.7 秒时直接切回开头"],"source_summary":"From the speaker to the listening audience and back; what is cut in is a different subject.","source_spec":["Join: two straight cuts (0 frames); to the other subject at 1.7 s and back to the scene at 3.0 s (1.3 s away)","Main shot (A): fixed camera (height 1.4 m); a person 5.5 m away talks, swinging arms and legs by 0.45·sin(u×6) rad, with a grey lectern 0.9 m to the right","Other subject (CUTAWAY): the listening audience, five people 3.1–4.6 m away in blue and pale blue with both arms up, bouncing by |sin(t×9+i)|×5 cm; no background (a different place)","Bottom strip: A (grey), other subject (blue), A (grey) with a playhead (17 Insert shot shows a detail of the same scene)","Top-right readout shows \"SHOT A\" → \"CUTAWAY\" → \"SHOT A\"; at 4.7 s it cuts straight back to the start"],"source_use":"To show a reaction, or to hide a time skip or a removed slip."},"190":{"summary":"两个场景同时发生，一个跑步者和一辆汽车，在越来越短的剪辑中交替出现。","use":"在同时发生的事情之间制造紧张感，例如追逐或救援。","spec":["两个场景共享一个时钟：A是跑步者（左0.3 m，深度15 m → 4.5 m，腿在u×12），B是城市中的汽车（右1 m，深度17 m → 4.5 m）；两者都在 4.7 秒内接近","A、B 镜头在 0 / 1.1 / 2.0 / 2.7 / 3.3 / 3.8 / 4.2 / 4.5 秒直切；八段时长依次为 1.1、0.9、0.7、0.6、0.5、0.4、0.3、0.2 秒。最后 0.3 秒同时交叉淡入第一个场景。","另一场景出现在画面上时，当前场景仍持续运行；切回来时其中主体已经继续移动。","相机：A，高度1.3 m，固定，前景有四个柱子； B 高度 1.6 m，俯仰 +0.06 rad，固定，城市和太阳","底部条带：八个交替的 A（灰色）和 B（蓝色）部分，带有播放头；最后 0.3 秒交叉淡入淡出回到 A 的开头","右上角的读数显示“场景 A”/“场景 B”"],"source_summary":"Two scenes happening at the same time, a runner and a car, alternate in shorter and shorter cuts.","source_spec":["Two scenes share one clock: A is a runner (0.3 m left, depth 15 m → 4.5 m, legs at u×12), B is a car in the city (1 m right, depth 17 m → 4.5 m); both close in over 4.7 s","Cuts: straight cuts between A and B at 0 / 1.1 / 2.0 / 2.7 / 3.3 / 3.8 / 4.2 / 4.5 s; the shots shorten 1.1 → 0.9 → 0.7 → 0.6 → 0.5 → 0.4 → 0.3 s to raise the tension","Each scene keeps running while the other is on screen (when it comes back, its subject has moved on)","Camera: A at height 1.3 m, fixed, with four posts in the foreground; B at height 1.6 m, pitch +0.06 rad, fixed, with the city and sun","Bottom strip: eight alternating sections A (grey) and B (blue) with a playhead; the last 0.3 s cross-fades back to the start of A","Top-right readout shows \"SCENE A\" / \"SCENE B\""],"source_use":"To build tension between things happening at once, such as a chase or a rescue."},"191":{"summary":"时间几乎停止在跳跃的顶部，而摄像机围绕着人旋转。","use":"以三维方式展示决定性时刻，或作为动作场景的亮点。","spec":["素材时间：正常运行 0–1.5 秒，从 1.5 秒到 3.3 秒以 0.1× 运行（1.8 秒内只有 0.18 秒的素材），然后再次正常运行（素材时间 = u - 1.62）","距离 9 米的人物在素材时间 0.6–2.6 秒内沿抛物线跳跃（顶点 1.1 米、双臂举起）；慢动作期间人物看似停在顶点附近（跳跃进度 45%–54%），9 片叶子按相同素材时间下落。","镜头：慢动作期间，以人物为中心、半径 6 米绕行，从 −0.6 rad 到 +0.6 rad（约 69°），采用三次缓入缓出（约为 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）；始终面向中心，高度 1.6 米，俯仰角 −0.05 rad。","接下来的 4.7 秒沿反方向环绕（+0.6 → −0.6 rad），镜头角度在周期边界衔接；叶子的素材时间在边界重置，可能有轻微跳变。#030 环绕镜头不会停止时间。","地面上半径 1.3 m 的虚线圆和 10 m 处的树木环；右上角读数显示“×1.0”→“子弹时间 ×0.1”→“×1.0”"],"source_summary":"Time nearly stops at the top of a jump while the camera circles around the person.","source_spec":["Footage time: runs normally for 0–1.5 s, at 0.1× from 1.5 s to 3.3 s (only 0.18 s of footage in 1.8 s), then normally again (footage time = u - 1.62)","Subject: a person 9 m away jumps on a parabola over footage time 0.6–2.6 s (peak 1.1 m, arms raised); during the slow part they seem to hang near the top (45–54% through); nine leaves fall on the same footage time","Camera: during the slow part it travels on a circle of radius 6 m around the person from -0.6 rad to +0.6 rad (about 69°), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)); always facing the centre, height 1.6 m, pitch -0.05 rad","The next 4.7 s pass circles the other way (+0.6 → -0.6 rad), so the 9.4 s loop is seamless (#030 Orbit does not stop time)","A dashed circle of radius 1.3 m on the ground and a ring of trees at 10 m; top-right readout shows \"×1.0\" → \"BULLET ×0.1\" → \"×1.0\""],"source_use":"To show a decisive moment in three dimensions, or as the highlight of an action scene."},"192":{"summary":"七个短镜头展示了三十天的训练；直线切割，日期在右上角跳跃。","use":"表现出短时间内的长期变化或努力。","spec":["直切连接的七个镜头（0 帧）：0.75 / 0.7 / 0.65 / 0.65 / 0.65 / 0.6 / 0.7 秒（总共 4.7 秒）；右上角的日期跳跃 第 1 → 3 → 7 → 12 → 20 → 28 → 30 天","镜头依次为：1 跟拍跑者（腿部频率 t×14）；2 公园跳跃；3 日出（太阳高度 4 → 12 米）；4 低角度举起双臂；5 城市行走（焦距 420 像素）；6 围绕人物从 −0.3 转至 +0.3 rad；7 在旗帜前举起双臂。","三十天的训练浓缩为4.7秒；摄像机位置、高度和焦距随每次拍摄而变化（#041 跳切保持相同的取景）","下条：七段，仅当前镜头为蓝色；最后 0.3 秒交叉淡入淡出回到第一个镜头的开始处"],"source_summary":"Seven short shots show thirty days of training; straight cuts, with the date jumping at top right.","source_spec":["Seven shots joined by straight cuts (0 frames): 0.75 / 0.7 / 0.65 / 0.65 / 0.65 / 0.6 / 0.7 s (4.7 s in all); the date at top right jumps DAY 1 → 3 → 7 → 12 → 20 → 28 → 30","Shots: 1 tracking a runner (legs at t×14), 2 a jump in the park, 3 sunrise (sun rising from 4 m to 12 m), 4 arms raised from a low angle, 5 walking in the city (focal length 420 px), 6 circling the person from -0.3 to +0.3 rad, 7 arms raised in front of a flag","Thirty days of training condensed into 4.7 s; camera position, height and focal length change with every shot (#041 Jump cut keeps the same framing)","Bottom strip: seven sections, only the current shot in blue; the last 0.3 s cross-fades back to the start of the first shot"],"source_use":"To show a long period of change or effort in a short time."},"001":{"summary":"应用图标弹跳入场，随后右上角的通知徽标弹出。","use":"适用于图标、按钮或徽标等小元素的轻快入场。","spec":["每 2.35 秒出现一次（4.7 秒一周期内出现两次：第一次为珊瑚色背景与星形，第二次为蓝色背景与心形）。","图标：边长 116 像素、圆角半径 30 的正方形。从 0.28 秒开始，按弹簧曲线 1 − e^(−6.5t)·cos(15t) 将缩放从 0 增至 1，峰值约 1.26。","同时按弹簧曲线 1 − e^(−6t)·cos(11t)，将旋转角从 −0.35 rad（约 −20°）回到 0。","徽章：黄色圆圈，半径 25，带有“1”，位于图标的右上角（+52，-52）。从 0.62 s 开始，弹簧为 1 − e^(−7t)·cos(17t)。","退场：1.86–2.12 秒。缩放值乘以 (1 − backIn，s = 2.2)，因此先略微膨胀，再缩小到 0。","地板阴影为椭圆，横向半径 62、纵向半径 8 像素；两个半径均随图标缩放，缩放值限制为 0–1。"],"source_summary":"An app icon pops in with a bounce, then a notification badge pops in a moment later.","source_spec":["One pop per 2.35 s (twice per 4.7 s cycle: a star on coral first, then a heart on blue).","Icon: 116 px rounded square (radius 30). From 0.28 s, scale 0→1 with a spring: 1 − e^(−6.5t)·cos(15t), peaking at about 1.26.","At the same time, rotation −0.35 rad (about −20°) → 0 with a spring: 1 − e^(−6t)·cos(11t).","Badge: yellow circle, radius 25, with \"1\", at the icon's top-right (+52, −52). Starts at 0.62 s with spring 1 − e^(−7t)·cos(17t).","Exit: 1.86–2.12 s. Scale is multiplied by (1 − backIn, s = 2.2), so it swells slightly and then shrinks to 0.","Floor shadow: 62 × 8 ellipse that scales with the icon (clamped to 0–1)."],"source_use":"Use it to bring in a small element such as an icon, button or badge with a light accent."},"002":{"summary":"图表条从左侧依次上升，每条都略有延迟。","use":"使用它可以按顺序引入多个项目（列表行、图表条、卡片）并引导视线浏览它们。","spec":["每 2.35 秒播放一次。7 根柱条（宽 44、间距 20、高度依次为 52、84、68、112、92、136、158），按蓝色、珊瑚色、黄色、薄荷色循环排列。","第 i 根柱条（从 0 开始计数）在 0.15 + 0.12·i 秒开始，以 backOut 缓动（s = 2.6）在 0.5 秒内从零长到完整高度；底边固定，先超过目标高度再回落。","白点（半径 6.5，位于柱条顶端上方 16 像素）比对应柱条晚 0.34 秒出现，弹簧曲线为 1 − e^(−7t)·cos(16t)。","退场：柱条从 1.78 + 0.045·i 秒起，在 0.26 秒内按三次缓入收缩；白点先消失，从 1.70 + 0.045·i 秒起耗时 0.2 秒。"],"source_summary":"Chart bars rise one after another from the left, each slightly delayed.","source_spec":["One pass per 2.35 s. Seven bars (width 44, gap 20, heights 52, 84, 68, 112, 92, 136, 158), coloured blue, coral, yellow, mint in rotation.","Bar i (0-based) starts at 0.15 + 0.12·i s and grows from 0 to full height in 0.5 s with backOut (s = 2.6), anchored at the baseline, overshooting and settling.","White dot (radius 6.5, 16 px above the bar top): starts 0.34 s after its bar with spring 1 − e^(−7t)·cos(16t).","Exit: bars shrink with cubic ease-in over 0.26 s starting at 1.78 + 0.045·i s; dots vanish first, over 0.2 s from 1.70 + 0.045·i s."],"source_use":"Use it to bring in several items (list rows, chart bars, cards) in sequence and lead the eye across them."},"003":{"summary":"一颗类似的心填满，一个圆环、线条和点同时爆发出来。","use":"用它来标记某件事被触发或实现的瞬间，例如点赞、成功或正确答案。","spec":["每 2.35 秒爆发一次。一颗心（尺寸 46，轮廓 7 像素）位于中心。","预备动作：0.3–0.5 秒，缩放从 1 减至 0.7，采用二次缓入缓出。","0.5 秒触发：心形填充珊瑚色，并按弹簧曲线 1 − e^(−6.5t)·cos(16t) 将缩放从 0.7 恢复至 1。","圆环：黄色，半径从 44 增至 90，线宽从 16 减至 0，历时 0.6 秒，采用五次缓出。","10条径向线（黄色/薄荷色交替，宽度9）：外端半径64→130（y缩放0.82）；触发后 0.22 到 0.7 秒之间长度 36 缩小到 0。","10 个点（珊瑚色/蓝色交替，半径 8→4.8）：椭圆形上的半径 58→150（x ×1.45，y ×0.78），触发后 0.3–0.72 秒淡出。心形填充在 1.92–2.2 秒时消失。"],"source_summary":"A like heart fills in, and a ring, lines and dots burst outward at the same moment.","source_spec":["One burst per 2.35 s. A heart (size 46, 7 px outline) sits in the centre.","Anticipation: 0.3–0.5 s, scale 1→0.7 (quadratic ease-in-out).","Trigger at 0.5 s: the heart fills with coral and scale returns 0.7→1 with spring 1 − e^(−6.5t)·cos(16t).","Ring: yellow, radius 44→90 while line width goes 16→0, over 0.6 s with quintic ease-out.","10 radial lines (yellow/mint alternating, width 9): outer end radius 64→130 (y scaled 0.82); length 36 shrinks to 0 between 0.22 and 0.7 s after the trigger.","10 dots (coral/blue alternating, radius 8→4.8): radius 58→150 on an ellipse (x ×1.45, y ×0.78), fading out 0.3–0.72 s after the trigger. The heart fill fades at 1.92–2.2 s."],"source_use":"Use it to mark the instant something is triggered or achieved, such as a like, a success or a correct answer."},"004":{"summary":"图表线会自行绘制，然后从其起始端擦除。","use":"当笔画本身就是点时使用它：图表、路线、下划线、手绘圆圈。","spec":["每 4.7 秒播放一次。采用修剪路径绘制：为每条描边的可见范围（起始比例至结束比例）设置动画。","坐标轴（L 形，线宽 6）在 0.08–0.7 秒绘出；曲线（薄荷色，线宽 11、经过 7 个点、端点为圆头）在 0.4–1.95 秒绘出。两者均采用三次缓入缓出。","绘制时，黄色圆点（半径 12，白色中心半径 5）跟随线条前端。","箭头：1.9–2.2 秒以 backOut 回弹缓动（s = 2.5）展开；两翼长 26、宽 20。","珊瑚圈（半径 26，宽度 7）在 2.2-2.8 秒处围绕一个峰绘制，从顶部顺时针方向。","擦除：圆3.5–4.0 s，线3.65–4.45 s，轴3.85–4.55 s，每个从其起始端收缩。箭头在 4.3–4.45 秒时消失。"],"source_summary":"A chart line draws itself on, and is later erased from its starting end.","source_spec":["One pass per 4.7 s. Drawn as a trim path: animate the visible range (start fraction to end fraction) of each stroke.","Axes (L shape, width 6) draw at 0.08–0.7 s; the line (mint, width 11, a smooth curve through 7 points, round caps) draws at 0.4–1.95 s. Both use cubic ease-in-out.","While drawing, a yellow dot (radius 12, white centre radius 5) rides the leading tip.","Arrowhead: opens at 1.9–2.2 s with backOut (s = 2.5); wings 26 long, 20 wide.","A coral circle (radius 26, width 7) is drawn around one peak at 2.2–2.8 s, clockwise from the top.","Erase: circle 3.5–4.0 s, line 3.65–4.45 s, axes 3.85–4.55 s, each shrinking from its starting end. The arrowhead fades at 4.3–4.45 s."],"source_use":"Use it when the stroke itself is the point: charts, routes, underlines, hand-drawn circles."},"005":{"summary":"标题文本从由单行标记的不可见边缘后面滑出。","use":"将其用于应以干净、简洁的方式显示的标题和标题。","spec":["每 2.35 秒播放一次。珊瑚色分隔线（380 × 6，y = 124）在 0.1–0.5 秒从中心伸展（三次缓入缓出），在 2.05–2.3 秒收缩消失。","顶部文本（粗体 98 像素，白色）：剪裁到线条上方的区域 (y 8–119)；在 0.35-1.0 秒内从下方 120 像素向上移动到位，五次缓出。","底部文本（32 px，黄色）：剪裁到线条下方的区域 (y 129–181)；在 0.55–1.15 秒内从上方 60 像素向下移动到位，五次缓出。","退场：顶部文字在 1.7–2.05 秒内向上移动 150 像素（backIn，s = 1.2，先略微下沉）；底部文字在 1.75–2.05 秒内向下移动 70 像素（三次缓入）。","不透明度始终不变；文字仅通过移出裁剪区域而被隐藏。"],"source_summary":"Headline text slides out from behind an invisible edge marked by a single line.","source_spec":["One pass per 2.35 s. Divider line (coral, 380 × 6, y = 124): grows from the centre at 0.1–0.5 s (cubic ease-in-out), shrinks away at 2.05–2.3 s.","Top text (bold 98 px, white): clipped to the area above the line (y 8–119); moves up into place from 120 px below at 0.35–1.0 s, quintic ease-out.","Bottom text (32 px, yellow): clipped to the area below the line (y 129–181); moves down into place from 60 px above at 0.55–1.15 s, quintic ease-out.","Exit: top text moves 150 px up at 1.7–2.05 s (backIn, s = 1.2, dipping slightly first); bottom text moves 70 px down at 1.75–2.05 s (cubic ease-in).","Opacity never changes; the text is hidden only by leaving the clip area."],"source_use":"Use it for titles and headings that should appear in a clean, composed way."},"006":{"summary":"文本一次一个字符地输入到输入字段中，然后发送按钮亮起并被按下。","use":"用它来显示某人正在输入：提示、搜索查询、聊天消息。","spec":["每 4.7 秒循环一次。白色输入框（471 × 92，圆角半径 30）中依次出现 9 个字符：从 0.3 秒起每 0.24 秒出现一个，最后一字在 2.22 秒出现；程序在 2.46 秒结束打字阶段。","每个新字符的缩放值从 1.35 收敛到 1：1 + 0.35·e^(−16t)。","光标（珊瑚色，5 × 44）位于最后一个字符之后：打字时稳定显示，否则以 0.94 秒的周期闪烁（亮起 0.5 秒）。","发送按钮（半径 30）：灰色，然后从 2.58 s 开始出现一个蓝色圆盘，弹簧为 1 − e^(−6.5t)·cos(15t)。","按下：按钮在 2.96–3.21 秒（半正弦）时收缩最多 20%。在 3.13–3.41 秒处，文本向上移动 70 像素，同时淡出。","文本半褪色后（约 3.27 秒），光标返回开始处；在 3.51–3.81 秒，蓝色逐渐消失。"],"source_summary":"Text is typed into an input field one character at a time, then the send button lights up and is pressed.","source_spec":["One pass per 4.7 s. Nine characters appear in a white input field (471 × 92, radius 30), one every 0.24 s starting at 0.3 s (typing ends at 2.46 s).","Each new character settles from scale 1.35 to 1: 1 + 0.35·e^(−16t).","Cursor (coral, 5 × 44) sits after the last character: solid while typing, otherwise blinking with a 0.94 s period (on for 0.5 s).","Send button (radius 30): grey, then a blue disc appears from 2.58 s with spring 1 − e^(−6.5t)·cos(15t).","Press: the button shrinks by up to 20% at 2.96–3.21 s (half sine). At 3.13–3.41 s the text moves 70 px up while fading out.","The cursor returns to the start once the text is half faded (about 3.27 s); at 3.51–3.81 s the blue fades."],"source_use":"Use it to show someone typing: a prompt, a search query, a chat message."},"007":{"summary":"数字不断向上并锁定其最终值。","use":"用它来让数字感觉很大或在增长：收入、用户数、完成率。","spec":["每 4.7 秒通过一次。在 0.1–0.4 秒时淡入，在 4.0–4.4 秒时淡出。","数字（粗体，104 像素）：在 0.45–2.9 秒内由 0 增至 2,480。数值 = round(target × (1 − (1 − p)^4))，起初较快，接近终点时减速。","包括千位分隔符。每个数字的宽度相同，并且数字右对齐，因此不会横向抖动。","2.9 秒到达目标：颜色从白色变为黄色，缩放产生小幅回弹，公式为 1 + 0.07·e^(−7t)·cos(15t)。","左侧向上箭头徽标（薄荷色圆形，半径 34）从 0.35 秒起按弹簧曲线 1 − e^(−7t)·cos(14t) 出现；计数时垂直抖动量为 6 px × (1 − p)^3 × sin(30u)。","下方进度条（330 × 12，蓝色至薄荷色渐变）按当前数值 / 目标值填充，但填充宽度至少为 12 像素。"],"source_summary":"A number races upward and locks onto its final value.","source_spec":["One pass per 4.7 s. Fades in at 0.1–0.4 s and out at 4.0–4.4 s.","Number (bold 104 px): 0→2,480 over 0.45–2.9 s. Value = round(target × (1 − (1 − p)^4)): fast at first, slow at the end.","Thousands separator included. Every digit has the same width and the number is right-aligned, so it does not jitter sideways.","Lands at 2.9 s: colour switches white→yellow and scale does a small bounce, 1 + 0.07·e^(−7t)·cos(15t).","Up-arrow chip on the left (mint circle, radius 34): appears from 0.35 s with spring 1 − e^(−7t)·cos(14t); while counting it shakes vertically by 6 px × (1 − p)^3 × sin(30u).","Bar below (330 × 12, blue→mint gradient): fills in proportion to value ÷ target."],"source_use":"Use it to make a figure feel big or growing: revenue, user counts, completion rates."},"008":{"summary":"词语按照它们的意思移动：一个伸展，一个弹跳，一个旋转，一个猛烈向下。","use":"使用它可以通过旁白或歌词中的关键词的移动方式令人难忘。","spec":["四组文字，各占 1.175 秒（主要文字为粗体 88 像素）。每组在该段结束前 0.2–0.02 秒淡出并向上移动最多 46 像素；位移采用三次缓入。","拉伸（蓝色）：水平缩放为 0.3 + 0.7 × [1 − e^(−4.2t)·cos(12t)]；垂直缩放为 1/√max(0.75, 水平缩放)。","弹跳（黄色）：字符错开0.1秒；高度 78 像素 × |sin(πt/0.4)| × e^(−2.6t);每次接触时垂直挤压最多 16%。","旋转（薄荷色）：字符错开 0.12 秒； 0.62 秒内旋转−360°→0°，带 backOut (s = 1.3)；在 0.25 秒内从 0→1 缩放，三次缓出。","撞击（珊瑚色，100 像素，倾斜）：在 0.02–0.2 秒处缩放 3.4→1，并带有三次缓入。","撞击后：水平震动 10 px × e^(−9t) × sin(38t)，垂直挤压 20% × e^(−11t)，以及 8 条径向线，持续 0.4 s。"],"source_summary":"Words move the way they mean: one stretches, one bounces, one spins, one slams down.","source_spec":["Four words, 1.175 s each (bold 88 px). Each exits in its last 0.2 s, fading out while moving 46 px up (cubic ease-in).","Stretch (blue): horizontal scale 0.3→1 with spring 1 − e^(−4.2t)·cos(12t); vertical scale is 1/√(horizontal).","Bounce (yellow): characters staggered by 0.1 s; height 78 px × |sin(πt/0.4)| × e^(−2.6t); squashed vertically by up to 16% at each contact.","Spin (mint): characters staggered by 0.12 s; rotation −360°→0° over 0.62 s with backOut (s = 1.3); scale 0→1 over 0.25 s, cubic ease-out.","Slam (coral, 100 px, slanted): scale 3.4→1 at 0.02–0.2 s with cubic ease-in.","After impact: horizontal shake 10 px × e^(−9t) × sin(38t), vertical squash 20% × e^(−11t), and 8 radial lines for 0.4 s."],"source_use":"Use it to make key words from narration or lyrics memorable through how they move."},"009":{"summary":"两个方块在同一时间内移动相同的距离：上面的方块以恒定的速度，下面的方块则缓慢。","use":"在任何移动、缩放或旋转中使用它，使运动加速和减速，而不是看起来机械的。","spec":["每 4.7 秒往返一趟。两个 62 像素正方形（半径 16）水平移动 316 像素：在 0.2–1.75 秒 (1.55 秒) 处出去，保持 0.8 秒，在 2.55–4.1 秒处返回。","上方（恒速）：采用线性运动，形状和颜色始终不变。","底部（缓和）：三次贝塞尔曲线(.86, 0, .14, 1)。缓慢启动，非常快的中间，缓慢停止。","下方方块的变形按速度变化：水平最多拉伸至 1.5 倍，垂直最多压扁至 0.8 倍（速度 ÷ 3.6，结果限制在 0–1）。","方块后方有 3 条速度线（最长为 150 像素 × 0.8–1.25）和 4 个残影，各残影依次延迟 0.035 秒。","每个轨道以相等的时间间隔显示 12 个标记位置的点（顶部均匀分布，下面两端聚集）。"],"source_summary":"Two squares cover the same distance in the same time: the top one at constant speed, the bottom one eased.","source_spec":["One round trip per 4.7 s. Two 62 px squares (radius 16) travel 316 px horizontally: out at 0.2–1.75 s (1.55 s), hold 0.8 s, back at 2.55–4.1 s.","Top (constant): linear motion; shape and colour never change.","Bottom (eased): cubic-bezier(.86, 0, .14, 1). Slow start, very fast middle, slow stop.","The bottom square stretches horizontally up to 1.5× and flattens to 0.8× in proportion to speed (speed ÷ 3.6, clamped to 0–1).","Behind it: 3 speed lines (up to 150 px × 0.8–1.25) and 4 ghost copies lagging 0.035 s each.","Each rail shows 12 dots marking positions at equal time intervals (evenly spaced on top, bunched at both ends below)."],"source_use":"Use it on any move, scale or rotation so the motion accelerates and decelerates instead of looking mechanical."},"010":{"summary":"量规指针摆动经过其目标，返回并稳定下来。","use":"用它来赋予到达的元素能量和弹性的感觉。","spec":["每 4.7 秒播放一次。半圆仪表盘半径 128、线宽 26；目标为扫过范围的 0.7（距左端 126°）。","从 0.25 秒开始：值 = 0.7 × (1 − e^(−4.6t)·cos(10.5t))。大约 0.3 秒后，它超过目标大约 25%，然后它振荡并稳定在目标上。","超过目标的弧段绘为珊瑚色；黄色刻度标记目标。","填充的弧线是蓝色→薄荷色的渐变；针是白色的，宽度9。","返回：从 3.7 s，value = 0.7 × e^(−7.5t)·cos(8.5t) 回到 0（停止前略低于 0）。"],"source_summary":"A gauge needle swings past its target, comes back and settles.","source_spec":["One pass per 4.7 s. Semicircular gauge (radius 128, stroke 26). Target is 0.7 of the sweep (126° from the left end).","Starts at 0.25 s: value = 0.7 × (1 − e^(−4.6t)·cos(10.5t)). About 0.3 s later it is roughly 25% past the target, then it oscillates and settles on the target.","The part beyond the target is drawn in coral. A yellow tick marks the target.","The filled arc is a blue→mint gradient; the needle is white, width 9.","Return: from 3.7 s, value = 0.7 × e^(−7.5t)·cos(8.5t) back to 0 (dipping slightly below 0 before it stops)."],"source_use":"Use it to give an arriving element energy and a springy feel."},"011":{"summary":"弹跳的角色在着陆时会被挤压，在起飞时会伸展。","use":"用它来赋予字符或徽标重量和柔和度。","spec":["圆形角色，半径 37。每 1.175 秒反弹一次（每 4.7 秒反弹四次），一条 92 像素抛物线。它在整个周期内以正弦波横向漂移 ±150 px。","在地面上（每次弹跳的最初和最后各 10%）：垂直缩放沿二次曲线在 0.52（撞击时）和 1.28（离地时）之间变化。","在空中：垂直尺度 = 1 + 0.28 × s^3，其中 s 是距顶点的时间偏移（顶点处为 0，起飞和接地处为 1），因此在快速移动的地方会被拉伸。","水平缩放始终为 1 / 垂直缩放，保持二维面积不变；变换固定在脚部。","随着高度的增加，阴影变得越来越小。每次着陆时，短黄线会向左和向右弹出（约弹跳 18%）。"],"source_summary":"A bouncing character squashes on landing and stretches as it takes off.","source_spec":["A round character, radius 37. One bounce per 1.175 s (four per 4.7 s), a 92 px parabola. It drifts ±150 px sideways on a sine wave over the cycle.","On the ground (first and last 10% of each bounce): vertical scale goes between 0.52 (moment of impact) and 1.28 (moment of leaving) on a quadratic curve.","In the air: vertical scale = 1 + 0.28 × s^3, where s is the time offset from the apex (0 at the apex, 1 at take-off and touchdown), so it is stretched where it moves fast.","Horizontal scale is always 1 ÷ vertical (volume is preserved). The transform is anchored at the feet.","The shadow gets smaller and thinner with height. Short yellow lines flick out left and right at each landing (for about 18% of a bounce)."],"source_use":"Use it to give a character or logo weight and softness."},"012":{"summary":"形状从圆形到方形，从星形到心形，随着颜色的变化而平滑变化。","use":"使用它可以将一个图标或徽标转变为另一个图标或徽标，无需剪切。","spec":["四种形状，每种 1.175 秒：圆形 → 圆角方形 → 星形 → 心形 → 回到圆形。基础半径 64。","每个区间先保持，随后从区间结束前 0.62 秒至结束前 0.04 秒变形为下一形状，持续 0.58 秒。","每个轮廓由 240 个点表示；相同索引的点之间进行线性插值。进度使用 backOut（s = 1.6），所以会略微超过目标后回弹。","颜色：蓝色 → 珊瑚色 → 黄色 → 薄荷色，以二次缓入缓出混合。","在变形过程中，尺度膨胀 1 + 0.07 × sin(π × 进度)。","下面四个点；当前形状的点更大并且有颜色。"],"source_summary":"A shape changes smoothly from circle to square to star to heart, with its colour.","source_spec":["Four shapes, 1.175 s each: circle → square with rounded-off corners → star → heart → back to circle. Base radius 64.","Each segment holds first, then morphs to the next shape between 0.62 s and 0.04 s before its end (0.58 s).","Every outline is stored as 240 points; points with the same index are linearly interpolated. Progress uses backOut (s = 1.6), so it overshoots slightly.","Colour: blue → coral → yellow → mint, blended with quadratic ease-in-out.","During the morph the scale swells by 1 + 0.07 × sin(π × progress).","Four dots below; the dot for the current shape is larger and coloured."],"source_use":"Use it to turn one icon or logo into another without a cut."},"013":{"summary":"一团东西伸展开来，分裂成水滴，然后又融合成一滴。","use":"使用它在徽标、背景和连接动作中打造有机、柔和的外观。","spec":["引导圆（半径 44）：使用三次贝塞尔曲线（.7, 0, .2, 1）在 0.35–1.45 s 处向右移动 300 px，移动时沿正弦弧上升 34 px；在 2.7–3.8 秒处以相同方式返回。","7 个圆沿相同路径跟随，依次延迟 0.065 秒，半径从 44 逐渐减至 15，并在垂直方向摆动 ±6 像素。","即使主圆静止，3 个小圆（半径 15、13、11）仍绕延迟 0.1 秒的引导圆位置伸缩：水平半径 d 在 34–64 像素变化，垂直分量乘以 0.8；每周期往返两次。","合并外观：用白色绘制圆圈 → 模糊 9 px → 设置 alpha 阈值（仅在 112 到 144 之间柔和）→ 用颜色填充剩余部分。","填充是薄荷色 → 蓝色 → 紫罗兰色的对角渐变 (#7C5CFF)，在引导圆上有白色椭圆形高光。"],"source_summary":"A blob stretches out, breaks into drops and merges back into one.","source_spec":["Lead circle (radius 44): moves 300 px right at 0.35–1.45 s with cubic-bezier(.7, 0, .2, 1), rising 34 px on a sine arc while moving; returns the same way at 2.7–3.8 s.","Seven circles follow the same path, each 0.065 s later, radius tapering 44→15, wobbling ±6 px vertically.","Even while it rests, three small circles (radius 15, 13, 11) move in and out between 34 and 64 px from it, twice per cycle.","Merged look: draw the circles in white → blur 9 px → threshold the alpha (soft only between 112 and 144) → fill what remains with colour.","Fill is a diagonal gradient mint → blue → violet (#7C5CFF), with a white elliptical highlight on the lead circle."],"source_use":"Use it for an organic, soft look in logos, backgrounds and connecting moves."},"014":{"summary":"一个以八字形移动的球会在其身后留下一条逐渐消失的副本痕迹。","use":"用它来显示速度或路径：飞行物体、光标、光点。","spec":["珊瑚色球（半径 25、白色中心半径 11）每 4.7 秒沿八字形轨迹运动一次：相对中心 x = 196·sin(a)、y = 62·sin(2a)，相位 a 以恒定速度推进；沿路径的实际速度并不恒定。","15 个副本，每个副本沿路径向后放置 0.105 拉德（约 0.079 秒）。","第 i 个残影（i = 1…15）的半径为 22 − 16i/15，实际约从 20.93 降至 6 像素；不透明度为 0.9 × (1 − i/15) + 0.05。","复制颜色从最新到最旧依次为珊瑚色→黄色→蓝色。","首先绘制最旧的副本，最后绘制球本身。"],"source_summary":"A ball moving in a figure eight leaves a fading trail of copies behind it.","source_spec":["A ball (coral, radius 25, white centre radius 11) traces a figure eight once per 4.7 s: x = 196·sin(a), y = 62·sin(2a), with a advancing at constant speed.","15 copies, each placed 0.105 rad (about 0.079 s) further back along the path.","Copy radius goes 22→6 and opacity is 0.9 × (1 − i/15) + 0.05, so older copies are smaller and fainter.","Copy colour runs coral → yellow → blue from newest to oldest.","Draw the oldest copy first and the ball itself last."],"source_use":"Use it to show speed or a path: flying objects, cursors, points of light."},"015":{"summary":"粒子不断从发射器中射出、扩散并落下。","use":"用它代替五彩纸屑或火花来增添庆祝或活力。","spec":["84 个粒子，从底部中心发射（水平中心，底部边缘上方 20 像素）。","初始速度：水平方向 ±190 px/s，向上 250–400 px/s。重力 470 px/s²（抛物线路径）。","每个粒子以 2.35 秒或约 1.57 秒的周期重复，并具有随机起始偏移（固定种子，因此每次运行看起来都相同）。","每个粒子存活最多 1.5 秒：最初 0.06 秒淡入，最后 30% 的时间淡出；缩放从 1.15 减至 0.7。","每个粒子的基础尺寸为 5–11 像素：圆形用作半径，方形用作半边长，三角形顶点按该尺寸缩放；颜色为蓝、珊瑚、黄、薄荷色，旋转速度最高约 ±4.5 rad/s。"],"source_summary":"Particles keep shooting up from an emitter, spread out and fall.","source_spec":["84 particles, emitted from the bottom centre (horizontal centre, 20 px above the bottom edge).","Initial velocity: ±190 px/s horizontally, 250–400 px/s upward. Gravity 470 px/s² (parabolic paths).","Each particle repeats with a period of 2.35 s or about 1.57 s, with a random start offset (fixed seed, so every run looks the same).","Lifetime up to 1.5 s: fade in over the first 0.06 s, fade out over the last 30%. Scale 1.15→0.7.","Shapes are circles, squares and triangles (size 5–11 px) in blue, coral, yellow and mint, spinning at up to ±4.5 rad/s."],"source_use":"Use it to add celebration or liveliness, in place of confetti or sparks."},"016":{"summary":"风景横向移动；近层移动较多，远层移动较少，从而产生深度。","use":"用它来赋予平面艺术品或照片深度：背景、风景、滚动场景。","spec":["镜头水平移动按正弦波变化，幅度 ±108 像素，每 4.7 秒往返一次。","每层都在相反方向上偏移 pan × 因子。因子从后到前：星星 0.05，月亮 0.1，远山脊 0.28，中山脊 0.6，前山和树木 1.25，最近的深色形状 2.1。","较远的图层使用靠近背景的较暗颜色，较近的图层使用较亮的颜色；最近的一层是底部的一个巨大的黑色轮廓。","山脊和前景多边形延伸到画面两侧之外，以减少移动时出现边缘的可能；星星的基准坐标固定，绘制时仍按 pan × 0.05 偏移。"],"source_summary":"A landscape pans sideways; near layers move more and far layers move less, creating depth.","source_spec":["Camera pan: ±108 px on a sine wave, one round trip per 4.7 s.","Each layer is offset by pan × factor in the opposite direction. Factors from back to front: stars 0.05, moon 0.1, far ridge 0.28, middle ridge 0.6, front hill and trees 1.25, nearest dark shapes 2.1.","Far layers use darker colours close to the background, nearer layers brighter ones; the nearest layer is a large dark silhouette along the bottom.","Every layer is drawn at least 200 px beyond both sides of the frame so its ends never show."],"source_use":"Use it to give flat artwork or photos depth: backgrounds, landscapes, scrolling scenes."},"017":{"summary":"一个圆形或星形的窗口出现，显示其中的下一个场景。","use":"使用它可以从帧中的对象（例如太阳、徽标或按钮）开始更改场景。","spec":["白天场景 → 夜景 → 白天场景，每次切换占 2.35 秒；每半周期的 0.45–1.6 秒内完成变化（耗时 1.15 秒），采用三次缓入缓出。","下一个场景绘制在当前场景上方，裁剪在指定形状内；该形状扩大直至覆盖整个画面。","白天→夜晚：以太阳中心(112, 104)为中心的一圈，半径0→470。","夜晚 → 白天：以月亮中心（427, 104）为中心扩张五角星，外半径从 0 增至 1150，并在扩张时旋转 1.2 rad（约 69°）。","当它生长时，形状的边缘有白色轮廓（宽度 7）。"],"source_summary":"A circle- or star-shaped window grows, showing the next scene inside it.","source_spec":["Day scene → night scene → day scene, 2.35 s each. The change runs at 0.45–1.6 s of each half (1.15 s), cubic ease-in-out.","The next scene is drawn on top of the current one, clipped to a shape; the shape grows until it covers the frame.","Day→night: a circle from the sun's centre (112, 104), radius 0→470.","Night→day: a five-point star from the moon's centre (427, 104), outer radius 0→1150, rotating 1.2 rad (about 69°) as it grows.","While it grows, the edge of the shape has a white outline (width 7)."],"source_use":"Use it to change scenes starting from an object in the frame, such as a sun, logo or button."},"018":{"summary":"彩色带横扫并覆盖框架；当他们离开时，下一个场景就出现了。","use":"用它来改变带有品牌颜色形状的场景：章节中断、主题变化。","spec":["白天 → 夜晚 → 白天，每次 2.35 秒。四个水平带按 52 像素间距排列，实际绘制高度为 53 像素以覆盖接缝；颜色为蓝、珊瑚、黄、薄荷色，末端倾斜 80 像素。","覆盖：0.38–1.0 秒。各色带的前缘从画面一侧移动到另一侧；色带依次延迟该阶段时长的 14%，每条色带用该阶段时长的 58% 完成移动，采用三次缓入缓出。","在 1.0 秒时，当所有内容都被覆盖时，下面的场景将交换为下一个场景。","揭示：1.12–1.75 秒。各色带的后缘以相同的延迟与曲线移出，露出下一场景。","方向：从左到右为白天→夜晚，镜像为夜晚→白天。"],"source_summary":"Coloured bands sweep across and cover the frame; when they leave, the next scene is there.","source_spec":["Day → night → day, 2.35 s each. Four horizontal bands (height 52; blue, coral, yellow, mint) whose ends are slanted by 80 px.","Cover: 0.38–1.0 s. Each band's leading edge travels from one side of the frame to the other. Bands are delayed by 14% of the phase each, and each uses cubic ease-in-out over 58% of the phase.","At 1.0 s, when everything is covered, the scene underneath is swapped for the next one.","Uncover: 1.12–1.75 s. Each band's trailing edge follows with the same delays and curve, exposing the next scene.","Direction: left to right for day→night, mirrored for night→day."],"source_use":"Use it to change scenes with shapes in brand colours: chapter breaks, topic changes."},"019":{"summary":"油漆般的液体从顶部滴下来，充满画面，成为下一个场景。","use":"使用它来实现柔和、有机的场景变化，例如在美食、美容或创意视频中。","spec":["白天 → 夜晚 → 白天，每次切换 2.35 秒。两层液体均从上向下移动，采用二次缓入缓出。","第 1 层为纯色：白天转夜晚时为蓝色，夜晚转白天时为珊瑚色，时间 0.35–1.5 秒；第 2 层是裁剪成液体形状的下一场景，时间 0.7–1.8 秒。","液体前沿从 y = −110 移动到底部边缘下方 130 px。其边缘波有两个正弦波（振幅 13 px 和 8 px），中间最强。","液体前沿垂下 7 个液滴（宽 30–54 像素，末端圆形）；长度 = 基础长度 30–110 px × (0.25 + 0.9 × 波浪强度)，中途最长。","合并外观：用白色绘制形状 → 模糊 7 px → 设置 alpha 阈值 → 填充颜色（或下一个场景）。"],"source_summary":"Paint-like liquid drips down from the top and fills the frame, becoming the next scene.","source_spec":["Day → night → day, 2.35 s each. Two liquid layers, both moving top to bottom with quadratic ease-in-out.","Layer 1 (flat colour: blue for day→night, coral for night→day): 0.35–1.5 s. Layer 2 (the next scene itself, clipped to the liquid shape): 0.7–1.8 s.","The liquid front moves from y = −110 to 130 px below the bottom edge. Its edge waves with two sine waves (amplitudes 13 px and 8 px), strongest midway.","Seven drips (30–54 px wide, round tips) hang from the front; length = base 30–110 px × (0.25 + 0.9 × wave strength), greatest midway.","Merged look: draw the shape in white → blur 7 px → threshold the alpha → fill with the colour (or the next scene)."],"source_use":"Use it for a soft, organic scene change, for example in food, beauty or creative videos."},"020":{"summary":"摄像机推入字母 O 的孔中，并在下一个场景中出来。","use":"使用它可以深入了解徽标或字母，并充满动力地移动到下一个场景。","spec":["场景 X（黄色背景上的“ZOOM”）→ 场景 Y（蓝色背景上的“GO!”）→ 场景 X，每次切换占 2.35 秒。","当前场景围绕字母 O 的孔洞中心缩放（孔洞半径 24.5）。最大缩放为孔洞恰好覆盖整个画面时的 1.08 倍（约 14 倍）。","缩放比例 = maxScale^p，表示对数缩放量与 p 成正比；因为 p 使用分段缓动，缩放的实际变化速度并非常数。","p = 0.8 × 三次缓入 (0.25–1.2 s) + 0.2 × 三次缓出 (1.2–1.65 s)：加速进入，最后减速。","下一场景以 1/maxScale 的缩放比例放在孔洞内。缩放结束时它恰好达到完整尺寸，画面随即切换到下一场景。"],"source_summary":"The camera pushes into the hole of a letter O and comes out in the next scene.","source_spec":["Scene X (ZOOM on yellow) → scene Y (GO! on blue) → scene X, 2.35 s each.","The current scene is scaled around the centre of an O's hole (radius 24.5). Maximum scale is 1.08× the value at which the hole covers the whole frame (about 14×).","Scale = maxScale^p (exponential zoom, which reads as constant speed).","p = 0.8 × cubic ease-in (0.25–1.2 s) + 0.2 × cubic ease-out (1.2–1.65 s): accelerate in, slow down at the end.","Inside the hole the next scene is placed at 1/maxScale. When the zoom ends it is exactly at full size, and the view switches to the next scene."],"source_use":"Use it to dive into a logo or letter and move to the next scene with momentum."},"021":{"summary":"一张卡片绕其垂直轴翻转并显示其另一面。","use":"将其用于互为侧面的两件事：问题和答案、之前和之后。","spec":["一张卡片（300 × 156，半径 22）。前（蓝色，Q）⇄ 后（黄色，A），各 2.35 秒。","在 0.45–1.5 秒内旋转 180°（历时 1.05 秒），使用 backOut 回弹缓动（s = 1.5）；略微超过 180° 后回到目标角度。","卡片绘制宽度 = 原始宽度 × |cos θ| × (1 + 0.08·sin(π·pr))，其中 pr 是翻转阶段的线性进度。转过 90° 时切换正反面图案。","透视图：卡片被绘制成垂直的薄切片，其高度从一侧到另一侧的变化高达 ±20% × sin θ（远侧较短，近侧较高）。","翻转时卡片沿正弦曲线放大 8% 并上升 6 像素；不透明度为 0.34 × |sin θ| 的深色叠层给卡片表面加阴影。地面有椭圆阴影。"],"source_summary":"A card turns over around its vertical axis and shows its other side.","source_spec":["A card (300 × 156, radius 22). Front (blue, Q) ⇄ back (yellow, A), 2.35 s each.","Rotates 180° at 0.45–1.5 s (1.05 s) with backOut (s = 1.5), going slightly past 180° and coming back.","Card width = original width × |cos θ|. The face artwork is swapped as it passes 90°.","Perspective: the card is drawn in thin vertical slices whose height varies by up to ±20% × sin θ from one side to the other (far side shorter, near side taller).","During the turn it scales up 8% and lifts 6 px on a sine curve; a dark overlay with opacity 0.34 × |sin θ| shades the face. An elliptical shadow sits on the floor."],"source_use":"Use it for two things that are sides of one another: question and answer, before and after."},"022":{"summary":"一条光带以一定角度穿过徽标徽章的表面。","use":"用它为徽标、徽章或按钮赋予优质外观。","spec":["每 2.35 秒扫光一次。光只绘制在徽标的裁剪区域内（徽标尺寸 400 × 112，圆角半径 28，蓝色渐变）。","光带：116 px 宽的白色渐变（中间不透明度 0.72，边缘 0）加上 78 px 处的 12 px 细带（不透明度 0.5），旋转 0.42 rad（约 24°）。","在 0.45–1.5 秒内，从徽章左侧 130 像素处移动到徽章右侧 130 像素处（移动 660 像素），采用二次缓入缓出。","闪光：1.38-1.98 秒时右上角的四点星；大小 30 × sin(πq) × (1 + 0.2(1 − q))，旋转 0.9 rad。","徽章本身不会移动。"],"source_summary":"A band of light crosses the surface of a logo badge at an angle.","source_spec":["One sweep per 2.35 s. The light is drawn only inside a clip of the badge (400 × 112, radius 28, blue gradient).","Light band: a 116 px wide white gradient (opacity 0.72 in the middle, 0 at the edges) plus a thin 12 px band (opacity 0.5) 78 px away, rotated 0.42 rad (about 24°).","It moves from 130 px left of the badge to 130 px right of it (660 px) at 0.45–1.5 s, quadratic ease-in-out.","Sparkle: a four-point star at the top-right corner at 1.38–1.98 s; size 30 × sin(πq) × (1 + 0.2(1 − q)), rotating 0.9 rad.","The badge itself does not move."],"source_use":"Use it to give a logo, badge or button a premium finish."},"023":{"summary":"文本切片横向移动，颜色分裂，出现小条，没有亮度闪烁。","use":"使用它来营造数字、错误或不安的感觉，作为标题和场景变化的强调。","spec":["白色粗体文字（104 像素）每 4.7 秒发生两次故障：0.55–1.25 秒（5 步）和 2.9–3.74 秒（6 步）；其余时间保持静止。","每个步骤持续 0.14 秒，并显示一个固定扰动（阶梯式的，不平滑的动画）。","颜色分割：珊瑚色副本向左移动 7-16 像素并向下移动 2 像素，青色 (#22D3EE) 副本向右移动相同量并向上移动 2 像素，白色文本位于顶部。","切片移位：2-4 个水平条带（高 10-35 像素，y 40-150）向左或向右移位 18-64 像素。","随机位置的三个小颜色条（珊瑚色、青色、黄色；30-120 宽 × 5-12 高）。","背景亮度永远不会改变（无全帧闪烁）。随机值使用固定种子。"],"source_summary":"Text slices shift sideways, colours split and small bars appear, with no brightness flashing.","source_spec":["White bold text (104 px). It glitches twice per 4.7 s: 0.55–1.25 s (5 steps) and 2.9–3.74 s (6 steps); otherwise it is still.","Each step lasts 0.14 s and shows one fixed disturbance (stepped, not smoothly animated).","Colour split: a coral copy shifted 7–16 px left and 2 px down, a cyan (#22D3EE) copy shifted the same amount right and 2 px up, with the white text on top.","Slice shift: 2–4 horizontal strips (10–35 px tall, y 40–150) are displaced 18–64 px to the left or right.","Three small colour bars (coral, cyan, yellow; 30–120 wide × 5–12 tall) at random positions.","Background brightness never changes (no full-frame flashing). The random values use a fixed seed."],"source_use":"Use it for a digital, error or uneasy feel, as an accent on titles and scene changes."},"024":{"summary":"一块沉重的车顶板重重地掉落下来，整个车架都因撞击而摇晃。","use":"用它来发布具有分量和力量的重要标题或数字。","spec":["每 2.35 秒掉落一次：先是黄色板块，再是珊瑚色板块。板块尺寸 250 × 100，圆角半径 18。","坠落：0.3–0.62 秒从画面上方落到地面，采用三次缓入（加速）；下落时垂直拉伸至 1.12 倍。","0.62 秒落地。整个画面震动 1.1 秒：x = 15 px × e^(−5t) × sin(2π·5t)，y = 11 px × e^(−5t) × cos(2π·6.5t)，旋转 = 0.02 rad × e^(−5t) × sin(2π·5t + 0.6)。","落地后 0.3 秒内，板坯垂直挤压达 22%，然后恢复（加宽相同的量；锚定在其底部）。","4 个背景块延迟 0.03–0.06 秒跳起，最高 24 像素，历时 0.5 秒。6 条白线和 6 团尘土从地面散开，并在 0.55 秒内消失。","退出：板以 1.85–2.2 秒的时间向上移动 300 像素（backIn，s = 1.6）。"],"source_summary":"A heavy headline slab drops with a thud and the whole frame shakes from the impact.","source_spec":["One drop per 2.35 s (a yellow slab first, then a coral one). The slab is 250 × 100, radius 18.","Fall: 0.3–0.62 s from above the frame to the floor, cubic ease-in (accelerating). While falling it is stretched 1.12× vertically.","Lands at 0.62 s. The whole frame shakes for 1.1 s: x 15 px × e^(−5t) × sin(2π·5t), y 11 px × e^(−5t) × cos(2π·6.5t), rotation 0.02 rad × e^(−5t) × sin(2π·5t + 0.6).","For 0.3 s after landing the slab squashes vertically by up to 22% and recovers (it widens by the same amount; anchored at its base).","Four background blocks hop up to 24 px, 0.03–0.06 s late, over 0.5 s. Six white lines and six dust puffs spread from the floor and fade within 0.55 s.","Exit: the slab moves 300 px up at 1.85–2.2 s (backIn, s = 1.6)."],"source_use":"Use it to land an important headline or number with weight and force."},"025":{"summary":"相机保持在原位并从左向右旋转；因为它是旋转，所以近层和远层横向滑动的量相同。","use":"揭示广阔的位置或将注意力从场景的一侧转移到另一侧。","spec":["相机：位置固定（高度1.5 m）；仅偏航，-0.32 rad → +0.32 rad（-18° → +18°，总共约 37°）","计时：从 0.5 秒旋转到 3.4 秒（2.9 秒），三次缓入缓出（大约三次贝塞尔曲线（0.65,0,0.35,1））","拍摄对象：一个人（身高约 1.8 m）静止站在前方 8 m 处并在画面中从右向左滑动","无视差：山脉、建筑物、树木和人物均以相同角度移动（539×208 卡上的焦距为 330 像素）","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开头（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）","右上角的读数显示角度的整数度 (-18° → +18°)"],"source_summary":"The camera stays in place and pivots from left to right; because it is a rotation, near and far layers slide sideways by the same amount.","source_spec":["Camera: position fixed (height 1.5 m); yaw only, -0.32 rad → +0.32 rad (-18° → +18°, about 37° in total)","Timing: rotate from 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: a person (about 1.8 m tall) stands still 8 m ahead and slides right-to-left in frame","No parallax: mountains, buildings, trees and the person all shift by the same angle (focal length 330 px on a 539×208 card)","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)","Top-right readout shows the angle in whole degrees (-18° → +18°)"],"source_use":"To reveal a wide location or to shift attention from one side of the scene to the other."},"026":{"summary":"摄像机保持在原位并向上旋转，从地面上的人一直到塔顶。","use":"显示建筑物或人的高度或规模。","spec":["相机：位置固定（高度1.4 m）；仅俯仰，-0.06 rad → +0.36 rad（-3° → +21°，总共约 24°）","计时：0.5 s 至 3.4 s (2.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","对象：前方7m处有一人静止不动； 9.5 m 塔（天线尖为 11.8 m）位于后方 26 m 处","屏幕上的一切都向下滑动：人从底部离开，而塔顶及其天线进入","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开头（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）","右上角的读数以整数度显示角度 (-3° → +21°)"],"source_summary":"The camera stays in place and pivots upward, from a person at ground level up to the top of a tower.","source_spec":["Camera: position fixed (height 1.4 m); pitch only, -0.06 rad → +0.36 rad (-3° → +21°, about 24° in total)","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: a person stands still 7 m ahead; a 9.5 m tower (antenna tip at 11.8 m) stands 26 m away behind","On screen everything slides downward: the person leaves at the bottom while the tower top and its antenna enter","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)","Top-right readout shows the angle in whole degrees (-3° → +21°)"],"source_use":"To show the height or scale of a building or a person."},"027":{"summary":"相机本身向拍摄对象移动；近处的物体生长并迅速消失，而远处的山脉几乎没有变化。","use":"深入某人或细节，同时保持深度感。","spec":["相机：向前移动（深度）0 m → 5.8 m；高度 1.5 m，方向和焦距（330 px，显示为 24mm）固定","计时：0.5 s 至 3.4 s (2.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","人物静止站在前方 8 米处；镜头与人物距离从 8 米缩短至 2.2 米，因此人物在画面中约放大至 3.6 倍。","视差：前景柱子（左 1.5 米、深度 3.6 米）和岩石（右 1.6 米、深度 4.8 米）移出画面；120 米以外的远山大小几乎不变。","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开头（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）","右上角读数保持在24mm（与04 Zoom in的区别）"],"source_summary":"The camera itself moves toward the subject; near objects grow and pass quickly while the distant mountains barely change.","source_spec":["Camera: moves forward (in depth) 0 m → 5.8 m; height 1.5 m, direction and focal length (330 px, shown as 24mm) fixed","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: a person stands still 8 m ahead; distance goes 8 m → 2.2 m, so they appear about 3.6× larger","Parallax: a foreground post (1.5 m left, 3.6 m deep) and a rock (1.6 m right, 4.8 m deep) pass out of frame; mountains 120 m+ away stay almost the same size","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)","The top-right readout stays at 24mm (the difference from 04 Zoom in)"],"source_use":"To move in on a person or detail while keeping a sense of depth."},"028":{"summary":"相机不动；只是焦距变长，所以整个画面按相同比例放大。","use":"在不移动相机的情况下将注意力集中到一点；它看起来比移动车更平坦、更容易观察。","spec":["相机：位置和方向固定（高度1.5 m）；仅焦距变化，330 px → 1200 px（显示为24mm → 87mm，约3.6×）","指数插值：f = 330 × (8/2.2)^p，其中 p 是从 0.5 s 到 3.4 s (2.9 s) 的三次缓入缓出","人物静止站在前方 8 米处；最终画面大小与 #027 推镜头一致（约 3.6 倍）。","无视差：前景柱子和岩石、人物、建筑物和山脉均按相同比例缩放（重叠不变）","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开头（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）","右上角的读数显示焦距，单位为毫米 (24mm → 87mm)"],"source_summary":"The camera does not move; only the focal length gets longer, so the whole picture enlarges by the same ratio.","source_spec":["Camera: position and direction fixed (height 1.5 m); only the focal length changes, 330 px → 1200 px (shown as 24mm → 87mm, about 3.6×)","Exponential interpolation: f = 330 × (8/2.2)^p, where p is a cubic ease-in-out from 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s)","Subject: a person stands still 8 m ahead; the final size matches 03 Dolly in (about 3.6×)","No parallax: the foreground post and rock, the person, buildings and mountains all scale by the same ratio (overlaps do not change)","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)","Top-right readout shows the focal length in mm (24mm → 87mm)"],"source_use":"To direct attention to one point without moving the camera; it looks flatter and more observational than a dolly in."},"029":{"summary":"相机以与行走的人相同的速度向侧面移动；人保持在中心位置，而较近的柱子扫过的速度更快。","use":"跟随行走或奔跑的主体并在展示其动作时保持运动感。","spec":["镜头以 1.7 米/秒匀速向右移动（4.7 秒内 x = −4.0 米 → +4.0 米）；高度 1.3 米，朝向正前方，无缓动。","人物与镜头保持相同的 x 坐标行走（距离 7.5 米），因此一直处于画面中央；手臂和双腿以 sin(u×7)×0.42 rad 摆动。","视差：深度 4 米处每隔 1.6 米排列的柱子向左掠过得最快，其次是树木和距离 48 米的建筑；远山几乎不动。","右上角读数显示“→ 1.7m/s”","重复：每 4.7 秒跳回起点（柱子和地面网格在接缝处对齐；背景建筑物和树木跳跃）"],"source_summary":"The camera moves sideways at the same speed as a walking person; the person stays centred while nearer posts sweep past faster.","source_spec":["Camera: moves right at a constant 1.7 m/s (x = -4.0 m → +4.0 m in 4.7 s); height 1.3 m, facing straight ahead; no easing","Subject: a person walks at the same x as the camera (7.5 m away) and stays in the centre of frame; legs and arms swing by sin(u×7)×0.42 rad","Parallax: posts every 1.6 m at 4 m depth sweep left fastest, then trees, then buildings (48 m away); mountains hardly move","Top-right readout shows \"→ 1.7m/s\"","Repeat: jumps back to the start every 4.7 s (posts and ground grid line up at the seam; background buildings and trees jump)"],"source_use":"To follow a walking or running subject and keep the sense of movement while showing their action."},"030":{"summary":"相机围绕拍摄对象绕一圈移动；人保持在中心位置，而后面的树木和建筑物则向侧面扫过。","use":"从三个维度展示一个人或一个产品，或者强调一个入口或一个关键时刻。","spec":["相机：以人为中心（前方9m）半径6m的圆上移动，从-0.95rad→+0.95rad（-54°→+54°，总共约109°）","方向：始终面向中心（yaw = -angle）；高度 1.7 m，俯仰固定在 -0.07 rad（大约向下 4°）","计时：0.5 s 至 3.6 s (3.1 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","对象：人不动；脸上的一个白点随着角度向一侧移动；半径为 1.3 m 的虚线圆标记地面","背景：12 棵树均匀分布在半径为 10 米的圆周上；镜头环绕时，它们从人物身后经过。","返回：保持 3.6–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒交叉淡入淡出；右上角的读数显示角度 (-54° → +54°)"],"source_summary":"The camera travels on a circle around the subject; the person stays centred while the trees and buildings behind sweep sideways.","source_spec":["Camera: travels on a circle of radius 6 m centred on the person (9 m ahead), from -0.95 rad → +0.95 rad (-54° → +54°, about 109° in total)","Direction: always faces the centre (yaw = -angle); height 1.7 m, pitch fixed at -0.07 rad (about 4° down)","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.6 s (3.1 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: the person does not move; a white dot on the face shifts sideways with the angle; a dashed circle of radius 1.3 m marks the ground","Background: 12 trees evenly spaced on a 10 m radius cross behind the person as the camera moves round","Return: hold 3.6–4.2 s, then cross-fade back over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows the angle (-54° → +54°)"],"source_use":"To show a person or product in three dimensions, or to emphasise an entrance or a key moment."},"031":{"summary":"摄像机上升的同时向下倾斜，直到俯视人物。","use":"在场景结束时远离人物或显示场景有多大。","spec":["摄像机：从 1.4 m 上升至 9 m，同时向前移动 0 m → 1.5 m","方向：向下倾斜以使人（前方 8 m）保持在画面内；俯仰 = -0.86 × atan2(高度 - 1.0, 8 - 向前), 约 -2.5° → -44°","计时：0.5 s 至 3.4 s (2.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","人物不动；镜头升高时人物在画面中变小，地面网格逐渐占据画面，地平线从顶部移出。","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开头（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）","右上角读数显示高度 (↑ 1.4m → ↑ 9.0m)"],"source_summary":"The camera rises while tilting down until it looks down on the person.","source_spec":["Camera: rises from 1.4 m to 9 m while moving forward 0 m → 1.5 m","Direction: tilts down to keep the person (8 m ahead) in frame; pitch = -0.86 × atan2(height - 1.0, 8 - forward), about -2.5° → -44°","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: the person does not move; they get smaller as the camera rises, the ground grid fills the frame and the horizon leaves at the top","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)","Top-right readout shows the height (↑ 1.4m → ↑ 9.0m)"],"source_use":"To pull away from a person at the end of a scene or to reveal how large the location is."},"032":{"summary":"相机向后拉，同时以相同比例放大；人物保持相同的大小，只有背景靠近。","use":"为了一瞬间的恍然大悟，或者在视觉上表现出不安或震惊。","spec":["镜头与人物（前方 8 米）之间的距离 d 从 3.2 米增至 8 米，即镜头向后拉 4.8 米；高度 1.3 米。","焦距：f = 330 × d/8 px，即132 px → 330 px（显示为10mm → 24mm），保持距离÷焦距不变","计时：0.5 s 至 3.4 s (2.9 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","被摄体：人物不动，在画面中保持同一高度；头部 (1.8 m) 和脚部宽 160 px 的蓝色虚线显示尺寸恒定","背景：建筑物（48 m 外）约增长 2.2 倍，山脉约 2.4 倍，在人身后逼近，而人面前的地面则缩小","返回：保持 3.4–4.2 秒，然后在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开头（一次通过 = 4.7 秒）"],"source_summary":"The camera pulls back while zooming in by the same ratio; the person keeps the same size and only the background closes in.","source_spec":["Camera: distance d to the person (8 m ahead) widens from 3.2 m → 8 m (a 4.8 m pull-back); height 1.3 m","Focal length: f = 330 × d/8 px, i.e. 132 px → 330 px (shown as 10mm → 24mm), keeping distance ÷ focal length constant","Timing: 0.5 s to 3.4 s (2.9 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: the person does not move and keeps the same height in frame; blue dashed lines 160 px wide at head (1.8 m) and feet show the size is constant","Background: buildings (48 m away) grow about 2.2× and mountains about 2.4×, closing in behind the person, while the ground in front of the person shrinks","Return: hold 3.4–4.2 s, then cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)"],"source_use":"For a moment of realisation, or to show unease or shock visually."},"033":{"summary":"相机不动；焦点从前景中的一朵花转移到其后面的人，交换哪一朵模糊的图像。","use":"将注意力从前景转移到背景（或后面）而不进行剪切。","spec":["相机：位置、方向、焦距全部固定（高度1.1m）；仅模糊量发生变化","模糊量：前景花朵（左 0.75 米、距离 2 米）从 0 像素增至 7 像素；人物和背景（人物右 0.9 米、距离 9 米）从 6 像素降至 0 像素；地面网格的模糊量为背景的 0.6 倍。","计时：1.0 s 至 2.6 s (1.6 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","焦点标记：蓝色四角框从花朵直线移动到人物，半宽从 46 像素缩小至 30 像素。","主题：花不动，人不动","返回：2.6–4.2 秒保持，最后 0.5 秒交叉溶解回起点；右上角显示对焦距离（◎ 2m → ◎ 9m）。"],"source_summary":"The camera does not move; focus shifts from a flower in the foreground to a person behind it, swapping which one is blurred.","source_spec":["Camera: position, direction and focal length all fixed (height 1.1 m); only the blur amounts change","Blur: the foreground flower (0.75 m left, 2 m away) goes 0 px → 7 px; the person and background (person 0.9 m right, 9 m away) go 6 px → 0 px; the ground grid uses 0.6× the background blur","Timing: 1.0 s to 2.6 s (1.6 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Focus marker: blue corner brackets travel in a straight line from the flower to the person, half-width shrinking 46 px → 30 px","Subject: neither the flower nor the person moves","Return: hold 2.6–4.2 s, then cross-fade back over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows focus distance (◎ 2m → ◎ 9m)"],"source_use":"To move attention from foreground to background (or back) without cutting."},"034":{"summary":"为整个画面添加轻微的、不规则的抖动，就好像相机是用手拿着的，而不是放在三脚架上一样。","use":"给人一种纪录片的感觉或身临其境的感觉。","spec":["相机：位置几乎固定；偏航、俯仰、横滚和高度分别得到不同周期的正弦波之和（T = 2π×u/4.7）","偏航角(rad) = 0.016·sin(3T) + 0.008·sin(7T+1) + 0.004·sin(13T+2)，最多约±1.6°","俯仰角（rad）= 0.012·sin(4T+2) + 0.006·sin(9T+0.5) + 0.003·sin(17T+1.2)，最大约 ±1.2°。","横滚(rad) = 0.02·sin(5T+1) + 0.008·sin(11T+3)，最多约±1.6°；高度 = 1.5 + 0.03·sin(6T) 米","人物静止站在前方 6.5 米处；摇晃持续进行，没有缓动或停顿。","所有乘数都是整数，因此每 4.7 秒无缝循环一次；右上角的读数显示“手持”"],"source_summary":"Adds a small, irregular shake to the whole frame, as if the camera were held by hand instead of on a tripod.","source_spec":["Camera: position almost fixed; yaw, pitch, roll and height each get a sum of sine waves with different periods (T = 2π×u/4.7)","Yaw (rad) = 0.016·sin(3T) + 0.008·sin(7T+1) + 0.004·sin(13T+2), at most about ±1.6°","Pitch (rad) = 0.012·sin(4T+2) + 0.006·sin(9T+0.5) + 0.003·sin(17T+1.2), at most about ±1.2°","Roll (rad) = 0.02·sin(5T+1) + 0.008·sin(11T+3), at most about ±1.6°; height = 1.5 + 0.03·sin(6T) m","Subject: a person stands still 6.5 m ahead; the shake runs continuously with no easing or hold","All multipliers are integers, so it loops seamlessly every 4.7 s; top-right readout shows \"HANDHELD\""],"source_use":"To give a documentary feel or the sense of being present in the scene."},"035":{"summary":"第一人称视角在两排树木之间低空快速飞行，从一侧倾斜到另一侧。","use":"为了速度和沉浸感，或者以连续的动作飞过一个位置。","spec":["镜头以 14 米/秒（显示为 50 km/h）匀速向前飞行，不使用缓动；俯仰角固定为 −0.05 rad。","左右穿行（T = 2π×u/4.7，每 4.7 秒摆动两次）：横向位置为 0.6·sin(2T−0.4) 米，高度为 1.4 + 0.5·sin(2T) 米。","倾斜：横滚 0.22·sin(2T+0.6) rad（约±12.6°），偏航 0.05·sin(2T) rad（约±2.9°）","无主体。高 4.2 米的树木在两侧各距中心 3.6 米排列，沿纵深每隔 8 米一棵，两排前后错开 4 米；树木向镜头快速掠来。","速度线：10 个径向笔画，长约 32-76 像素（向两侧较长），呈半透明灰色，向外流动并回收","无保持且无交叉淡入淡出重置（树行每 4.7 秒重新启动时会发生相位变化）"],"source_summary":"A first-person view flying low and fast between two rows of trees, banking from side to side.","source_spec":["Camera: flies forward at a constant 14 m/s (shown as 50km/h) with no easing; pitch fixed at -0.05 rad","Weave (T = 2π×u/4.7, two swings per 4.7 s): sideways 0.6·sin(2T-0.4) m, height 1.4 + 0.5·sin(2T) m","Bank: roll 0.22·sin(2T+0.6) rad (about ±12.6°), yaw 0.05·sin(2T) rad (about ±2.9°)","No subject. Trees 4.2 m tall stand 3.6 m to each side, every 8 m, the two rows offset by 4 m, and rush toward the camera","Speed lines: 10 radial strokes about 32–76 px long (longer toward the sides) in translucent grey, flowing outward and recycling","No hold and no cross-fade reset (the tree rows shift phase when it restarts every 4.7 s)"],"source_use":"For speed and immersion, or to fly through a location in one continuous move."},"036":{"summary":"水平相机绕其镜头轴滚动，并使地平线保持在对角线上。","use":"表达不安、紧张或感觉有些事情不对劲。","spec":["镜头位置固定（高度 1.5 米），只做横滚，角度 0 → 0.36 rad（约 21°）；整个画面围绕中心旋转。","计时：0.6 s 至 2.2 s (1.6 s)，三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","对象：前方7m处有一人静止不动；地平线、建筑物和人都倾斜相同的角度","2.2–4.2 秒保持倾斜，以便观察倾斜构图。","最后 0.5 秒交叉溶解回水平的起始画面，单次循环 4.7 秒。","右上角读数显示角度 (∠ 0° → ∠ 21°)"],"source_summary":"A level camera rolls around its lens axis and holds with the horizon on a diagonal.","source_spec":["Camera: position fixed (height 1.5 m); roll only, 0 → 0.36 rad (about 21°); the whole picture turns around the frame centre","Timing: 0.6 s to 2.2 s (1.6 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Subject: a person stands still 7 m ahead; horizon, buildings and person all tilt by the same angle","Hold: stays tilted from 2.2 s to 4.2 s (time to read the tilted composition itself)","Return: cross-fade back to the level start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)","Top-right readout shows the angle (∠ 0° → ∠ 21°)"],"source_use":"To express unease, tension or the feeling that something is wrong."},"037":{"summary":"固定镜头前，一个人通过跳跃缓慢地上升和下降，树叶缓慢地飘落；整个动作是伸展的。","use":"让观众研究一个简短的动作或表情，或强调情绪的高峰。","spec":["相机：完全固定（高度1.3 m）；只有主体移动","受试者：7m外的人跳一跳需要3.8秒（0.5秒至4.3秒）；高度 = 4q(1-q)×1.1 m，抛物线峰值为 1.1 m，q 随时间呈线性","空中时双臂举起；跳跃前静止 0.5 秒，落地后静止 0.4 秒","叶子：9片叶子在旋转时从3.4 m处落到地面历经4.7 s，每片偏移周期的1/9","右上角的读数显示“120fps ×0.25”（播放拉伸 4 倍）","无保持和交叉淡入淡出；每 4.7 秒无缝循环一次"],"source_summary":"In front of a fixed camera a person rises and falls slowly through a jump while leaves drift down slowly; the whole action is stretched out.","source_spec":["Camera: completely fixed (height 1.3 m); only the subject moves","Subject: a person 7 m away takes 3.8 s for one jump (0.5 s to 4.3 s); height = 4q(1-q)×1.1 m, a parabola peaking at 1.1 m, with q linear in time","Both arms are raised while airborne; the person stands still for 0.5 s before the jump and 0.4 s after landing","Leaves: 9 leaves fall from 3.4 m to the ground over 4.7 s while rotating, each offset by 1/9 of the cycle","Top-right readout shows \"120fps ×0.25\" (playback stretched 4×)","No hold and no cross-fade; loops seamlessly every 4.7 s"],"source_use":"To let viewers study a brief action or expression, or to emphasise an emotional peak."},"038":{"summary":"一次拍摄内，播放速度由快到慢平滑变化；左下角的图表显示了速度。","use":"仅放慢动作的关键部分，同时保持引导动作快速。","spec":["相机：完全固定（高度1.3 m）；仅播放速度改变","播放速度：2.4×→0.25×；变化需要 0.7 秒（1.2 秒到 1.9 秒），并具有二次缓入缓出（大约三次贝塞尔曲线（0.45,0,0.55,1））","前方 8 米处的人从左侧 6 米处向右跑；x = −6 + 素材时间 × 2.0 米，快放阶段迅速靠近画面中央。","跳跃：x在-1.5 m到2.5 m之间时的抛物线，峰值0.99 m，双臂举起；起飞约0.94秒，大部分播放时间为慢动作，着陆约3.68秒","图表：当前时间左下角有一个 120×40 px 的速度曲线，带有一个蓝点（半径 5 px）","返回：在 4.2 秒停止，然后在最后 0.5 秒交叉淡入淡出；右上角的读数显示速率 (×2.4 → ×0.3)"],"source_summary":"Within one shot the playback speed changes smoothly from fast to slow; a graph at bottom left shows the speed.","source_spec":["Camera: completely fixed (height 1.3 m); only the playback speed changes","Playback speed: 2.4× → 0.25×; the change takes 0.7 s (1.2 s to 1.9 s) with a quadratic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.45,0,0.55,1))","Subject: a person 8 m away runs from 6 m left toward the right; x = -6 + footage time × 2.0 m; they close in quickly during the fast section","Jump: a parabola while x is between -1.5 m and 2.5 m, peak 0.99 m, arms raised; take-off at about 0.94 s, most of the airtime plays in slow motion, landing at about 3.68 s","Graph: a 120×40 px speed curve at bottom left with a blue dot (radius 5 px) at the current time","Return: stops at 4.2 s, then cross-fades back over the last 0.5 s; top-right readout shows the rate (×2.4 → ×0.3)"],"source_use":"To slow down only the key part of an action while keeping the lead-in quick."},"039":{"summary":"使用固定摄像机，06:00到18:00被压缩成几秒钟；太阳、云彩、人和阴影快速前进。","use":"在短片中展示一段较长的时间，或者城市、天空或任务如何变化。","spec":["相机：完全固定（高度1.6 m，俯仰+0.08 rad，向上约5°）","计时：12小时在3.7秒内过去（0.4秒到4.1秒），三次缓入缓出（大约三次贝塞尔曲线（0.65,0,0.35,1））","太阳：沿弧线从左向右行进，角度a = -1.25 rad → +1.25 rad； 170 m 深度位置 (sin a×120, cos a×60 - 8) m","3 朵云总共向右飘移 140 米，每移动 80 米循环回绕；7 个小人各穿过 18 米宽的区域 6 次，奇数与偶数人物方向相反。","建筑物的阴影远离太阳并随着太阳的移动而摆动（半透明灰色）","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉淡入淡出回到开始处；右上角的时钟从 06:00 → 18:00 运行，步长为 10 分钟"],"source_summary":"With a fixed camera, 06:00 to 18:00 is compressed into a few seconds; sun, clouds, people and shadows move in fast forward.","source_spec":["Camera: completely fixed (height 1.6 m, pitch +0.08 rad, about 5° up)","Timing: 12 hours pass in 3.7 s (0.4 s to 4.1 s), cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","Sun: travels left to right along an arc, angle a = -1.25 rad → +1.25 rad; position (sin a×120, cos a×60 - 8) m at 170 m depth","Three clouds drift 140 m to the right in total, wrapping every 80 m; seven small figures each cross an 18 m width 6 times (odd and even ones in opposite directions)","Building shadows fall away from the sun and swing as it moves (translucent grey)","Return: cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s; the top-right clock runs 06:00 → 18:00 in 10-minute steps"],"source_use":"To show a long stretch of time, or how a city, sky or task changes, in a short clip."},"040":{"summary":"画面在跳跃者到达顶部的那一刻停止，然后在 1.4 秒后从同一帧恢复。","use":"强调决定性的时刻，或暂停以便将名称或标题放置在框架上。","spec":["镜头完全固定（高度 1.3 米）；停止的是素材时间。","冻结：1.6 秒停止，3.0 秒恢复（1.4 秒）；素材时间正常运行 0-1.6 秒，冻结时保持在 1.6 秒，然后继续为 u-1.4","距离 7 米处的人在素材时间 0.6–2.6 秒内完成抛物线跳跃，最高 1.1 米；定格恰好位于顶点（跳跃进度 50%）。","9 片落叶在定格期间也停止；其下落速度为 #037 慢动作示例的 1.5 倍。","冻结标记：5 px 蓝色边框和底部中心的暂停图标（68×40 px 白色圆角框上的两个蓝色条），在 0.12 秒内淡入和淡出","右上角的读数仅在冻结时显示“定格”；无交叉淡入淡出重置"],"source_summary":"The picture stops at the moment a jumping person reaches the top, then resumes from the same frame 1.4 s later.","source_spec":["Camera: completely fixed (height 1.3 m); what stops is the footage time","Freeze: stops at 1.6 s and resumes at 3.0 s (1.4 s); footage time runs normally for 0–1.6 s, stays at 1.6 s while frozen, then continues as u-1.4","Subject: the jump of a person 7 m away is a parabola over footage time 0.6–2.6 s, peak 1.1 m; the freeze lands exactly on the peak (50% through)","Nine falling leaves also stop during the freeze; they fall 1.5× as fast as in 13 Slow motion","Freeze markers: a 5 px blue border and a pause icon at bottom centre (two blue bars on a 68×40 px white rounded box), fading in and out over 0.12 s","Top-right readout shows \"FREEZE\" only while frozen; no cross-fade reset"],"source_use":"To emphasise a decisive moment, or to pause so a name or caption can be placed over the frame."},"041":{"summary":"相机位置和取景保持不变，而人的位置和时钟跳跃；时间在一个场景中被跳过。","use":"缩短谈话或工作中的停顿并加快节奏，或表明时间过得很快。","spec":["衔接：无效果直切（0 帧）；5 个镜头各 0.94 秒（4.7 秒 ÷ 5）。","相机：每次拍摄的位置和取景相同（高度1.4 m，面向前方）；背景不移动像素","变化的是人物（距离 7 米）的横向位置：−2.2 → 1.4 → −0.4 → 2.4 → 0.6 米；镜头 2 和镜头 4 中人物双臂举起。","每个镜头内人物静止；跳切通过相邻镜头的人物位置和姿势突变表现，而非人物在画面中跳跃。","右上角时钟：10:02 → 10:17 → 10:41 → 11:06 → 11:30，显示时间在同一位置被跳过","镜头 5 直接切回镜头 1"],"source_summary":"Camera position and framing stay the same while the person's position and the clock jump; time is skipped inside one scene.","source_spec":["Join: a straight cut with no effect (0 frames); 5 shots of 0.94 s each (4.7 s ÷ 5)","Camera: identical position and framing in every shot (height 1.4 m, facing forward); the background does not move by a pixel","What changes: the person (7 m away) jumps in sideways position, -2.2 m → 1.4 m → -0.4 m → 2.4 m → 0.6 m; in shots 2 and 4 both arms are raised","Within each shot the person is still (the jump is shown only by the difference in position and pose)","Top-right clock: 10:02 → 10:17 → 10:41 → 11:06 → 11:30, showing that time was skipped in the same place","Shot 5 cuts straight back to shot 1"],"source_use":"To tighten pauses in talk or work and raise the pace, or to show time passing quickly."},"042":{"summary":"在下一个镜头中，抛出的球变成了位置和大小相同的太阳；两个不同的场景连接在一个匹配的形状上。","use":"通过共享的形状或动作将时间或地点相距甚远的两个场景联系起来。","spec":["连接：2.3 秒（0 帧）的直切；蓝色圆圈具有相同的位置（右侧 120 像素，中心上方 46 像素），两侧半径均为 17 像素","传出镜头（0–2.3 s）：固定摄像机（高度 1.4 m）；一个人（左侧 1.2 m，距离 7 m）从 0.5 s 开始扔球，三次缓出（大约三次贝塞尔曲线（0.33,1,0.68,1））","球从人物头顶上方（高度 2.3 米）飞向匹配点，半径从 5 像素增至 17 像素；沿弧线移动，弧线向上鼓出最多 30 像素。","下一个镜头（2.3–4.7 秒）位于另一地点（无建筑，镜头高度 1.2 米）；同一画面位置的蓝色圆形变为太阳，在 2.4 秒内下沉 14 像素。","标记：半径为 26 px 的蓝色虚线圆圈在剪切两侧的 0.7 秒内淡入和淡出","右上角读数显示“镜头 1”→“镜头 2”； 4.7 秒时直接切回镜头 1"],"source_summary":"A thrown ball becomes, in the next shot, a sun at the same position and size; two different scenes are joined on a matching shape.","source_spec":["Join: a straight cut at 2.3 s (0 frames); the blue circle has the same position (120 px right, 46 px above centre) and radius 17 px on both sides","Outgoing shot (0–2.3 s): fixed camera (height 1.4 m); a person (1.2 m left, 7 m away) throws a ball from 0.5 s, cubic ease-out (about cubic-bezier(0.33,1,0.68,1))","Ball: travels from above the person's head (2.3 m high) to the match point; radius 5 px → 17 px, on an arc bulging up to 30 px","Incoming shot (2.3–4.7 s): a different place (no buildings, height 1.2 m); the blue circle in the same spot is now the sun and sinks 14 px over 2.4 s","Marker: a blue dashed circle of radius 26 px fades in and out within 0.7 s either side of the cut","Top-right readout shows \"SHOT 1\" → \"SHOT 2\"; at 4.7 s it cuts straight back to SHOT 1"],"source_use":"To link two scenes far apart in time or place through a shared shape or motion."},"043":{"summary":"相机向侧面摆动得非常快，在条纹模糊期间切换到下一个场景。","use":"改变地点或话题，同时保持精力充沛。","spec":["衔接：1.7–2.5 秒，共 0.8 秒；前 0.4 秒前一镜头甩出，后 0.4 秒后一镜头甩入并停稳。","前半段：前一镜头偏航 0 → +0.45 rad（约 26°）；后半段：后一镜头偏航 −0.45 rad → 0。两段均采用二次缓入缓出。","交换：在 50% 点直接替换，隐藏，因为模糊最强","模糊：对分布在 ±1.6 帧（30 fps 下）的 9 个渲染进行平均","镜头：A 场景高度 1.4 米；B 场景高度 1.6 米、俯仰 +0.1 rad。甩动时仅在各自原有镜头上叠加偏航；人物、汽车和城市保持静止。","每 4.7 秒交替 A→B 和 B→A（往返 9.4 秒）；右上角的读数显示“A → B”/“B → A”"],"source_summary":"The camera swings sideways very fast and the next scene is swapped in during the streaked blur.","source_spec":["Join: 0.8 s, from 1.7 s to 2.5 s; in the first 0.4 s the outgoing shot swings away, in the last 0.4 s the incoming shot swings in and settles","First half: outgoing yaw 0 → +0.45 rad (about 26°), quadratic ease-in-out; second half: incoming yaw -0.45 rad → 0, same easing","Swap: a straight replacement at the 50% point, hidden because the blur is at its strongest","Blur: 9 renders spread over ±1.6 frames (at 30 fps) are averaged","Camera: height 1.4 m, fixed except during the swing; the subjects (a person in A, a car and city in B) do not move","Alternates A→B and B→A every 4.7 s (9.4 s for the round trip); top-right readout shows \"A → B\" / \"B → A\""],"source_use":"To change location or topic while keeping the energy up."},"044":{"summary":"下一张图片覆盖在当前图片上，其不透明度会上升，直到它取代当前图片；两者都在中途互相透过。","use":"传达时间的温柔流逝或地点的变化，或进入记忆。","spec":["衔接：1.5–3.0 秒，共 1.5 秒；后一画面不透明度从 0 增至 100%。","缓动：二次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.45,0,0.55,1)）； 2.25 秒时 50%","前一画面在下方始终完全不透明，后一画面绘制在上方；前一画面不会事先淡出。","相机：固定在两张图片中（A高度1.4m；B高度1.6m，俯仰+0.1rad）；拍摄对象也不移动","0–1.5 秒仅显示前一画面，3.0–4.7 秒仅显示后一画面。","每 4.7 秒交替 A→B 和 B→A（往返 9.4 秒）；右上角的读数显示“A → B”/“B → A”"],"source_summary":"The next picture is laid over the current one and its opacity rises until it takes over; both show through each other midway.","source_spec":["Join: 1.5 s, from 1.5 s to 3.0 s; the incoming picture's opacity goes 0 → 100%","Easing: quadratic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.45,0,0.55,1)); 50% at 2.25 s","The outgoing picture stays fully opaque underneath and the incoming one is drawn on top (the outgoing one is not faded out first)","Camera: fixed in both pictures (A at height 1.4 m; B at height 1.6 m, pitch +0.1 rad); the subjects do not move either","Only the outgoing picture shows for 0–1.5 s, only the incoming one for 3.0–4.7 s","Alternates A→B and B→A every 4.7 s (9.4 s for the round trip); top-right readout shows \"A → B\" / \"B → A\""],"source_use":"To convey a gentle passage of time or change of place, or to move into a memory."},"045":{"summary":"垂直边缘从左向右移动，下一张图片将取代其后面的当前图片。","use":"标记场景或主题的明显变化，或在比较的两侧之间切换。","spec":["衔接：1.7–2.8 秒，共 1.1 秒；边缘从画面左侧外部（x = −4 px）移动到右侧外部（x = 543 px）。","缓动：三次缓入缓出（大约cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）","边缘左侧显示后一画面，右侧显示前一画面；两张画面均不移动，通过裁剪揭示，而非推移。","边缘：4 px 蓝色垂直线，仅在移动时可见","摄像头：固定在两张图片中；拍摄对象也不移动","每 4.7 秒交替 A→B 和 B→A（往返 9.4 秒）；右上角的读数显示“A → B”/“B → A”"],"source_summary":"A vertical edge moves from left to right and the next picture replaces the current one behind it.","source_spec":["Join: 1.1 s, from 1.7 s to 2.8 s; the edge travels from just outside the left side (x = -4 px) to just outside the right side (x = 543 px)","Easing: cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1))","The incoming picture shows left of the edge and the outgoing one right of it; neither picture moves (a reveal by clipping, not a push)","Edge: a 4 px blue vertical line, visible only while it is moving","Camera: fixed in both pictures; the subjects do not move either","Alternates A→B and B→A every 4.7 s (9.4 s for the round trip); top-right readout shows \"A → B\" / \"B → A\""],"source_use":"To mark a clear change of scene or topic, or to switch between the two sides of a comparison."},"046":{"summary":"一个人熟睡的安静场景毫无征兆地直接转变为紧张的场景；音量表同时跳动。","use":"或喜剧或震撼，瞬间展现平静与混乱、期望与现实之间的差距。","spec":["连接：2.4 秒（0 帧）的直切；没有过渡效果，对比度起作用","传出镜头（0–2.4 s）：固定相机（高度 1.2 m，焦距 330 px）；一个人在7m外躺着，三个“z”字母浮起并消失；音量计位于 8 个小节中约 0–1 处 (0.08±0.04)","后一镜头（2.4–4.2 秒）：焦距增至 2.6 倍（858 像素）形成紧构图，横滚 −0.12 rad（约 −7°）；人物双臂举起，周围有 18 条蓝色放射线。","传入镜头中的晃动：横滚±0.03 rad（每秒约 6 个周期）和偏航 ±0.006 rad（约每秒 8 个周期）；音量计0.85±0.15，接近满","返回：在最后 0.5 秒内交叉溶解回安静镜头，采用二次缓入缓出。","右上角的提示从“♪ 安静”变为“♪ 音量大”。"],"source_summary":"A quiet scene of a person asleep cuts with no warning straight to an intense one; the volume meter jumps at the same moment.","source_spec":["Join: a straight cut at 2.4 s (0 frames); no transition effect, the contrast does the work","Outgoing shot (0–2.4 s): fixed camera (height 1.2 m, focal length 330 px); a person lying down 7 m away, three \"z\" letters float up and fade; volume meter at about 0–1 of 8 bars (0.08±0.04)","Incoming shot (2.4–4.2 s): focal length 2.6× (858 px) for a tight framing, rolled -0.12 rad (about -7°); the person has both arms raised, with 18 radial blue lines","Shake in the incoming shot: roll ±0.03 rad (about 6 cycles per second) and yaw ±0.006 rad (about 8 per second); volume meter at 0.85±0.15, nearly full","Return: cross-fade back to the quiet shot over the last 0.5 s (quadratic ease-in-out)","Top-right readout shows \"♪ 静か\" (quiet) → \"♪ 大音量\" (loud)"],"source_use":"For comedy or shock, showing in an instant the gap between calm and chaos or between expectation and reality."},"047":{"summary":"下一个场景的音频在画面变化之前开始；图片显示在顶部，视频和音频时间线显示在下面。","use":"建立对下一个场景的预期，或者使场景或演讲者的变化感觉自然。","spec":["连接：图片为直切；只是音频在图片之前切换到下一个场景 (B)。偏移量为时间线的 20%（0.72 秒）","播放头：在 3.6 秒（0.4 秒至 4.0 秒）内以恒定速度从左向右移动；音频切换35%（约1.66秒），图像切换55%（约2.38秒）","在偏移部分（35-55%），图像仍然是 A，而音频已经是 B；该部分标有淡蓝色带和两条蓝色虚线","布局：顶部134px为图片（固定相机，拍摄对象不动）；底部 74 px 包含两个时间线行，视频和音频（A 灰色，B 淡蓝色，音频行上的波形）","画面左下角显示“视频A / 视频B”；右下角的音频标签从灰色“♪ A 音”切为蓝色“♪ B 音”。","返回：最后 0.5 秒交叉溶解回起点；单次循环 4.7 秒。"],"source_summary":"The next scene's audio starts before the picture changes; the picture is shown on top with video and audio timelines below.","source_spec":["Join: the picture is a straight cut; only the audio switches to the next scene (B) before the picture does. The offset is 20% of the timeline (0.72 s)","Playhead: moves left to right at constant speed over 3.6 s (0.4 s to 4.0 s); audio switches at 35% (about 1.66 s), picture at 55% (about 2.38 s)","In the offset section (35–55%) the picture is still A while the audio is already B; the section is marked with a pale blue band and two blue dashed lines","Layout: the top 134 px is the picture (fixed camera, subjects do not move); the bottom 74 px holds two timeline rows, video and audio (A grey, B pale blue, waveform on the audio row)","Labels: \"映像A / 映像B\" (video A / B) at bottom left of the picture; the audio now playing at bottom right (\"♪ Aの音\" grey → \"♪ Bの音\" blue)","Return: cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)"],"source_use":"To build anticipation for the next scene, or to make a change of scene or speaker feel natural."},"048":{"summary":"画面改变后，前一场景的音频仍会持续一段时间；图片显示在顶部，视频和音频时间线显示在下面。","use":"在显示听众的反应或相关镜头的同时保持演讲者的声音。","spec":["连接：图片为直切；只有音频在图片切换后切换到下一个场景 (B)。偏移量为时间线的 20%（0.72 秒）","播放头：在 3.6 秒（0.4 秒至 4.0 秒）内以恒定速度从左向右移动；图像切换55%（约2.38秒），音频75%（约3.10秒）","在偏移部分（55-75%），图像已经是B，而音频仍然是A；该部分标有淡蓝色带和两条蓝色虚线","布局：顶部134px为图片（固定相机，拍摄对象不动）；底部 74 px 包含两个时间线行，视频和音频（A 灰色，B 淡蓝色，音频行上的波形）","画面左下角显示“视频A / 视频B”；右下角的音频标签从灰色“♪ A 音”切为蓝色“♪ B 音”。","返回：最后 0.5 秒交叉溶解回起点；单次循环 4.7 秒。"],"source_summary":"The previous scene's audio carries on for a while after the picture has changed; the picture is shown on top with video and audio timelines below.","source_spec":["Join: the picture is a straight cut; only the audio switches to the next scene (B) after the picture does. The offset is 20% of the timeline (0.72 s)","Playhead: moves left to right at constant speed over 3.6 s (0.4 s to 4.0 s); picture switches at 55% (about 2.38 s), audio at 75% (about 3.10 s)","In the offset section (55–75%) the picture is already B while the audio is still A; the section is marked with a pale blue band and two blue dashed lines","Layout: the top 134 px is the picture (fixed camera, subjects do not move); the bottom 74 px holds two timeline rows, video and audio (A grey, B pale blue, waveform on the audio row)","Labels: \"映像A / 映像B\" (video A / B) at bottom left of the picture; the audio now playing at bottom right (\"♪ Aの音\" grey → \"♪ Bの音\" blue)","Return: cross-fade back to the start over the last 0.5 s (one pass = 4.7 s)"],"source_use":"To keep a speaker's voice running while showing the listener's reaction or related footage."},"049":{"summary":"单击“打开”会使整个页面变暗，并且一个小窗口会稍微放大到中心；单击 × 将其关闭。","use":"当用户必须停下来处理一件事（例如确认或简短表格）时使用它。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。光标在 0.95 秒时到达“打开”按钮（120×36，左下）并在 1.0 秒时单击。","打开量 a：在 1.0–1.32 秒内，使用 easeOutCubic 从 0→1。不透明度为 0.42·a 的全卡半透明遮罩 rgba(18,20,28)。","窗口：白色 280×140，半径 12，中心位于 (271, 97)，阴影模糊 24，偏移 y 8，alpha 0.25。比例 0.9 + 0.1·a，不透明度 a。","内部：一个粗体标题栏，两条文本行，右下角有一个蓝色的 88×30 按钮，右上角有 ×。","关闭：光标在 3.0 秒前移到 ×，3.3 秒点击；a 乘以 (1 − easeInOutCubic)，其中缓动在 3.3–3.58 秒完成。"],"source_summary":"Clicking \"Open\" dims the whole page and a small window scales up slightly into the centre; clicking × closes it.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. The cursor reaches the \"Open\" button (120×36, lower left) at 0.95 s and clicks at 1.0 s.","Open amount a: 0→1 over 1.0–1.32 s with easeOutCubic. A full-card scrim rgba(18,20,28) at opacity 0.42·a.","Window: white 280×140, radius 12, centred at (271, 97), shadow blur 24, offset y 8, alpha 0.25. Scale 0.9 + 0.1·a, opacity a.","Inside: a bold title bar, two text lines, a blue 88×30 button at lower right and × at top right.","Close: the cursor moves to × by 3.0 s and clicks at 3.3 s; a is multiplied by (1 − easeInOutCubic over 3.3–3.58 s)."],"source_use":"Use it when the user must stop and deal with one thing, such as a confirmation or a short form."},"050":{"summary":"单击“菜单”会从左侧滑入一个高面板；单击外部会将其滑回。","use":"使用它可以将导航或过滤器保留在屏幕上，直到需要时为止，尤其是在移动设备上。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。光标在 1.0 秒处单击“菜单”按钮（110×34，左上）。","打开量 a：在 1.0–1.38 秒内，使用 easeOutCubic 从 0→1。全卡半透明遮罩 rgba(18,20,28)，不透明度 0.36·a。","面板：白色，210 宽，全卡高度，x = −210 + 210·a，因此它从左边缘滑入。阴影模糊 22，alpha 0.25。","内部：头像（半径 14）和名称位于顶部，然后是四个相距 32 px 的菜单行；第一行用浅蓝色带选择。","关闭：光标在 3.3 秒点击外部位置 (420, 120)；a 乘以 (1 − easeInOutCubic)，缓动时间为 3.3–3.65 秒，面板滑回。"],"source_summary":"Clicking \"Menu\" slides a tall panel in from the left; clicking outside slides it back.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. The cursor clicks the \"Menu\" button (110×34, top left) at 1.0 s.","Open amount a: 0→1 over 1.0–1.38 s with easeOutCubic. Full-card scrim rgba(18,20,28) at opacity 0.36·a.","Panel: white, 210 wide, full card height, x = −210 + 210·a so it slides in from the left edge. Shadow blur 22, alpha 0.25.","Inside: an avatar (radius 14) and name at the top, then four menu rows 32 px apart; the first row is selected with a light-blue band.","Close: the cursor clicks outside at (420, 120) at 3.3 s; a is multiplied by (1 − easeInOutCubic over 3.3–3.65 s) and the panel slides back."],"source_use":"Use it to keep navigation or filters off screen until needed, especially on mobile."},"051":{"summary":"手指点击“查看详情”，一个面板从底部升起；向下拖动其手柄可将其关闭。","use":"在移动设备上使用它来显示详细信息或选择，同时保持当前屏幕可见。","spec":["542 × 191 的卡片，循环周期 4.5 秒。1.0 秒时，手指（半透明圆圈，半径 17，白色边缘）点击底部居中的“查看详情”胶囊按钮（170 × 36）。","打开进度 a 在 1.05–1.45 秒使用 easeOutCubic 从 0 增至 1；全卡遮罩颜色 rgba(18,20,28)，不透明度 0.36·a。","底部面板为白色，高 136，顶部圆角半径 18，顶部位置 y = 191 − 136·a；阴影模糊 22，y 偏移 −4；顶部中央是 52 × 6 的拖动把手。","内部：粗体标题栏和两行 26×26 图标。","关闭：手指在 2.75 秒落到把手 (271, 68)，在 3.0–3.6 秒向下拖动；a 乘以该时间段的 (1 − easeInOutCubic)，面板跟随手指从底部移出。"],"source_summary":"A finger taps \"View details\" and a panel rises from the bottom; dragging its handle down closes it.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A finger (semi-transparent circle, radius 17, white rim) taps the \"View details\" pill (170×36, bottom centre) at 1.0 s.","Open amount: 0→1 over 1.05–1.45 s with easeOutCubic. Full-card scrim rgba(18,20,28) at opacity 0.36·a.","Sheet: white, 136 tall, top corners radius 18, top edge at y = 191 − 136·a. Shadow blur 22, offset y −4. A 52×6 grab handle at top centre.","Inside: a bold title bar and two rows with 26×26 icons.","Close: the finger lands on the handle (271, 68) at 2.75 s and drags down over 3.0–3.6 s; a is multiplied by (1 − easeInOutCubic over 3.0–3.6 s), so the sheet follows the finger off the bottom."],"source_use":"Use it on mobile to show details or choices while keeping the current screen in view."},"052":{"summary":"单击三个标题中的第一个将打开其内容并将下面的行向下推；再次单击将其关闭。","use":"将其用于常见问题解答或详细信息，人们可以扫描标题并仅打开他们需要的内容。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。三个标题（宽 494，高 34，半径 8，间隙 6），右侧有一个向下的 V 形。","光标在 0.95 秒处到达第一个标题，并在 1.0 秒和 3.3 秒处单击。","展开进度 ex：1.0–1.35 秒使用 easeInOutCubic 从 0 增至 1，3.3–3.62 秒从 1 减至 0。","第一行从 34 增长到 92 高 (+58·ex) 并将下面的行向下推；它的两个内容行被剪裁到该行并以不透明度 ex 淡入。","打开时，V 字形旋转 180°·ex，边框变为浅蓝色，标题变为蓝色。"],"source_summary":"Clicking the first of three headings opens its content and pushes the rows below down; clicking again closes it.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. Three headings (494 wide, 34 tall, radius 8, gap 6) with a down chevron at the right.","The cursor reaches the first heading at 0.95 s and clicks at 1.0 s and 3.3 s.","Open amount ex: 0→1 over 1.0–1.35 s with easeInOutCubic, then 1→0 over 3.3–3.62 s.","The first row grows from 34 to 92 tall (+58·ex) and pushes the rows below down; its two content lines are clipped to the row and fade in with opacity ex.","While open, the chevron rotates 180°·ex, the border turns light blue and the heading blue."],"source_use":"Use it for FAQs or long details where people scan the headings and open only what they need."},"053":{"summary":"单击该字段将在其下方打开四个选项；选择“名古屋”将关闭列表并填充该字段。","use":"当人们从固定列表中选择一个值时，可以在表单中使用它。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。 260×38 字段（半径 8）显示占位符和 V 形；光标在 1.0 秒处单击它。","打开进度在 1.0–1.25 秒以 easeOutCubic 从 0 增至 1。列表（白色，260 × 112，阴影模糊 18）向下移动 6 像素并淡入；箭头旋转 180°，输入框边框变为 2 像素蓝色。","四个选项，间隔 26 像素（东京、大阪、名古屋、福冈）。当光标向下移动时，大阪从 1.55 秒开始突出显示为浅蓝色，名古屋从 1.95 秒开始突出显示为浅蓝色。","2.3 秒点击名古屋：列表在 2.3–2.45 秒关闭（1 − easeInOutCubic）；占位文字在 2.2–2.3 秒淡出，“名古屋”在 2.32–2.42 秒淡入。","重置：名古屋在 3.9–4.08 秒淡出，占位文字在 4.1–4.3 秒恢复，因此两段文字不会重叠。"],"source_summary":"Clicking the field opens four options below it; picking \"Nagoya\" closes the list and fills the field.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A 260×38 field (radius 8) shows a placeholder and a chevron; the cursor clicks it at 1.0 s.","Open amount: 0→1 over 1.0–1.25 s with easeOutCubic. The list (white 260×112, shadow blur 18) fades in while dropping 6 px. The chevron turns 180° and the field border becomes 2 px blue.","Four options 26 px apart (Tokyo, Osaka, Nagoya, Fukuoka in Japanese). As the cursor moves down, Osaka is highlighted light blue from 1.55 s and Nagoya from 1.95 s.","Click on Nagoya at 2.3 s: the list closes over 2.3–2.45 s (1 − easeInOutCubic); the placeholder fades out over 2.2–2.3 s and \"Nagoya\" fades in over 2.32–2.42 s.","Reset: Nagoya fades out over 3.9–4.08 s, then the placeholder returns over 4.1–4.3 s, so the two texts never overlap."],"source_use":"Use it in a form when people pick one value from a fixed list."},"054":{"summary":"将鼠标悬停在“？”上图标在其上方的黑色气泡中显示一条简短的注释；当光标离开时它就会消失。","use":"使用它可以向图标或缩写添加一行提示，而不占用页面空间。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。一个“？”图标（蓝色环，半径 13）位于标签旁边的 (196, 121) 处。","光标仅悬停，没有点击：它到达“？”在 1.05 秒时，停留到 3.15 秒，并在 4.1 秒时离开卡。","显示进度 a 在 1.15–1.35 秒以 easeOutCubic 从 0 增至 1；不透明度为 a，气泡同时上升 6 像素到位。","气泡：#26282c，184×36，半径8，顶部y 64，有一个16宽、8高的三角形，向下指向图标；白色 15 像素文本。","隐藏：在 3.25–3.45 秒内线性 1→0。"],"source_summary":"Hovering over a \"?\" icon shows a short note in a dark bubble above it; it disappears when the cursor leaves.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A \"?\" icon (blue ring, radius 13) at (196, 121) next to a label.","The cursor only hovers, no click: it arrives on \"?\" at 1.05 s, stays until 3.15 s and leaves the card by 4.1 s.","Show amount a: 0→1 over 1.15–1.35 s with easeOutCubic; opacity a, rising 6 px into place.","Bubble: #26282c, 184×36, radius 8, top at y 64, with a 16-wide, 8-tall triangle pointing down at the icon; white 15 px text.","Hide: linear 1→0 over 3.25–3.45 s."],"source_use":"Use it to add a one-line hint to an icon or abbreviation without taking space on the page."},"055":{"summary":"单击“详细信息”将在其右侧打开一个白色小面板，其中按钮上有一个指针；单击里面的“确定”将其关闭。","use":"使用它进行简短的设置或确认，该设置或确认就位于打开它的按钮旁边。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。 (24, 112) 处有一个蓝色轮廓的“详细信息”按钮 (108×36)；光标在 1.0 秒处单击它。","显示量 a：在 1.0–1.28 秒内使用 easeOutCubic 显示 0→1；不透明度 a，从右侧滑动 6 px。","面板：白色 300×120，半径 10，位于 (156, 62)，边框 1 像素，阴影模糊 22，偏移 y 6。其左边缘 (y 122–138) 上有一个 10 宽的三角形指向按钮。","内部：一个粗体标题栏、两条文本行、一个带轮廓的 70×26 按钮和一个蓝色的 72×26 “确定”按钮。","关闭：3.0秒处光标移动至“确定”（402、157），3.3秒处点击； a 乘以 (1 − easeInOutCubic over 3.3–3.5 s)。"],"source_summary":"Clicking \"Details\" opens a small white panel to its right with a pointer at the button; clicking OK inside closes it.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. An outlined blue \"Details\" button (108×36) at (24, 112); the cursor clicks it at 1.0 s.","Show amount a: 0→1 over 1.0–1.28 s with easeOutCubic; opacity a, sliding 6 px in from the right.","Panel: white 300×120, radius 10, at (156, 62), 1 px border, shadow blur 22, offset y 6. A 10-wide triangle on its left edge (y 122–138) points at the button.","Inside: a bold title bar, two text lines, an outlined 70×26 button and a blue 72×26 OK button.","Close: the cursor moves to OK (402, 157) by 3.0 s and clicks at 3.3 s; a is multiplied by (1 − easeInOutCubic over 3.3–3.5 s)."],"source_use":"Use it for a short setting or confirmation that belongs right next to the button that opened it."},"056":{"summary":"单击“保存”会将黑色通知滑入右下角；当时间耗尽时，它就会滑走。","use":"使用它来确认结果，例如保存或发送，而无需中断用户。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。光标在1.0 s处点击蓝色“保存”按钮（110×36，左下）并离开到左下。","轻提示颜色 #26282c，尺寸 214 × 52，圆角半径 10，距右边 18 像素、距底边 16 像素；1.05–1.4 秒使用 easeOutCubic 从右侧滑入 240 像素。","内部：蓝色圆圈内有白色勾号，旁边为白色的“已保存”文字，字号 15 像素。","底部剩余时间进度线高 3 像素，在 1.4–3.2 秒从 194 像素线性缩至 0。","退出：使用 easeInOutCubic 在 3.2–3.55 秒内向右滑出 240 px。"],"source_summary":"Clicking \"Save\" slides a dark notice into the bottom-right corner; when its time bar runs out it slides away.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. The cursor clicks the blue \"Save\" button (110×36, bottom left) at 1.0 s and leaves to the bottom left.","Toast: #26282c, 214×52, radius 10, 18 px from the right and 16 px from the bottom; slides in 240 px from the right over 1.05–1.4 s with easeOutCubic.","Inside: a white check in a blue circle and white 15 px text \"Saved\".","A time-left line along the bottom (3 px tall) shrinks linearly from 194 px to 0 over 1.4–3.2 s.","Exit: slides 240 px out to the right over 3.2–3.55 s with easeInOutCubic."],"source_use":"Use it to confirm a result such as a save or send without interrupting the user."},"057":{"summary":"单击“概述、定价、评论”选项卡，依次滑动蓝色下划线并交换下面的内容。","use":"使用它可以在同一空间中显示多个相关视图，并让人们在它们之间进行切换。","spec":["542 × 191 卡片，周期 4.5 秒。3 个标签的 x 坐标分别为 24、114、204，宽度分别为 70、70、100；y = 50 处有 2 像素分隔线和 4 像素蓝色下划线。","光标在 1.0 秒处单击第二个选项卡，在 2.2 秒处单击第三个选项卡，在 3.4 秒处单击第一个选项卡。","下划线：每次使用 easeInOutCubic 单击时，位置和宽度会在 0.25 秒内移动到新选项卡（从第三个返回到第一个穿过中间的位置）。","标签：选中为蓝色加粗，其他为灰色；切换发生在 1.1、2.3 和 3.5 秒。","旧内容面板在 0.2 秒内线性淡出；前两次点击后分别延迟 0.1 秒，新面板在 0.2 秒内淡入并上升 8 像素；第三次返回第一项时延迟 0.05 秒。"],"source_summary":"Clicking the tabs \"Overview, Pricing, Reviews\" in turn slides a blue underline across and swaps the content below.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. Three tabs at x 24, 114, 204, widths 70, 70, 100; a 2 px divider at y 50 and a 4 px blue underline.","The cursor clicks the second tab at 1.0 s, the third at 2.2 s and the first at 3.4 s.","Underline: position and width move to the new tab over 0.25 s from each click with easeInOutCubic (from the third back to the first it passes through the middle).","Labels: selected is blue and bold, others grey; the switch happens at 1.1, 2.3 and 3.5 s.","Content: the old panel fades out linearly in 0.2 s; 0.1 s later the new one fades in over 0.2 s while rising 8 px."],"source_use":"Use it to show several related views in the same space and let people switch between them."},"058":{"summary":"每次单击右箭头都会将一排三个不同的图像向左滑动一步，并且下面的点也会移动。","use":"使用它可以在有限的空间内一次显示多张图像或特色项目。","spec":["542 × 191 卡片，周期 4.5 秒。轮播图片为 330 × 138、圆角半径 8，居中排列、间隔 18 像素；相邻图片从边缘露出。","白色圆形按钮（半径 18，阴影模糊 10），左右两侧带有 V 形图案；下面三个点（当前一个蓝色16×8，其他8×8）。","光标在 1.0、2.1 和 3.2 秒处单击向右箭头（514、88）。","每次点击使整行向左移动 348 像素（一张幻灯片加间隙），历时 0.4 秒，使用 easeInOutCubic。","这三张图片（风景、三个圆圈、条形图）重复，所以在三次移动后，第一张又回来了。"],"source_summary":"Each click on the right arrow slides a row of three different images one step to the left, and the dot below moves.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. Slides 330×138, radius 8, centred with an 18 px gap; the neighbours peek in at the edges.","White round buttons (radius 18, shadow blur 10) with chevrons at left and right; three dots below (current one blue 16×8, others 8×8).","The cursor clicks the right arrow (514, 88) at 1.0, 2.1 and 3.2 s.","Each click moves the row 348 px left (one slide plus gap) over 0.4 s with easeInOutCubic.","The three pictures (landscape, three circles, bar chart) repeat, so after three moves the first is back."],"source_use":"Use it to show several images or featured items in limited space, one at a time."},"059":{"summary":"三个设置行中前两个的开关依次打开，然后再次关闭。","use":"将其用于立即生效且只有两种状态的设置。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。三个设置行，间隔 60 像素，并带有分隔线。在 x 450 处，有一个 64×34 轨道（半径 17）和一个白色旋钮（半径 13，阴影）。","点击顺序：第 1 行在 1.0 秒打开，第 2 行在 1.8 秒打开，第 1 行在 3.0 秒关闭，第 2 行在 3.6 秒关闭；第 3 行始终关闭。","使用easeOutCubic每次切换需要0.2秒；旋钮滑动 30 px (17 → 47)。","轨道始终先绘制灰色 #d9d7d5，再以切换进度为不透明度叠加蓝色 #1f5ae8，实现平滑混色。"],"source_summary":"The switches on the first two of three setting rows are turned on in turn, then off again.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. Three setting rows 60 px apart with dividers. At x 450 a 64×34 track (radius 17) and a white knob (radius 13, shadow).","Clicks: row 1 on at 1.0 s, row 2 on at 1.8 s, row 1 off at 3.0 s, row 2 off at 3.6 s. Row 3 stays off.","Each switch takes 0.2 s with easeOutCubic; the knob slides 30 px (17 → 47).","The track colour blends from grey #d9d7d5 to blue #1f5ae8 with the switch progress."],"source_use":"Use it for settings that take effect immediately and have only two states."},"060":{"summary":"单击天、周或月会滑动蓝色突出显示，下面的条形图会更改高度。","use":"使用它可以在同一内容的两到四个视图之间切换，例如日、周和月。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。 (121, 12) 处的灰色 300×40 底座（半径 10），分为三个 100 宽的部分：日、周、月（中文）。","选择：蓝色92×32，半径8，阴影模糊6；所选标签是白色的。","光标在 1.0 秒点击“周”、2.1 秒点击“月”、3.3 秒点击“日”；每次选中状态滑动历时 0.25 秒，使用 easeInOutCubic。","下图：七个条形，宽 34，间隔 58 像素（第六个是蓝色）。高度随着选择一起在三个数据集（大约 30-85、40-100、60-115）之间移动，以同样的方式缓和。"],"source_summary":"Clicking Day, Week or Month slides a blue highlight across and the bar chart below changes height.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A grey 300×40 base (radius 10) at (121, 12), split into three 100-wide segments: Day, Week, Month (in Japanese).","Selection: blue 92×32, radius 8, shadow blur 6; the selected label is white.","The cursor clicks Week at 1.0 s, Month at 2.1 s and Day at 3.3 s; the selection slides over 0.25 s each with easeInOutCubic.","Chart below: seven bars 34 wide, 58 px apart (the sixth is blue). Heights move between three data sets (about 30–85, 40–100, 60–115) together with the selection, eased the same way."],"source_use":"Use it to switch between two to four views of the same content, such as day, week and month."},"061":{"summary":"单击“新”和“免费”筹码会添加复选标记并将其变为蓝色，不匹配的卡牌会淡出。","use":"使用它可以让人们通过组合一些快速过滤器来缩小列表或搜索结果的范围。","spec":["542 × 191 卡片，周期 4.5 秒。4 个筛选标签（全部、新品、热门、免费）：高 34、圆角半径 17、宽度为文字宽度 + 32，从左向右间隔 10 像素。","点击顺序：0.95 秒开启“新品”，1.75 秒开启“免费”，3.0 秒关闭“新品”，3.6 秒关闭“免费”。","每次变化历时 0.15 秒，使用 easeOutCubic：标签加宽 18 像素，为勾号留出空间；填充浅蓝色，边框和文字变蓝。","列表如下：四张卡片（242×54，两列，两行）；不匹配的卡片的不透明度从 1 下降到 0.12。"],"source_summary":"Clicking the \"New\" and \"Free\" chips adds a check mark and turns them blue, and cards that do not match fade out.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. Four chips (\"All, New, Popular, Free\" in Japanese): 34 tall, radius 17, width = text + 32, 10 px apart from the left.","Clicks: New on at 0.95 s, Free on at 1.75 s, New off at 3.0 s, Free off at 3.6 s.","Each change takes 0.15 s with easeOutCubic: the chip widens 18 px to make room for a check mark; fill light blue, border and text blue.","List below: four cards (242×54, two columns, two rows); cards that do not match drop from opacity 1 to 0.12."],"source_use":"Use it to let people narrow a list or search results by combining a few quick filters."},"062":{"summary":"在价格滑块上，左手柄向右拖动，右手柄向左拖动以缩小范围，然后两者都返回。","use":"使用它可以按范围（例如价格、日期或尺寸）（具有最小值和最大值）进行过滤。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。轨道：x 54–488，8 高，y 120；两个手柄之间的部分是蓝色的。范围 0 日元到 10,000 日元。","手柄：白色，半径 13，3 px 蓝色边缘；拖动时，半径为 15，并带有半径为 24 的浅蓝色光晕。","低值滑块：1.0–1.6 秒由 0.1 → 0.3（¥1,000 → ¥3,000），3.55–3.9 秒返回。高值滑块：2.1–2.6 秒由 1.0 → 0.8（¥10,000 → ¥8,000），2.95–3.3 秒返回。均使用 easeInOutCubic。","每个手柄上方都有一个值气泡（28 高），拖动时为蓝色并带有白色文本。范围“¥1,000 – ¥10,000”在右上角以蓝色显示，以 ¥100 为单位更新。","光标位于其拖动的手柄上（按 1.0、2.1、2.95 和 3.55 秒）。"],"source_summary":"On a price slider, the left handle is dragged right and the right handle left to narrow the range, then both go back.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. Track: x 54–488, 8 tall, at y 120; the part between the two handles is blue. Range ¥0–¥10,000.","Handles: white, radius 13, 3 px blue rim; while dragged, radius 15 with a light-blue halo of radius 24.","Low handle: 0.1 → 0.3 (¥1,000 → ¥3,000) over 1.0–1.6 s, back over 3.55–3.9 s. High handle: 1.0 → 0.8 (¥10,000 → ¥8,000) over 2.1–2.6 s, back over 2.95–3.3 s. All easeInOutCubic.","A value bubble (28 tall) above each handle, blue with white text while dragged. The range \"¥1,000 – ¥10,000\" is shown in blue at top right, updated in ¥100 steps.","The cursor sits on the handle it drags (presses at 1.0, 2.1, 2.95 and 3.55 s)."],"source_use":"Use it to filter by a range, such as price, date or size, with a minimum and a maximum."},"063":{"summary":"按 + 三次将数字从 1 增加到 4，按 - 三次将其恢复为 1；每次按下都会弹出数字。","use":"将其用于一次更改一个的小整数，例如客人的数量或人数。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。 (171, 52) 处的 200×60 框（半径 12）：左侧 60 像素处的“−”，右侧 60 像素处的蓝色“+”，中间的粗体 30 像素数字。","点击：0.9、1.35、1.8 秒点击 +，数字从 1 增至 4；2.8、3.25、3.7 秒点击 −，数字从 4 减至 1。","每次点击之前的 0.05 秒到点击之后的 0.15 秒，按下的片段会呈现浅蓝色。","数字在每次点击后以 0.25 秒从 1.18 倍线性缩回 1 倍；缩放进度余量大于 0.05 时显示为蓝色，其余时间为深色。"],"source_summary":"Pressing + three times raises the number from 1 to 4, and pressing − three times brings it back to 1; the number pops on each press.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A 200×60 box (radius 12) at (171, 52): \"−\" in the left 60 px, a blue \"+\" in the right 60 px, and a bold 30 px number in the middle.","Clicks: + at 0.9, 1.35, 1.8 s (1 → 4), − at 2.8, 3.25, 3.7 s (4 → 1).","The pressed segment is tinted light blue from 0.05 s before to 0.15 s after each click.","Number: on each press its scale goes linearly from 1.18 back to 1 over 0.25 s, and it is blue meanwhile."],"source_use":"Use it for small whole numbers changed one at a time, such as quantity or number of guests."},"064":{"summary":"单击页码中的 2，然后单击 3 可移动蓝色圆圈并交换上面的列表；最后又回到1。","use":"使用它将长列表（例如搜索结果或文章）拆分为编号的页面。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。 “< 1 2 3 4 5 ›”居中，每个直径为 36，间隙为 8 px，y 为 160。蓝色圆圈（半径 18）标记当前页面，并带有白色文本。","光标在 1.0 秒处单击 2，在 2.1 秒处单击 3，在 3.3 秒处单击 1。","使用 easeInOutCubic，蓝色圆圈在 0.2 秒内每页移动 44 像素（从 3 回到 1 一次移动 88 像素）。","上方三行列表以 1.05、2.15、3.35 秒为中心，在两侧各 0.2 秒内不透明度经历 1 → 0 → 1；内容在最低点切换。"],"source_summary":"Clicking 2 and then 3 in the page numbers moves the blue circle and swaps the list above; finally it goes back to 1.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. \"‹ 1 2 3 4 5 ›\" centred, each 36 in diameter with 8 px gaps, at y 160. A blue circle (radius 18) marks the current page, with white text.","The cursor clicks 2 at 1.0 s, 3 at 2.1 s and 1 at 3.3 s.","The blue circle moves 44 px per page over 0.2 s each with easeInOutCubic (88 px at once from 3 back to 1).","The three-row list above dips in opacity 1 → 0 → 1 within 0.2 s either side of 1.05, 2.15 and 3.35 s, and its content changes at the dip."],"source_use":"Use it to split a long list, such as search results or articles, into numbered pages."},"065":{"summary":"点击标题右侧的三行图标，标题变为×，标题下方会下拉出一个菜单；再次单击将其关闭。","use":"在窄屏幕上使用它可以将主导航隐藏在一个按钮后面。","spec":["542 × 191 卡片，周期 4.5 秒。白色页头高 44；右侧 (500, 22) 处有 3 条线，每条长 24、粗 3，间隔 8 像素。","光标在 1.0 秒和 3.3 秒处单击。打开量a：1.0-1.3秒内0→1，3.3-3.6秒内1→0，easeInOutCubic。","线到×：顶线和底线向中心移动8px并旋转±45°；中线以不透明度 1 − a 淡出。打开时呈蓝色。","菜单：白色，高 140，顶部位于 y = 44 − 140 + 140·a，因此它从标题下方掉落（剪裁在标题下方），阴影模糊 16，四个项目，第一个蓝色。"],"source_summary":"Clicking the three-line icon at the header's right turns it into ×, and a menu drops down from under the header; clicking again closes it.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A white 44-tall header; three lines (24 long, 3 thick, 8 px apart) at (500, 22) on the right.","The cursor clicks at 1.0 s and 3.3 s. Open amount a: 0→1 over 1.0–1.3 s, 1→0 over 3.3–3.6 s, easeInOutCubic.","Lines to ×: the top and bottom lines move 8 px to the centre and rotate ±45°; the middle line fades with opacity 1 − a. Blue while open.","Menu: white, 140 tall, top at y = 44 − 140 + 140·a so it drops from under the header (clipped below the header), shadow blur 16, four items, the first blue."],"source_use":"Use it on narrow screens to tuck the main navigation behind one button."},"066":{"summary":"点击面包屑中的“课程”，进入列表页面；单击那里的卡片会返回到详细信息页面。","use":"在具有深层层次结构的网站上使用它来显示页面所在位置并提供返回路径。","spec":["542×191 卡片，循环周期 4.5 秒。顶部为“首页 › 课程 › 网页制作”（17 像素）：链接蓝色，当前页面为黑色粗体；y = 46 处有分隔线。","光标悬停在“课程”（下划线 0.9–1.2 秒）上并在 1.0 秒处单击。","上升量：在 1.0–1.25 秒内，使用 easeInOutCubic 实现 0→1。 “> 网页制作”淡出，“课程”成为当前页面（黑色、粗体）。","内容从详细信息页面（标题和文本）交叉淡入淡出到三张卡片的列表（158×118，带有横向图片）。","返回：光标移到第一张卡片（2.45–2.8 秒出现蓝色边框），并在 2.7 秒点击；详情页在 2.7–2.95 秒内返回。"],"source_summary":"Clicking \"Courses\" in the breadcrumbs goes up to the list page; clicking a card there returns to the detail page.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. At the top \"Home › Courses › Web design\" (in Japanese, 17 px): links blue, current page black and bold; a divider at y 46.","The cursor hovers \"Courses\" (underline 0.9–1.2 s) and clicks at 1.0 s.","Up amount: 0→1 over 1.0–1.25 s with easeInOutCubic. \"› Web design\" fades out and \"Courses\" becomes the current page (black, bold).","Content cross-fades from a detail page (title and text) to a list of three cards (158×118, with a landscape picture).","Back: the cursor moves onto the first card (blue outline 2.45–2.8 s) and clicks at 2.7 s; the detail page returns over 2.7–2.95 s."],"source_use":"Use it on sites with deep hierarchies to show where the page is and give a way back up."},"067":{"summary":"将鼠标悬停在标题中的“产品”上会出现一个全宽面板，其中包含三列链接和一个图像；当光标离开时它关闭。","use":"在包含许多产品或部分的网站上使用它，以便访问者可以立即看到整个系列。","spec":["542×191 卡片，循环周期 4.5 秒。42 像素高的页头包含“产品、费用、支持”（16 像素，每项都有向下的 V 形）。","仅悬停：光标在 1.0 秒到达“产品”。展开进度 a 在 1.05–1.3 秒用 easeOutCubic 从 0 增至 1；“产品”变蓝并带下划线。","面板：白色，全宽，146 高，在标题下方下降 12 像素，同时以 a 淡入。阴影模糊 18，偏移 y 8。","内部：三列，间隔 130 像素（每列一个蓝色标题和三个链接），右侧有一张 104×112 图片。光标向下移动，第二列的第二个链接从 1.75 秒到 2.9 秒以浅蓝色突出显示。","关闭：光标从 2.9 秒起离开面板；面板在 3.15–3.4 秒淡出，采用 1 − easeInOutCubic。"],"source_summary":"Hovering over \"Products\" in the header drops a full-width panel with three columns of links and an image; it closes when the cursor leaves.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A 42-tall header with \"Products, Pricing, Support\" (in Japanese, 16 px, each with a down chevron).","The cursor only hovers: it reaches \"Products\" at 1.0 s. Open amount a: 0→1 over 1.05–1.3 s with easeOutCubic; \"Products\" turns blue with an underline.","Panel: white, full width, 146 tall, dropping 12 px into place under the header while fading in with a. Shadow blur 18, offset y 8.","Inside: three columns 130 px apart (a blue heading and three links each) and a 104×112 picture at the right. The cursor moves down and the second link of the second column is highlighted light blue from 1.75 to 2.9 s.","Close: the cursor leaves the panel from 2.9 s; it fades over 3.15–3.4 s (1 − easeInOutCubic)."],"source_use":"Use it on sites with many products or sections so visitors can see the whole range at once."},"068":{"summary":"每次单击“下一步”都会将四个步骤圆圈中的下一个变为选中状态，并将蓝线延伸到下一个步骤。","use":"在注册或结帐等多步骤流程中使用它来显示进度和剩余内容。","spec":["542×191 卡片，循环周期 4.5 秒。四个步骤“输入、确认、付款、已完成”的圆心位于 x = 80、207、334、461，y = 35；半径 17 的圆由 4 像素灰线连接。","光标在0.9、1.7和2.5秒处单击“下一步”（110×38，右下）。","每次单击时，当前步骤都会变为带有白色勾号的蓝色圆圈，下一个步骤将变为当前步骤（蓝色圆圈，白色数字）。未到达的台阶为白色，边缘为灰色。","使用 easeInOutCubic，蓝线每次点击在 0.3 秒内增长 127 像素；第三次单击后，所有四个都被选中。","重置：指示器在 3.75–4.05 秒内淡出，并在 4.05–4.3 秒内淡入步骤 1。"],"source_summary":"Each click on \"Next\" turns the next of four step circles into a check and extends the blue line to the following step.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. Four steps (\"Details, Review, Payment, Done\" in Japanese) at x 80, 207, 334, 461, y 35; circles of radius 17 joined by a 4 px grey line.","The cursor clicks \"Next\" (110×38, bottom right) at 0.9, 1.7 and 2.5 s.","On each click the current step becomes a blue circle with a white check and the next becomes the current one (blue circle, white number). Steps not reached are white with a grey rim.","The blue line grows 127 px per click over 0.3 s with easeInOutCubic; after the third click all four are checked.","Reset: the indicator fades out over 3.75–4.05 s and fades back in at step 1 over 4.05–4.3 s."],"source_use":"Use it in multi-step flows such as sign-up or checkout to show progress and what is left."},"069":{"summary":"单击“重新加载”会将列表变成相同形状的灰色块，并发出一抹闪亮的光芒；加载结束时返回内容。","use":"将其用于需要一些时间加载的列表或卡片，以便在人们等待时可以看到布局。","spec":["542 × 191 卡片，周期 4.5 秒。两行列表，每行有一张 96 × 56 图片和 3 条文字；光标在 1.0 秒点击右上角重载图标。","在 1.05–1.2 秒（线性）内，内容切换为相同大小和位置的灰色 #e9e7e5 圆角块。","闪耀：一条 160 宽的白色带（边缘透明，中间不透明度 0.75）每 0.9 秒从 x −200 扫描到 x 742，仅在块上绘制。","内容在 3.0–3.3 秒内返回，采用线性变化。"],"source_summary":"Clicking reload turns the list into grey blocks of the same shape with a sweeping shine; the content returns when loading ends.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A two-row list (a 96×56 picture and three text lines each). The cursor clicks the reload icon at top right at 1.0 s.","Over 1.05–1.2 s (linear) the content switches to grey #e9e7e5 rounded blocks of the same size and position.","Shine: a white band 160 wide (transparent at the edges, opacity 0.75 in the middle) sweeps from x −200 to x 742 every 0.9 s, drawn only over the blocks.","The content returns over 3.0–3.3 s (linear)."],"source_use":"Use it for lists or cards that take a moment to load, so the layout is visible while people wait."},"070":{"summary":"点击“发送”会将卡片洗成白色，中间会旋转一条蓝色弧线；完成后，它会变成格子并消失。","use":"将其用于未知长度的短暂等待，例如发送或保存。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。光标在 1.0 秒处单击“发送”（120×40，底部中心）。","1.05–1.2 秒内，白色半透明遮罩（不透明度 0.78）和加载转圈在线性变化下覆盖整个卡片并淡入。","加载转圈位于 (271, 92)：浅色圆环，半径 26、线宽 6；上方叠加蓝色 243°（1.35π）圆弧，两端为圆头，每秒转动 1.3 圈（468°/s）。","2.95–3.05 秒加载转圈淡出；2.95–3.2 秒带白色勾号的蓝色圆圈（半径 28）由 0.7 缩放至 1，使用 easeOutCubic。","一切都会在 3.75–4.0 秒内线性淡出。"],"source_summary":"Clicking \"Send\" washes the card white and a blue arc spins in the middle; when finished it changes to a check and fades.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. The cursor clicks \"Send\" (120×40, bottom centre) at 1.0 s.","Over 1.05–1.2 s (linear) a white scrim (opacity 0.78) and the spinner fade in over the whole card.","Spinner at (271, 92): a pale ring, radius 26, 6 thick, with a blue 243° (1.35π) arc on top (round caps), turning 1.3 times per second (468°/s).","Over 2.95–3.05 s the spinner fades; over 2.95–3.2 s a blue circle (radius 28) with a white check scales 0.7 → 1 (easeOutCubic).","Everything fades out linearly over 3.75–4.0 s."],"source_use":"Use it for short waits of unknown length, such as sending or saving."},"071":{"summary":"每次收到通知时，标题中铃铛上的蓝点就会累加 1、2、3；单击响铃即可将其清除。","use":"使用它来引起对计数的注意，例如未读消息或购物车中的物品。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。一个 54 高的标头，右侧 (482, 27) 处有一个线画铃。","徽章：钟的右上角有一个半径为 12 的蓝色圆圈 (+12, −12)，2.5 px 白色边缘，白色 14 px 数字。","通知在 0.7、1.3 和 1.9 秒内到达：计数从 1 → 2 → 3 开始。第一个通过 easeOutCubic 在 0.7–0.9 秒内扩展。","第二、第三次通知到达时，徽章从 1.3 倍在线性 0.3 秒内回到 1 倍；第一次的弹跳与 0.7–0.9 秒出现动画叠加。每次到达后 0.5 秒内发出波纹环，半径 12→28、不透明度 0.5→0。","光标在 2.95 s 处到达铃声，并在 3.0 s 处点击；使用 easeInOutCubic，徽章会在 3.0–3.25 秒内缩小到 0。"],"source_summary":"Each time a notification arrives, the blue dot on the bell in the header counts up 1, 2, 3; clicking the bell clears it.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A 54-tall header with a line-drawn bell at (482, 27) on the right.","Badge: a blue circle of radius 12 at the bell's top right (+12, −12), 2.5 px white rim, white 14 px number.","Notifications arrive at 0.7, 1.3 and 1.9 s: the count goes 1 → 2 → 3. The first scales in over 0.7–0.9 s with easeOutCubic.","Each arrival pops the scale from 1.3 back to 1 over 0.3 s and sends out a ripple ring (radius 12 → 28, opacity 0.5 → 0) over 0.5 s.","The cursor reaches the bell at 2.95 s and clicks at 3.0 s; the badge shrinks to 0 over 3.0–3.25 s with easeInOutCubic."],"source_use":"Use it to call attention to a count, such as unread messages or items in a cart."},"072":{"summary":"删除带有垃圾图标的两个列表行会显示一个空框绘图，“这里还没有”和一个“添加”按钮。","use":"将其用于首次使用屏幕或无结果页面，以告诉人们下一步该做什么。","spec":["542×191 卡上的周期为 4.5 秒。一个两行列表（494×48，半径8，右侧有一个垃圾桶图标）。","光标在 0.95 秒和 1.65 秒点击垃圾桶图标；每一行在 0.3 秒内向左滑动 60 像素并淡出（easeInOutCubic），第二行向上移动 58 像素占据第一行的位置。","1.95–2.3 秒，空状态线性淡入并上升 8 像素：蓝色收件箱线稿、“这里还没有内容”（16 像素）和蓝色“添加”按钮（112 × 34）。","光标在 3.3 秒点击“添加”；空状态在 3.25–3.45 秒淡出，两行内容在 3.35–3.7 秒从左侧返回，采用 easeOutCubic。"],"source_summary":"Deleting the two list rows with their trash icons brings up an empty-box drawing, \"Nothing here yet\" and an \"Add\" button.","source_spec":["4.5 s cycle on a 542×191 card. A two-row list (494×48, radius 8, a trash icon at the right).","The cursor clicks the trash icons at 0.95 s and 1.65 s. Each row slides 60 px left while fading out over 0.3 s (easeInOutCubic); the second row moves up 58 px into the first slot.","Over 1.95–2.3 s (linear) the empty state fades in while rising 8 px: a blue line drawing of an inbox tray, \"Nothing here yet\" (16 px, in Japanese) and a blue \"Add\" button (112×34).","The cursor clicks \"Add\" at 3.3 s; the empty state fades over 3.25–3.45 s and the two rows come back from the left over 3.35–3.7 s with easeOutCubic."],"source_use":"Use it for first-use screens or no-results pages to tell people what to do next."},"073":{"summary":"当页面向下滚动时，标题通常向上移动，而天空和太阳、远山和近山移动得更慢。","use":"用它来给英雄或剖面照片一种深度感。","spec":["具有 511 × 168 视口的浏览器窗口。滚动：0→120 像素，0.3–1.9 秒，120→0，2.9–4.3 秒（三次缓入缓出）。","每层按滚动×因子移动：天空和太阳0.15，远山0.4，近山0.7。","标题（28 像素）、按钮和下一部分以 1.0 移动（正常滚动）。","下一部分（白色）从首屏底部（168 像素处）开始，滑过移动较慢的背景。","右侧滚动条滑块随页面滚动而移动。"],"source_summary":"As the page scrolls down, the headline moves up normally while the sky and sun, far hills and near hills move more slowly.","source_spec":["A browser window with a 511 × 168 viewport. Scroll: 0→120 px at 0.3–1.9 s, 120→0 at 2.9–4.3 s (cubic ease-in-out).","Each layer moves by scroll × factor: sky and sun 0.15, far hills 0.4, near hills 0.7.","Headline (28 px), button and the next section move at 1.0 (normal scrolling).","The next section (white) starts at the bottom of the hero (168 px) and slides over the slower background.","The scrollbar thumb on the right moves with the scroll."],"source_use":"Use it to give the hero or a section photo a sense of depth."},"074":{"summary":"当页面滚动时，标题、卡片和正文各自升起到位，并在进入视图时淡入。","use":"在较长的登陆页面上使用它，可以随着读者滚动而将内容逐段呈现。","spec":["滚动：0→95 像素，0.35–1.0 秒，95→200 像素，1.5–2.1 秒，200→0，3.2–4.4 秒（所有三次缓入缓出）。","触发线位于视口高度的 85%（距顶部 143 像素）；元素顶部越过该线向上时触发，采用 Intersection Observer 的思路。","触发后 0.7 秒内，不透明度从 0 增至 1，位置由向下偏移 28 像素回到 0，采用三次缓出。","三个元素：标题（页面下方 172 像素）、一行三张卡片（206 像素）和正文（334 像素），全部位于视图下方。该行中的卡片一起出现。","当某个元素在返回的过程中离开视图底部时，它会重置为看不见，并在下次再次播放。"],"source_summary":"As the page scrolls, the heading, the cards and the body text each rise into place and fade in when they enter the view.","source_spec":["Scroll: 0→95 px at 0.35–1.0 s, 95→200 px at 1.5–2.1 s, 200→0 at 3.2–4.4 s (all cubic ease-in-out).","Trigger line at 85% of the viewport height (143 px from the top). An element fires when its top edge passes above it (the Intersection Observer idea).","After firing, over 0.7 s: opacity 0→1 and offset 28 px below → 0 (cubic ease-out).","Three elements: the heading (172 px down the page), a row of three cards (206 px) and body text (334 px), all below the view at first. The cards in the row appear together.","When an element leaves the bottom of the view on the way back up, it is reset out of sight and plays again next time."],"source_use":"Use it on a long landing page to bring content in piece by piece as the reader scrolls."},"075":{"summary":"公告条滚动离开，但其下方的标题停在顶部边缘，内容在下方滚动。","use":"使用它可以使菜单和号召性用语在长页面上触手可及。","spec":["滚动：0→110 像素，0.4–1.3 秒，110→250 像素，1.9–2.8 秒，250→0，3.4–4.4 秒（三次缓入缓出）。","最顶部是高 22 像素的深蓝色公告条；其下是高 34 像素的页头，包含标志、3 个菜单项和按钮。","页头位置 = max(22 − 滚动距离, 0)：公告条滚出后，页头停在视口顶部（position: sticky; top: 0）。","页头固定后，在接下来的 24 像素滚动距离中，页头下方 12 像素高的渐变阴影最深处不透明度从 0 增至 0.16。","照片、标题和 3 张卡片在页头下方正常滚动。"],"source_summary":"The announcement strip scrolls away, but the header below it stops at the top edge and the content scrolls underneath.","source_spec":["Scroll: 0→110 px at 0.4–1.3 s, 110→250 px at 1.9–2.8 s, 250→0 at 3.4–4.4 s (cubic ease-in-out).","At the very top, a 22 px announcement strip (navy); below it a 34 px header (logo, three menu items, button).","Header position = max(22 − scroll, 0): once the strip is gone, it stops at the top edge (position: sticky; top: 0).","Over the next 24 px of scroll, a 12 px shadow under the header fades from 0 to 0.16 opacity.","The content (photo, heading, three cards) scrolls normally under the header."],"source_use":"Use it to keep the menu and the call-to-action within reach on a long page."},"076":{"summary":"海军蓝部分在充满视野时停止；进一步滚动，数字和照片将依次经过 1→2→3，然后该部分继续滚动。","use":"使用它可以在一个屏幕中浏览步骤、功能或之前/之后。","spec":["滚动：0→500 像素，0.3–3.0 秒，500→0，3.5–4.5 秒（三次缓入缓出）。","高 168 像素的深蓝色区块在滚动至 110 像素时到达顶部，并在接下来的 300 像素滚动距离内固定（GSAP ScrollTrigger pin）。","固定时的进度：p = (scroll − 110) / 300。左侧的垂直线（长 124）用 p 填充橙色。","当 p = 1/3 和 2/3（±0.07，三次缓入缓出）时进入下一步：数字（46 像素）向上滚动 52 像素，照片（226 × 124）向上滑动 124 像素。","滚动 300 像素后解除固定，区块与下方白色区块一起向上滚动。"],"source_summary":"A navy section stops when it fills the view; further scrolling steps the number and photo through 1→2→3, then the section scrolls on.","source_spec":["Scroll: 0→500 px at 0.3–3.0 s, 500→0 at 3.5–4.5 s (cubic ease-in-out).","The section (168 tall, navy) reaches the top at 110 px of scroll and stays there for the next 300 px (a GSAP ScrollTrigger pin).","Progress while pinned: p = (scroll − 110) / 300. A vertical line (124 long) on the left fills in orange with p.","At p = 1/3 and 2/3 (±0.07, cubic ease-in-out) it moves to the next step: the number (46 px) rolls up 52 px and the photo (226 × 124) slides up 124 px.","After 300 px the pin is released and the section scrolls up with the white section below it."],"source_use":"Use it to walk through steps, features or a before/after in one screen."},"077":{"summary":"当页面向下滚动时，该部分保持静止，并且四张编号的工作卡向左移动。","use":"使用它在长垂直页面内连续显示工作、案例研究或产品。","spec":["滚动：0→420 像素，0.3–3.0 秒，420→0，3.5–4.5 秒（三次缓入缓出）。","标题“作品”随页面滚出；滚动 40 像素时区块到达顶部并固定。","卡：四张，尺寸为 200 × 112，间隙 20，侧边距 34。水平行程 = 34·2 + 200·4 + 20·3 − 511 = 417 像素。","Card x = start x − p × 417，其中 p = (scroll − 40) / 380：滚动呈线性，无缓动。","卡片横向移动时，右侧滚动条滑块向下移动。"],"source_summary":"As the page scrolls down, the section holds still and four numbered work cards travel to the left.","source_spec":["Scroll: 0→420 px at 0.3–3.0 s, 420→0 at 3.5–4.5 s (cubic ease-in-out).","The heading \"WORKS\" scrolls away; the section reaches the top at 40 px of scroll and stays there.","Cards: four at 200 × 112, gap 20, side padding 34. Horizontal travel = 34·2 + 200·4 + 20·3 − 511 = 417 px.","Card x = start x − p × 417, with p = (scroll − 40) / 380: linear in scroll, no easing.","The scrollbar thumb moves down while the cards move sideways."],"source_use":"Use it to show work, case studies or products in a row inside a long vertical page."},"078":{"summary":"小幅滚动后，页面将自行完成其余部分，直到下一部分的顶部与视图的顶部对齐。","use":"将其用于应一次全屏阅读的页面，例如幻灯片。","spec":["每个部分与视口一样高（168 像素）。第一个是淡蓝色，第二个是海军蓝。","每 2.4 秒吸附一次。0.45–0.85 秒用户只滚动 34 像素（三次缓出）。","在 0.9–1.5 秒时，页面自行移动剩余的 134 像素，并与下一部分的顶部对齐（三次缓出）。","后一个 2.4 秒反向向上执行相同动作，回到第一区块，对应 scroll-snap-type: y mandatory 的行为。"],"source_summary":"After a small scroll, the page carries itself the rest of the way until the next section's top lines up with the top of the view.","source_spec":["Each section is as tall as the viewport (168 px). The first is pale blue, the second navy.","One snap per 2.4 s. At 0.45–0.85 s the user scrolls only 34 px (cubic ease-out).","At 0.9–1.5 s the page moves the remaining 134 px by itself and lines up the next section's top (cubic ease-out).","The second 2.4 s does the same upward, back to the first section (the behaviour of scroll-snap-type: y mandatory)."],"source_use":"Use it for a page that should read one full screen at a time, like slides."},"079":{"summary":"当文章一次阅读一点时，沿着顶部的线从左侧开始延伸到页面底部的远端。","use":"在长文章上使用它来显示还剩多少内容需要阅读。","spec":["文章以四段滚动从 0 到 430 像素：前三段各 110 像素，最后一段 100 像素；每段移动 0.45 秒，前三段后各暂停 0.4 秒，最后保持 0.45 秒；均使用三次缓入缓出。","它在 3.75–4.55 秒返回 430→0。","视口顶部的 6 px 条：浅灰色轨道，橙色填充。","填充宽度 = 511 px × 滚动 / 430，滚动部分本身（与 CSS 动画时间轴：scroll() 相同）。"],"source_summary":"As the article is read a bit at a time, the line along the top grows from the left and reaches the far end at the bottom of the page.","source_spec":["The article scrolls 0→430 px in four 110 px steps, each moving for 0.45 s then pausing 0.4 s (cubic ease-in-out).","It returns 430→0 at 3.75–4.55 s.","A 6 px bar along the top of the viewport: light grey track, orange fill.","Fill width = 511 px × scroll / 430, the scroll fraction itself (the same as CSS animation-timeline: scroll())."],"source_use":"Use it on long articles to show how much is left to read."},"080":{"summary":"当副本滚动到视图中时，会在关键字的下半部分从左到右绘制黄色荧光笔笔划。","use":"在登陆页面文案中使用它可以使重要的短语在阅读时脱颖而出。","spec":["滚动：0→90 像素，0.35–1.0 秒，90→180 像素，1.6–2.2 秒，180→0，3.3–4.4 秒（三次缓入缓出）。","两行粗体文案（20 像素）分别位于页面向下 190 和 290 像素处，开始时位于视口下方。","当一行的顶部通过触发线（视口高度的 80%，134 像素）时，其关键字下方的笔画开始。","描边：黄色 #FFE36B，高 11 像素，位于文字下部（基线上方 8 像素至基线下方 3 像素）。宽度从 0 自左向右增长至文字宽度，历时 0.8 秒（三次缓出），绘制在文字后方。","离开视口底部的文字行在屏幕外重置。"],"source_summary":"As the copy scrolls into view, a yellow highlighter stroke is drawn left to right across the lower half of the key words.","source_spec":["Scroll: 0→90 px at 0.35–1.0 s, 90→180 px at 1.6–2.2 s, 180→0 at 3.3–4.4 s (cubic ease-in-out).","Two lines of copy (20 px, bold) at 190 px and 290 px down the page, hidden below the view at first.","When a line's top passes the trigger line (80% of the viewport height, 134 px), the stroke under its key words starts.","Stroke: yellow #FFE36B, 11 tall, in the lower part of the text (8 px above to 3 px below the baseline). Width 0 → word width from the left over 0.8 s (cubic ease-out), drawn behind the text.","Lines that leave the bottom of the view are reset out of sight."],"source_use":"Use it in landing-page copy to make the one phrase that matters stand out as it is read."},"081":{"summary":"只有光标下方的卡片微微抬起，影子扩散开来；当光标离开时它会恢复原状。","use":"使用它使卡片和按钮看起来可点击。","spec":["三张牌（146 × 128，半径 10）。光标从左到右停留在每个选项上约 1 秒。","悬停时，卡片在 0.3 秒内上升 10 像素（三次缓出）；离开时，它会在相同的 0.3 秒内返回（就像 CSS 过渡）。","阴影，随提升一起变化：模糊6→22 px，y 偏移2→12 px，不透明度0.08→0.22。","浅灰色页面搭配白色卡片，使阴影清晰可见。"],"source_summary":"Only the card under the cursor lifts slightly and its shadow spreads; it settles back when the cursor leaves.","source_spec":["Three cards (146 × 128, radius 10). The cursor rests on each, left to right, for about 1 s.","On hover the card rises 10 px over 0.3 s (cubic ease-out); on leave it returns over the same 0.3 s (like a CSS transition).","Shadow, changed together with the lift: blur 6→22 px, y offset 2→12 px, opacity 0.08→0.22.","Light grey page, white cards, so the shadow reads."],"source_use":"Use it to make cards and buttons look clickable."},"082":{"summary":"光标下方的照片会慢慢放大，同时边框保持相同大小，当光标离开时，照片会缩小。","use":"在照片网格（作品、产品、文章）上使用它来显示将要选择的项目。","spec":["两个相框，222×118（半径8）。光标停留在左边，然后停留在右边，每次大约 1.5 秒。","悬停时，内容在 0.5 秒内从中心缩放 1→1.15（三次缓出）；离开时，它会在 0.5 秒内返回。","画框之外的内容被裁剪（overflow: hidden）；画框和说明文字均不移动。"],"source_summary":"The photo under the cursor slowly enlarges while its frame stays the same size, and shrinks back when the cursor leaves.","source_spec":["Two photo frames, 222 × 118 (radius 8). The cursor rests on the left one, then the right one, for about 1.5 s each.","On hover the content scales 1→1.15 from the centre over 0.5 s (cubic ease-out); on leave it returns over 0.5 s.","Anything outside the frame is clipped (overflow: hidden). The frame and the caption do not move."],"source_use":"Use it on photo grids (work, products, articles) to show which item is about to be chosen."},"083":{"summary":"当光标在页面上移动时，一个橙色圆圈会跟随在其后面一点。","use":"在品牌网站和产品组合中使用它可以增添有趣、实用的感觉。","spec":["光标路径：x = 255 + 175·sin(2πt/4.8)，y = 86 + 46·sin(4πt/4.8)（8字形侧卧，每4.8秒一圈）。","圆形：半径 17，橙色，不透明度 0.88，在光标下方绘制。","跟随规则：每帧（60 fps）追上剩余距离的 12%，例如 x += (光标 x − x) × 0.12。","箭头光标保持可见。"],"source_summary":"As the cursor moves around the page, an orange circle follows it a little behind.","source_spec":["Cursor path: x = 255 + 175·sin(2πt/4.8), y = 86 + 46·sin(4πt/4.8) (a figure eight lying on its side, one lap per 4.8 s).","Circle: radius 17, orange, opacity 0.88, drawn under the cursor.","Follow rule: every frame (60 fps) it covers 12% of the remaining distance (x += (cursor x − x) × 0.12).","The arrow cursor stays visible."],"source_use":"Use it on brand sites and portfolios to add a playful, hands-on feel."},"084":{"summary":"当光标靠近时，按钮会被拉向光标并跟随；当光标离开时，按钮会摇回到原来的位置。","use":"在您最想点击的按钮上使用它，例如注册或联系。","spec":["中心有一个 168 × 52 按钮（橙色，半径 26）。拉动范围是距按钮中心 110 px 的半径。","在范围内，目标偏移 =（光标位置 − 按钮中心）× 0.35；每帧（60 fps）按钮向目标移动剩余距离的 18%。","离开范围后，它会在 1.1 秒内从当前偏移量返回到 0，elastic.out(1, 0.3): 2^(−10x)·sin((x − 0.075)·2π/0.3) + 1。","光标从左侧进入，绕按钮一圈，向右离开。"],"source_summary":"As the cursor comes near, the button is drawn toward it and follows; when the cursor leaves, the button wobbles back to its place.","source_spec":["A 168 × 52 button (orange, radius 26) in the centre. The pull range is a 110 px radius from the button's centre.","Inside the range: target offset = (cursor − button centre) × 0.35; every frame (60 fps) the button covers 18% of the way to the target.","On leaving the range it returns from its current offset to 0 over 1.1 s with elastic.out(1, 0.3): 2^(−10x)·sin((x − 0.075)·2π/0.3) + 1.","The cursor enters from the left, circles the button and leaves to the right."],"source_use":"Use it on the one button you most want clicked, such as sign-up or contact."},"085":{"summary":"每次单击都会从单击点发出一个白色圆圈来填充按钮，然后它会消失。","use":"用它来确认按下按钮或列表项就在发生的地方。","spec":["橙色按钮尺寸 280 × 56，圆角半径 10；在 0.7 秒点击中心左侧，2.9 秒点击中心右侧。","圆以点击点为中心；它的半径在 0.6 秒内从 0 增长到到按钮最远角的距离（三次缓出）。","不透明度为 0.4 的白色，单击后 0.3 到 0.8 秒之间褪色为 0。","圆圈被剪裁到按钮（溢出：隐藏）；标签位于其上方。"],"source_summary":"Each click sends a white circle out from the click point to fill the button, then it fades away.","source_spec":["Button 280 × 56 (orange, radius 10). Clicks at 0.7 s (left of centre) and 2.9 s (right of centre).","The circle is centred on the click point; its radius grows from 0 to the distance to the button's farthest corner over 0.6 s (cubic ease-out).","White at 0.4 opacity, fading to 0 between 0.3 and 0.8 s after the click.","The circle is clipped to the button (overflow: hidden); the label sits above it."],"source_use":"Use it to confirm a press on a button or list item right where it happened."},"086":{"summary":"在光标所在的链接下方，一条橙色线从左侧延伸出来；当光标离开时，该线会向右收缩。","use":"在菜单和文本链接上使用它可以安静地显示指针所在的位置。","spec":["三个链接（20 像素，粗体，间隔 56）。光标从左到右停留在每个区域约 1 秒（悬停判定区域比每侧文本宽 6 像素）。","下划线：橙色，3 粗，低于基线 8 像素。","悬停时，宽度从左端开始 0→100%，持续 0.3 秒（三次缓出）。","离开时，左端向右移动 0.3 秒，因此该线向右退出（就像右侧带有变换原点的scaleX）。"],"source_summary":"Under the link the cursor is on, an orange line grows from the left; when the cursor leaves, the line shrinks away to the right.","source_spec":["Three links (20 px, bold, 56 apart). The cursor rests on each, left to right, for about 1 s (hit area 6 px wider than the text on each side).","Underline: orange, 3 thick, 8 px below the baseline.","On hover, width 0→100% from the left end over 0.3 s (cubic ease-out).","On leave, the left end moves right over 0.3 s, so the line exits to the right (like scaleX with transform-origin on the right)."],"source_use":"Use it on menu and text links to show where the pointer is, quietly."},"087":{"summary":"左右拖动照片中间的线可以改变“之前”（左）的灰色和“之后”（右）的彩色显示量。","use":"在出售更改的页面上使用它：翻新、美容、照片修饰。","spec":["相框359×140（半径10）。右：编辑后的彩色照片。左：与“之前”相同的照片（去除饱和度，顶部为海军蓝，不透明度为 0.18）。","之前的图像被剪裁到分隔线的左侧。分隔线上：一条白线（3 宽）和一个带左/右箭头的白圆圈（半径 17）。","0.7 秒时，圆被抓取；分隔线变为 50%→20% (0.75–1.55 s) →82% (1.55–2.65 s) →50% (2.65–3.55 s)，所有三次缓入缓出。","3.62 秒松开；左上角标“调整前”，右上角标“调整后”。"],"source_summary":"Dragging the line in the middle of the photo left and right changes how much of the grey \"before\" (left) and the coloured \"after\" (right) is shown.","source_spec":["Photo frame 359 × 140 (radius 10). Right: the edited photo in colour. Left: the same photo as the \"before\" (saturation removed, navy at 0.18 opacity on top).","The before image is clipped to the left of the divider. On the divider: a white line (3 wide) and a white circle (radius 17) with left/right arrows.","At 0.7 s the circle is grabbed; the divider goes 50%→20% (0.75–1.55 s) →82% (1.55–2.65 s) →50% (2.65–3.55 s), all cubic ease-in-out.","Released at 3.62 s. Labels BEFORE (top left) and AFTER (top right)."],"source_use":"Use it on pages that sell a change: renovation, beauty, photo retouching."},"088":{"summary":"当光标穿过页面顶部（朝向选项卡和关闭按钮）时，页面变暗并显示“稍等！”弹出窗口打开。 × 将其关闭。","use":"使用它向即将离开但尚未转化的访客提供最后一次报价。","spec":["光标在 0.7–1.25 秒内从页面上升到浏览器的地址栏（三次缓入缓出）。","当光标穿过视口的上边缘（y = 0，大约 1.07 秒）时触发，与 clientY ≤ 0 的文档上的 mouseleave 测试相同。","触发后 0.05–0.45 秒打开（三次缓出）：深蓝色背景遮罩不透明度 0 → 0.5；弹窗（260 × 132，圆角半径 12）不透明度 0 → 1，缩放 0.9 → 1。","内部：标题、折扣行（橙色）、优惠券按钮和右上角的 ×。","点击2.9秒处的×；它会在 0.03-0.25 秒后消失（线性）。"],"source_summary":"When the cursor heads out through the top of the page (toward the tabs and close button), the page dims and a \"Wait!\" popup opens. The × closes it.","source_spec":["The cursor rises from the page toward the browser's address bar at 0.7–1.25 s (cubic ease-in-out).","It fires when the cursor crosses the top edge of the viewport (y = 0, at about 1.07 s), the same test as mouseleave on document with clientY ≤ 0.","Opens 0.05–0.45 s after firing (cubic ease-out): backdrop navy 0→0.5 opacity; popup (260 × 132, radius 12) opacity 0→1 and scale 0.9→1.","Inside: a heading, a discount line (orange), a coupon button and an × at the top right.","Click on the × at 2.9 s; it disappears 0.03–0.25 s later (linear)."],"source_use":"Use it to make one last offer to visitors who are about to leave without converting."},"089":{"summary":"在海军蓝屏幕上，徽标下方的数字从 0% 计数到 100%；然后屏幕升起，下面的页面淡入。","use":"在图像或视频较多的网站上使用它，将加载等待变成品牌时刻。","spec":["海军蓝屏幕用徽标、数字（28 像素）和条形图（180 × 4）填充视口。","0→100% 在 0.25–2.1 秒（三次缓出，四舍五入到整数）；条形以相同的速度填充为橙色。","2.3–2.85 秒内整个画面向上移动 168 像素并移出，采用三次缓入缓出。","2.35–2.95 秒页面标题和照片不透明度从 0 增至 1，并从下方 14 像素处上升（三次缓出）。","在 4.25–4.75 秒时，屏幕从顶部回到 0%（下一次加载）。"],"source_summary":"On a navy screen the number under the logo counts from 0% to 100%; then the screen lifts away and the page underneath fades in.","source_spec":["A navy screen fills the viewport with a logo, a number (28 px) and a bar (180 × 4).","0→100% at 0.25–2.1 s (cubic ease-out, rounded to whole numbers); the bar fills in orange at the same rate.","At 2.3–2.85 s the whole screen moves up 168 px and out (cubic ease-in-out).","The page heading and photo fade in 0→1 and rise from 14 px below at 2.35–2.95 s (cubic ease-out).","At 4.25–4.75 s the screen comes back down from the top, at 0% (the next load)."],"source_use":"Use it on image- or video-heavy sites to turn the loading wait into a brand moment."},"090":{"summary":"当灰色占位符滚动到视图中时，每个占位符都会旋转一个旋转器，并且图像在到达时会淡入。最上面一行从头开始加载。","use":"在图像较多的页面上使用它可以使第一个视图加载速度更快。","spec":["151 × 92 占位符的 3 × 3 网格；第一行从头开始显示。滚动：0→110 像素，0.35–1.1 秒，110→225 像素，1.7–2.5 秒，225→0，3.5–4.5 秒（三次缓入缓出）。","当占位符的顶部边缘经过视口底部 (168 px) 上方时开始加载，每一列都比左侧的列晚 0.12 秒。","加载转圈（半径 11，每 0.8 秒转一圈）在占位符中心旋转 0.45 秒。","随后图片在 0.35 秒内从不透明度 0 淡入至 1（三次缓出）；尚未加载的占位区域显示图片图标。","离开视图底部的占位符将被重置为看不见。"],"source_summary":"As grey placeholders scroll into view, a spinner turns in each, and the images fade in as they arrive. The top row is loaded from the start.","source_spec":["A 3 × 3 grid of 151 × 92 placeholders; the first row is shown from the start. Scroll: 0→110 px at 0.35–1.1 s, 110→225 px at 1.7–2.5 s, 225→0 at 3.5–4.5 s (cubic ease-in-out).","Loading starts when a placeholder's top edge passes above the bottom of the viewport (168 px), with each column 0.12 s later than the one to its left.","For 0.45 s a spinner (radius 11, one turn per 0.8 s) turns in the placeholder's centre.","Then the image fades in 0→1 over 0.35 s (cubic ease-out). Unloaded placeholders show an image icon.","Placeholders that leave the bottom of the view are reset out of sight."],"source_use":"Use it on image-heavy pages to make the first view load faster."},"091":{"summary":"向下滚动到列表末尾会出现一个旋转器，然后添加三个新项目，以便可以继续阅读。","use":"将其用于人们应该继续阅读而无需分页的提要和新闻列表。","spec":["项目列表（331 × 44，半径 8，间隔 52），最后一个项目下方有一个加载转圈（半径 10，每 0.8 秒转一圈）。","滚动：38→116 像素，0.25–0.85 秒，116→194 像素，1.15–1.75 秒（三次缓入缓出）；它在看到列表末尾时停止。","2.6 秒添加 3 个项目：每项在 0.35 秒内不透明度从 0 增至 1，并从下方 10 像素处升起（三次缓出）；加载转圈移至新列表末尾。","每个周期前进三个项目（156 像素）。内容每三个项目重复一次，因此循环结束时看起来与开始时相同。"],"source_summary":"Scrolling down to the end of the list brings up a spinner, then three new items are added so reading can go on.","source_spec":["A list of items (331 × 44, radius 8, 52 apart) with a spinner (radius 10, one turn per 0.8 s) under the last item.","Scroll: 38→116 px at 0.25–0.85 s, 116→194 px at 1.15–1.75 s (cubic ease-in-out); it stops with the end of the list in view.","At 2.6 s three items are added: each fades 0→1 and rises from 10 px below over 0.35 s (cubic ease-out). The spinner moves to the new end.","Each cycle advances by three items (156 px). The content repeats every three items, so the end of the cycle looks the same as the start."],"source_use":"Use it for feeds and news lists that people should keep reading without paging."},"092":{"summary":"单击工作列表中的一张卡片会从左侧扫过一个橙色面板； URL 发生变化，面板退出到详细信息页面的右侧。 “返回列表”以同样的方式返回。","use":"在品牌网站和产品组合上使用它来将一个页面链接到下一个页面。","spec":["在 0.8 秒处点击一张卡片。在 0.9–1.3 秒时，面板（橙色、全视口、中心徽标）从左侧进入并覆盖所有内容（三次缓入缓出）。","1.3秒，覆盖时，页面和地址栏中的URL（/works→/works/02）切换。","在 1.4–1.85 秒处，面板向右退出（三次缓入缓出）。","3.0 秒点击“返回列表”：面板在 3.1–3.5 秒进入，3.5 秒切换页面，3.6–4.05 秒面板移出。","面板覆盖整个视口，包括页头。"],"source_summary":"Clicking a card in the work list sweeps an orange panel across from the left; the URL changes and the panel exits to the right on the detail page. \"Back to list\" returns the same way.","source_spec":["Click on a card at 0.8 s. At 0.9–1.3 s a panel (orange, full viewport, logo in the centre) enters from the left and covers everything (cubic ease-in-out).","At 1.3 s, while covered, the page and the URL in the address bar (/works → /works/02) switch.","At 1.4–1.85 s the panel exits to the right (cubic ease-in-out).","Click on \"← Back to list\" at 3.0 s: the panel enters at 3.1–3.5 s, the page switches at 3.5 s and the panel exits at 3.6–4.05 s.","The panel covers the whole viewport, header included."],"source_use":"Use it on brand sites and portfolios to link one page to the next."},"093":{"summary":"点击菜单中的“定价”，页面将向下滑动至定价部分；右下角的向上箭头将其滑回到顶部。","use":"当菜单或目录在同一页面内跳转时使用它，以便读者看到它们去了哪里。","spec":["在 0.9 秒处，单击“费用”菜单项；滚动在 0.95–2.0 秒内从 0→296 像素（1.05 秒，三次缓入缓出）。","停止位置 = 价格区块顶部（330 像素）− 固定页头高度（34 像素）。","页面滚动超过 60 像素后，右下角的圆形返回顶部按钮（半径 15）在接下来的 40 像素滚动距离内淡入。","在 3.1 秒时，按钮被点击；滚动在 3.15–4.2 秒内从 296→0（三次缓入缓出）。","当查看费用部分时，菜单中的“费用”会变成橙色。"],"source_summary":"Clicking \"Pricing\" in the menu glides the page down to the pricing section; the up arrow at the bottom right glides it back to the top.","source_spec":["At 0.9 s the \"Pricing\" menu item is clicked; scroll goes 0→296 px over 0.95–2.0 s (1.05 s, cubic ease-in-out).","Stop position = top of the pricing section (330 px) − fixed header height (34 px).","Once scroll passes 60 px, a round back-to-top button (radius 15) fades in over the next 40 px at the bottom right.","At 3.1 s that button is clicked; scroll goes 296→0 over 3.15–4.2 s (cubic ease-in-out).","While the pricing section is in view, \"Pricing\" in the menu turns orange."],"source_use":"Use it when a menu or table of contents jumps within the same page, so the reader sees where they went."},"094":{"summary":"深蓝色横带中，由橙色圆点分隔的服务名称不断向左滚动。","use":"用它来显示服务名称、客户徽标或充满活力的标语。","spec":["深蓝色横带高 58 像素，铺满视口宽度；文字为白色粗体，30 像素，字间距 1 像素。","一组包含“网页设计 / 品牌设计 / 动态设计 / 界面体验”四个词组，相距 64 像素，每个间隙有一个橙色圆点（半径 6）。","每个周期（4.8 秒）以恒定速度向左移动一组宽度。宽度根据当前文字和字体实际测量，并包含各词组后的 64 像素间隔；偏移按该宽度循环，因此没有可见接缝。","重复这组内容，直到填满视口宽度。"],"source_summary":"Inside a navy band, large service names separated by orange dots keep moving to the left without a gap.","source_spec":["Band: 58 tall, navy, full viewport width. Text: 30 px, heavy weight, 1 px letter spacing, white.","One set is four words (WEB DESIGN / BRANDING / MOTION / UI/UX), 64 px apart, with an orange dot (radius 6) in each gap.","Each cycle (4.8 s) moves left by the width of one set (about 881 px here) at constant speed. The set is measured and the offset wraps by that width, so there is no visible seam.","The set is repeated until the viewport width is filled."],"source_use":"Use it to show service names, client logos or a tagline with energy."},"095":{"summary":"在标题后面，橙色、浅橙色、蓝色和浅蓝色的柔和色块在圆圈中漂移，并以不同的方式混合在一起。","use":"使用它可以在英雄或标题后面添加运动和颜色，而无需使用照片。","spec":["基色 #FFF1EB，顶部有四个径向渐变（中心颜色 → 边缘透明，每个不透明度为 0.85）。","橙色（半径 230）、浅橙色 #FFB08F (210)、蓝色 (240)、浅蓝色 #9DB6FB (200)。","每个中心每 4.8 秒绕椭圆一次（x 半径 70、60、80、50；y 半径 30、40、30、35；起始角度 0、2.1、4.2、1.0 rad）。","上方有白色标题（34 像素）和按钮，只有渐变移动。"],"source_summary":"Behind the headline, soft patches of orange, light orange, blue and light blue drift in circles and keep blending differently.","source_spec":["Base colour #FFF1EB, with four radial gradients on top (centre colour → transparent at the edge, each at 0.85 opacity).","Orange (radius 230), light orange #FFB08F (210), blue (240), light blue #9DB6FB (200).","Each centre travels an ellipse once per 4.8 s (x radii 70, 60, 80, 50; y radii 30, 40, 30, 35; start angles 0, 2.1, 4.2, 1.0 rad).","A white headline (34 px) and a button sit on top; only the gradient moves."],"source_use":"Use it to add movement and colour behind a hero or heading without using a photo."},"096":{"summary":"在标题旁边，有一部手机、一个心形徽章和一个评级芯片，每一个都轻轻地晃动着，手机下方的阴影不断扩大和缩小。","use":"使用它为产品图像、应用程序模型或装饰图标添加安静的运动。","spec":["手机（92 × 132）：y = −8·sin(2πt/2.4)，每 2.4 秒上下浮动一次；正弦运动在两端减速。","心形徽章（半径 20）：y = −6·sin(2πt/1.6 + 1.2)。评级芯片（76 × 30）：y = −6·sin(2πt/2.4 + 2.4)。","手机下方的椭圆阴影横向半径为 54 像素、纵向半径为 6 像素；两个半径按 (1 + y/40) 缩放，不透明度为 0.16 × (1 + y/40)。手机升高时阴影缩小并变淡。","两个周期 2.4 秒和 1.6 秒均可整除 4.8 秒，所以循环无缝。"],"source_summary":"Next to the headline, a phone, a heart badge and a rating chip each bob gently out of step, and the shadow under the phone grows and shrinks.","source_spec":["Phone (92 × 132): y = −8·sin(2πt/2.4), one bob per 2.4 s; a sine slows at both ends.","Heart badge (radius 20): y = −6·sin(2πt/1.6 + 1.2). Rating chip (76 × 30): y = −6·sin(2πt/2.4 + 2.4).","Shadow under the phone (54 × 6 ellipse): size and opacity scale by (1 + y/40), so it shrinks and fades as the phone rises.","Both periods (2.4 s and 1.6 s) divide 4.8 s, so the loop has no seam."],"source_use":"Use it to add quiet motion to product images, app mockups or decorative icons."},"097":{"summary":"太阳从画面外移动到人头的正后方；人物周围出现一条薄薄的明亮边缘，淡淡的温暖薄雾覆盖了框架，面向相机的一侧变暗。","use":"适用于通风、发光的肖像或任何应该感觉沐浴在光线中的图像。","spec":["场景 1：地平线位于 y = 150，前方是一名头肩人物（头部中心 x = 270、y = 78，半径 29 像素，无五官和头发）。亮部为纯琥珀色 #FFC75A，阴影为纯色 #33405A。","太阳半径 20 像素，从画面左上外侧 (x 40, y −40) 移至头部正后方 (x 270, y 56)；叠加半径为太阳 2.6 倍和 1.7 倍的纯色光环，颜色 #FFE3A3，不透明度分别为 35% 和 60%。","轮廓：用 7 px 的线对图形进行描边，然后填充，在其外部留下 3.5 px 的亮边","人物颜色 #4D5A75 → #33405A；天空 #FAF9F7 → #FFF4DC；整个画面叠加不透明度 22% 的 #FFE3A3。","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The sun moves from outside the frame to directly behind the person's head; a thin bright edge appears around the figure, a pale warm haze covers the frame and the side facing the camera darkens.","source_spec":["Scene 1: a head-and-shoulders figure in front of a horizon at y 150 (head centre x 270, y 78, radius 29 px, no face or hair). light is a flat amber #FFC75A shape, shadow a flat #33405A one","Sun: radius 20 px, from outside the frame (top left, x 40, y −40) to directly behind the head (x 270, y 56), with flat rings of 2.6× and 1.7× the radius (#FFE3A3 at 35% and 60%)","Outline: the figure is stroked with a 7 px line and then filled, leaving a 3.5 px bright edge outside it","Figure #4D5A75 → #33405A; sky #FAF9F7 → #FFF4DC; #FFE3A3 laid over the whole frame at 22%","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"For airy, glowing portraits or any image that should feel bathed in light."},"098":{"summary":"周围环境变暗，人身后左右两盏灯只沿着头部和肩膀的两侧画出细细的明亮边缘；右下角的平面图显示了两个灯的位置。","use":"将人物或产品从深色背景中分离出来并显示其形状。","spec":["场景 1： y 150 处地平线前的头肩图形（头部中心 x 270，y 78，半径 29 像素，没有脸或头发）。","背景由亮变暗（天空 #2B2D33，地面 #24252A）；人物颜色从 #4D5A75 变为 #1F2128。","明亮边缘：琥珀色 #FFC75A 中图形的两个副本，左右移动 3.5 像素，向上移动 2.5 像素，放置在深色图形后面（3.5 像素宽边缘）","右下平面图（66×66 px）：从上方（后、左、右）看±135°的灯光；右上角读数“±135°”","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"The surroundings go dark and two lights behind the person, left and right, draw thin bright edges only along both sides of the head and shoulders; the plan at the bottom right shows where the two lights are.","source_spec":["Scene 1: a head-and-shoulders figure in front of a horizon at y 150 (head centre x 270, y 78, radius 29 px, no face or hair). ","Background: light scene → dark scene (sky #2B2D33, ground #24252A); figure #4D5A75 → #1F2128","Bright edges: two copies of the figure in amber #FFC75A, shifted 3.5 px left and right and 2.5 px up, placed behind the dark figure (3.5 px wide edges)","Plan at the bottom right (66×66 px): lights at ±135° seen from above (behind, left and right); top-right readout \"±135°\"","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"To separate a person or product from a dark background and show its shape."},"099":{"summary":"由于曝光设置为明亮的傍晚天空，人、建筑物、灯和树都变成扁平的黑色形状，没有细节，只有天空保持明亮。","use":"当形状和姿势应该承载画面时，在日落或明亮的窗户上。","spec":["场景 1： y 150 处地平线前的头肩图形（头部中心 x 270，y 78，半径 29 像素，没有脸或头发）。","天空顶部从 #FAF9F7 变为 #FFEDC4，地平线附近为 #FFCF73 色带（y = 92–150）。","天空以外的部分变为 #2A2D36，远山为 #4A4546，人物为 #22252D。","太阳：半径 20 像素，x 404，从 y 60 下沉到 y 128，一半被山隐藏","右上读数：±0.0 EV → −2.0 EV","时间：效果在 0.4–1.4 秒进入，保持至 4.0 秒，并在 4.8 秒前消失；单次循环 5 秒，采用三次缓入缓出（约 cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)）。"],"source_summary":"As the exposure is set for the bright evening sky, the person, buildings, lamp and tree turn into flat black shapes with no detail and only the sky stays bright.","source_spec":["Scene 1: a head-and-shoulders figure in front of a horizon at y 150 (head centre x 270, y 78, radius 29 px, no face or hair). ","Sky: #FAF9F7 → #FFEDC4 at the top and a #FFCF73 band near the horizon (y 92–150)","Everything but the sky becomes #2A2D36, the far hills #4A4546; the figure #22252D","Sun: radius 20 px at x 404, sinking from y 60 to y 128, half hidden by the hills","Top-right readout: ±0.0 EV → −2.0 EV","Timing: the effect comes in from 0.4 s to 1.4 s, holds until 4.0 s and is gone again by 4.8 s (one pass = 5 s, cubic ease-in-out (about cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)))"],"source_use":"When the shape and pose should carry the picture, against a sunset or a bright window."}};
